勾选行前面的方框来选中，可以勾一项或多项，再打开位置、压缩或删除；单击行的其他地方不会选中，双击文件夹往里点；按住鼠标上下拖可以一次勾上连着的几行。系统文件夹、软件安装文件夹、C 盘个人文件夹和搬家后的数据带小锁，不能在这里删。	Tick the box at the start of a row to select it, one row or several, then open its location, compress or delete. Clicking elsewhere on a row doesn't select it; double-click a folder to open it; hold the mouse button and drag up or down to tick a run of rows. System folders, app installation folders, personal folders on C: and moved data have a lock and can't be deleted here.
\n\n按快速扫描的结果，实际能腾出 {0} 到 {1}：其中 {2} 是硬链接，同一份文件在别处还有名字，那些名字还在就不会腾出空间。	\n\nAccording to the fast scan, this frees between {0} and {1}: {2} of it is hard links, files that still have names elsewhere, and their space is freed only once all their names are gone.
\n\n按快速扫描的结果，这些实际只占 {0}（压缩、稀疏或只在云端的文件比文件大小占得少），删掉腾出的是这么多。	\n\nAccording to the fast scan, these take only {0} on disk (compressed, sparse or cloud-only files take less than their size), so that is how much deleting them frees.
当前：读不到还原点的信息	Current: restore point information is not available
当前：这块盘没有还原点（可能没有开系统保护）	Current: no restore points on this drive (System Protection may be off)
当前：{0} 个还原点和卷影副本，占 {1}，最多可以用到 {2}	Current: {0} restore points and shadow copies using {1}; the limit is {2}
当前：正在读取…	Current: reading…
没有上限	no limit
打不开系统保护设置	Couldn't open System Protection
查重复文件时让着其他程序：已打开	Give way to other programs when finding duplicates: on
查重复文件时让着其他程序：已关闭	Give way to other programs when finding duplicates: off
设置：显示内容已恢复默认	Settings: display restored to defaults
换	Change
换成「{0}」外观？	Change the appearance to "{0}"?
本工具会关闭，然后用新的外观重新打开。	ClearC will close and reopen with the new appearance.
蓝屏、驱动出错（显卡驱动重置等）和程序崩溃时留下的调试文件，只对排查问题的工程师有用	Debug files left by blue screens, driver errors (such as graphics driver resets) and program crashes. Only useful to engineers investigating problems
恢复默认显示	Restore default display
打开系统保护设置	Open System Protection
已用空间都花在哪：文件实际占用、文件表（MFT）、硬链接、压缩和稀疏文件，以及为什么和按文件大小相加对不上	Where the used space goes: file data on disk, the file table (MFT), hard links, compressed and sparse files, and why it differs from adding up file sizes
页面、按钮、列和说明全部恢复成默认显示。外观、语言和扫描设置不变	Show all pages, buttons, columns and descriptions again. Appearance, language and scan settings stay as they are
切换语言	Switch language
外观	Appearance
选中这一层列出的全部项目；再点一下全部取消	Select everything listed at this level; click again to clear
在资源管理器里显示	Show in File Explorer
复制路径	Copy path
打开文件夹	Open folder
设置	Settings
「清理 C 盘」「空间地图」「帮助」和「设置」一直显示。关掉的页面只是不在左侧列出，里面的设置、搬家记录和自动提醒都照旧。	"Clean up C:", "Space map", "Help" and "Settings" are always shown. A hidden page is only left out of the list on the left; its settings, moved folders and reminders keep working.
关掉只是不在空间地图上显示这个开关；快速扫描本身在下面「扫描和查重」里开关。	Turning this off only hides the switch from the space map; the fast scan itself is turned on or off under "Scanning and duplicates" below.
占比条	Size bars
占这一层的百分之几。	The share of this level, in percent.
右上角的「快速扫描」开关	"Fast scan" switch at the top right
名字下面的详细信息	Details under the name
名字右边的蓝色横条，一眼看出谁大。	The blue bar to the right of the name, to see at a glance what is biggest.
外观和语言	Appearance and language
外观、语言，以及界面上显示哪些内容。用不上的页面、按钮和说明可以关掉，界面更清爽；随时可以回来打开，不会丢任何设置和记录。	Appearance, language and what the window shows. Pages, buttons and descriptions you don't use can be hidden for a cleaner look; turn them back on here at any time, and no settings or records are lost.
外观和语言也可以在这一页上面改；「使用反馈」和「运行记录」也在「帮助」页里。	Appearance and language can also be changed at the top of this page; "Feedback" and "Run log" are also on the "Help" page.
实际占用和硬链接	Size on disk and hard links
左下角的按钮	Buttons at the bottom left
左侧显示的页面	Pages on the left
快速扫描时在名字下面注明：压缩、稀疏和只在云端（OneDrive 等）的文件实际占的盘比文件大小小；WinSxS 这类文件夹里很多文件和系统其他位置是同一份（硬链接），删了也不腾空间。	With the fast scan, note under the name when compressed, sparse and cloud-only (OneDrive and the like) files take less space than their size, and when files in folders such as WinSxS are the same files as elsewhere in Windows (hard links), so deleting them frees nothing.
扫描和查重	Scanning and duplicates
换了以后本工具会关闭，再用新的语言打开。	ClearC closes and reopens in the new language after you change it.
文件个数、最近修改时间、比上次扫描变了多少、链接指向哪里。	Number of files, last modified date, change since the last scan, and where a link points.
查重复文件时让着其他程序	Give way to other programs when finding duplicates
每一行前面显示一个复选框（和资源管理器「查看」里的「项目复选框」一样）：只有点方框才选中或取消，单击行的其他地方不会选中，按 Esc 全部取消。关掉就照 Windows 列表原来的做法：单击选中一行，按住 Ctrl、Shift 多选。开不开都可以按住鼠标（左键或右键）上下拖，一次选中连着的几行。	Show a check box at the start of each row (like "Item check boxes" under "View" in File Explorer): only clicking the box selects or clears a row, clicking elsewhere on the row doesn't select it, and Esc clears them all. Turned off, the list works the usual Windows way: a click selects one row, Ctrl or Shift selects several. Either way, you can hold the left or right mouse button and drag up or down to select a run of rows.
每一页标题下面那行灰色的说明文字。用熟了可以关掉，列表能多显示几行。	The grey line of description under each page title. Once you know your way around, turn it off to fit a few more rows in the lists.
界面上显示什么	What the window shows
界面语言	Language
百分比	Percentages
直接读取 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多，还能看出实际占用和硬链接。少数安全软件对直接读盘会提示，可以关掉，改为逐个文件夹扫描。清理、搬家、软件管理统计大小时也按这个设置。	Read the NTFS file table (MFT) directly: much faster than opening every folder, and it also shows size on disk and hard links. A few security programs warn about direct disk reads; turn this off to scan folder by folder instead. Clean up, Moved folders and Apps follow this setting when measuring sizes.
系统还原点（卷影副本）	Restore points (shadow copies)
装更新、装驱动之前 Windows 会自动建还原点，系统出问题时可以退回去。还原点放在 C 盘的 System Volume Information 里（空间地图里带小锁的那个文件夹），只记改动过的部分，占的空间有上限，到了上限会自动删掉最旧的。觉得占得多，可以在 Windows 的「系统保护」里点「配置」，调小「最大使用量」，或者删掉这块盘的全部还原点（删了就不能再退回去）。本工具不直接删还原点。	Windows creates restore points automatically before installing updates and drivers, so you can go back if something breaks. They are kept in System Volume Information on C: (the folder with a lock in the space map), store only what changed, and have a size limit; when it is reached, the oldest are deleted automatically. If they take too much space, open Windows' "System Protection", click "Configure" and lower "Max Usage", or delete all restore points for the drive (you can't go back after that). ClearC never deletes restore points itself.
读文件时用 Windows 的后台模式，磁盘和内存都排在其他程序后面：不拖慢正在用的程序，也不把它们缓存在内存里的数据挤掉。电脑空闲时速度基本不受影响，同时在做别的事时查得慢一些。	Read files in Windows' background mode, behind other programs for both disk and memory: the programs you are using don't slow down, and the data they keep cached in memory isn't pushed out. When the PC is idle the speed is about the same; while you do other things, the search takes longer.
跟随系统会照 Windows 设置里「选择应用模式」来。换了以后本工具会关闭，再自动打开。	Follow Windows uses the "Choose your app mode" setting. ClearC closes and reopens after you change it.
页面标题下的说明	Descriptions under page titles
项目复选框	Item check boxes
'@
# 英文的帮助页（整页替换中文的那一页）
$script:helpEnXaml = @'
    <!-- ==================== Help: instructions, safety notice, feedback ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageHelp" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="HelpScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel Margin="30,24,30,28" MaxWidth="880" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
          <TextBlock Text="Help" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="How to use ClearC, the safety notice, and how to report problems."/>
          <Border x:Name="RiskCard" Background="#FFF6F6" BorderBrush="#F3C4C8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="24,20,24,20" Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#D70015" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,1,14,0"/>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="Safety notice" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" Foreground="#A1000F"/>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>Deleting removes files from your PC. Files that aren't moved to the Recycle Bin usually can't be recovered after deletion, which may lead to data loss.</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>Before each deletion, make sure you really no longer need these files and that deleting them won't cause you any loss. Back up important files first.</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>ClearC only does what you choose. For any data loss or other damage caused by deleting or moving files with ClearC, </Run><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#A1000F">you are solely responsible; the developer accepts no liability</Run><Run>.</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>By continuing to use ClearC, you confirm that you understand and accept these risks.</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,18,22,22" Margin="0,16,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE768;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><TextBlock Text="Getting started" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
              <Grid Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="10"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="1" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="One-click cleanup" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>On the "Clean up C:" page, click "One-click cleanup". ClearC scans first, then handles the items selected by default: it deletes caches, temporary files and logs, and moves chat history from WeChat, QQ and similar apps to the other drive with the most free space. Before it starts, it lists every item for you to confirm.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="2" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Choose for yourself" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Click "Scan" first, choose "Delete", "Move to another drive" or "Skip" on each row, then click "Run selected" at the bottom right.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="3" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Find duplicates" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Switch to "Duplicates" on the left, choose the locations and criteria, then click "Start search". After checking the selection, click "Delete checked files".</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="4" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="See what takes space" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Switch to "Space map" on the left, choose C: and click "Scan", then double-click folders to look inside, level by level.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
              </Grid>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <DockPanel Margin="2,30,2,10">
            <Button x:Name="BtnHelpExpand" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="Expand all" FontSize="12.5" VerticalAlignment="Bottom"/>
            <TextBlock Text="Features" Style="{StaticResource HelpListHead}"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <StackPanel x:Name="HelpSections">
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Clean up C:" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="Delete caches and temporary files; move chat history to another drive as a whole" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="What the list holds" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="150"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="Safe to clean" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Caches, temporary files and logs, which apps rebuild automatically.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="Needs confirmation" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Items that come at a cost. They are skipped by default; read the description before selecting them. For example, after deleting Windows.old you can't go back to your previous version of Windows, and after emptying the Recycle Bin you can't get back files you deleted earlier.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC"><TextBlock Text="Move only" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>"Chat history" and "Other movable folders": this data can't be deleted, only moved as a whole to another drive.</Run></TextBlock>
                </Grid>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Easy to see after a scan"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The top of the list shows how many items were found and how many groups they fall into; each group heading also shows its item count. When there are many items, scroll down the page; a hint at the bottom tells you how many more are below.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Analyze usage"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Opens the "Space map" and scans drive C:, so you can see which folders and files take up the most space.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Which caches are cleaned"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Dozens: Windows' own temporary files, update cache, crash dumps and logs; the web cache of Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, 360, QQ and other browsers; graphics shader caches; Steam and Epic caches; Adobe media cache; the caches of Teams, Discord, Slack, VS Code, Spotify, NetEase Cloud Music and more; and the download caches of pip, npm, NuGet, Go, Rust and other developer tools. Whatever is on your PC shows up after a scan.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Only caches are deleted; cookies, history, passwords, settings and saved data are left alone.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Items that are slow to download or regenerate (the NuGet global packages folder, Gradle, Maven, JetBrains indexes, Unreal Engine cache and so on) are under "Needs confirmation" and skipped by default.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Driver leftovers, broken shortcuts, event logs"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>All under "Needs confirmation" and skipped by default: installer files that graphics and OEM drivers unpack into the root of C:; Start menu shortcuts whose program no longer exists (the desktop is left alone); Windows event logs (engineers read them when investigating problems; skip if unsure).</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Orphaned Windows Installer packages"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Under "Needs confirmation". Packages in C:\Windows\Installer that no installed app or patch refers to any more, often several GB, detected the same way PatchCleaner does. Skipped by default; read the description before selecting it.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Your own folders and exclusions"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>On the "Settings" page under "Cleanup list" ("Custom items" at the top right of the page takes you there). Folders you add form their own group; their contents are deleted and the folders themselves kept. Excluded folders are never touched and not counted in the estimates.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Nothing in your personal folders is ever deleted"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Cleanup never deletes any file in your personal folders on C: (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Pictures, Videos, Music, Favorites, OneDrive and so on); even if you select one by mistake, it is skipped automatically. Desktop and Downloads offer only "Move to another drive" (your files are kept as they are), and they are skipped by default.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Moving chat history" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Supported apps"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>WeChat (new and old versions), QQ, WeCom, Tencent Meeting, Feishu and DingTalk, plus Telegram, Discord, Slack, Signal, LINE, Viber, KakaoTalk and Zoom. The scan lists whichever of these are installed on your PC.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Apps installed from the Microsoft Store (such as WhatsApp and Microsoft Teams) are managed by Windows; use "Move" in Windows Settings → Apps to move them.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Where to"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The local drive with the most free space is chosen by default. You can pick a different drive from the drop-down list, or click "Choose folder…". Only local hard drives can be used; network drives, cloud drives and USB flash drives can't.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="How moving works"/>
                  <WrapPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="1" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Close the apps using it" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="2" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Copy to the target drive" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="3" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Verify both sides" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="4" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Replace the original with a link" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="5" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Delete the original folder on C:" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                  </WrapPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,1,0,0"><Run>Afterwards only a link remains at the original location on C:, taking up almost no space. When an app opens the original path, Windows redirects reads and writes to the target drive, so the app notices no change and you don't need to change any settings.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Deleted only when nothing is missing"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>If the chat app is still open, you'll be asked to quit it first. After copying, ClearC verifies the number of files and their size on both sides again, and deletes the original folder on C: only if not a single file is missing.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>If the original folder is still in use by another program, the copy already made is kept; quit the related apps and run the move again, and only changed files are copied, so it finishes quickly.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#FFF8EC" BorderBrush="#F5E1BC" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#B25E00" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Leave the CDriveMoved folder on the target drive alone"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>If you delete, rename or move it, WeChat, QQ and other apps won't be able to find their chat history and files.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8C8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Duplicates" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="Find files with identical content; keep one copy and delete the rest" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Search criteria" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Search locations"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Click a chip to select or deselect it. Use "Add folder…" to add your own locations; those with a small × can be removed. System folders, program folders and development environments are skipped automatically.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="File type and size"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Only the selected types and size range are searched; the narrower the range, the faster the search. Choose "Custom" to enter a size yourself.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What counts as a duplicate"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>By default, both the file name and the content must match. With "Content only", files with different names but the same content also count. Either way, the content must be identical byte for byte.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Comparison method"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>"Quick" reads only samples of large files; "Full comparison" reads every file completely, which is slower but more thorough.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>In Quick mode, files are still fully verified byte for byte before deletion, and nothing is deleted if there is any difference.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Results and deleting" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Which copy to keep"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Each group lists all copies. By default the newest copy in each group is kept and the rest are selected; you can instead keep the oldest, prefer keeping copies outside C:, or select them yourself. "Open location" shows the file in File Explorer.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Recycle Bin"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Files are moved to the Recycle Bin by default, so anything deleted by mistake can be restored from there. Clearing "Move to Recycle Bin" deletes files permanently, and they can't be recovered.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Marked &quot;Caution&quot;"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>These copies are in program folders or WeChat data; check them carefully before deleting.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Personal folders on C: are protected"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>"Don't delete files in personal folders on C:" is on by default. Copies in Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Pictures, Videos, Music and similar locations show a small lock and can't be selected or deleted; only copies elsewhere are deleted. If you really want to delete copies in these locations, clear that checkbox and confirm again.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE7B8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Save space (without deleting files)" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="Compress or relocate; every file stays where you can use it" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <Grid Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="10"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="System compression (CompactOS)"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Built into Windows: stores system files compressed, usually saving 2 to 4 GB without affecting everyday use.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Page file"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Moves pagefile.sys to another drive, freeing a few GB on C:. It takes effect after a restart, and you can restore the Windows default at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Hibernation file"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>"Keep Fast Startup only" shrinks hiberfil.sys by about half; "Turn off hibernation" removes it entirely.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Restore points"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Shows how many restore points there are, how much space they take and the most they may use. To lower the limit or delete restore points, click "Open System Protection" and change it in Windows' own settings; ClearC never deletes restore points itself.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Compress folders"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS compression: files open and edit as usual; they just take up less space. Good for documents, code and old projects.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Virtual disks"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>WSL and Docker virtual disks don't shrink when you delete files inside them; compacting them gives the space back to Windows. Android emulator and virtual machine folders can be moved to another drive as a whole.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Merge duplicate files"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>On the "Duplicates" page, click "Merge into one copy". Duplicate files on the same drive then take up the space of just one copy, while the file stays in every location. After merging, editing the file in one location changes it in all the others, so this suits photos, videos and installers you won't change again.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="OneDrive online-only"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Synced files keep a local copy. Once "online-only" they stay in the cloud, still show in File Explorer and download when opened. Nothing is deleted; files marked "Always keep on this device" are left alone.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="8" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Reserved storage"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The 7 GB or so Windows sets aside for updates. Turning it off gives the space back; Windows borrows free space when updating, and you can turn it back on at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="8" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Component store analysis"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lets Windows work out the actual size of WinSxS, how much is reclaimable and whether cleanup is advisable, before you run the DISM cleanup.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="10" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Small crash dumps"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Blue screens save only a 256 KB small dump instead of a MEMORY.DMP of several GB. Enough to tell which driver failed; automatic dumps can be restored at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="10" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Temp folder on another drive"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Points the current user's TEMP to another drive so future temporary files don't take space on C:. Applies after you sign out and back in; restore the default if an installer doesn't like it.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="12" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="3" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Move WSL to another drive"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Uses WSL's own wsl --manage --move to move a whole distribution; it works as before afterwards. Needs WSL 2.5 or later.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                </Grid>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE9D9;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Space map" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="See which folders and files take up the most space" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Scanning" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Start a scan"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Choose a drive and click "Scan" to measure the size of every folder. It only looks and changes nothing.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why scanning is fast"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>On NTFS drives (C: almost always is), ClearC reads the file table on the disk (the MFT) directly, so hundreds of thousands of files usually take seconds rather than minutes.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>The result is checked against a direct folder listing. If it does not match or the table cannot be read (not NTFS, not enough permission and so on), ClearC goes back to scanning folder by folder, with several threads at once (more on SSDs, fewer on hard disks).</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Scanning again while ClearC is still open only updates what changed, using the Windows change journal.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Reading the file table also sees folders that a folder-by-folder scan cannot open (such as System Volume Information), so the totals of the two methods can differ slightly.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Prefer no direct disk reads"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>A few security programs warn about direct disk reads. Untick "Fast scan" at the top right to scan folder by folder from then on; Clean up, Moved folders and Apps follow the same setting.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Read once, shared by every page"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>"Clean up C:", "Moved folders" and "Apps" also read the C: file table once to look up how big each folder is. These numbers are only for display and estimates; when something is actually deleted or moved, every item is measured and checked again, never decided from this result.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Browsing" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Drill down"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Double-click a folder to open the next level, and click "Up one level" to go back. The blue bar on each row shows how large it is within the current level.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>When a level holds a lot (WinSxS has tens of thousands of items), only the 500 largest are listed and the rest are combined into the last row; "Open location" shows everything in File Explorer.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Treemap"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Draws the folders and files of the current level as blocks; the bigger the block, the more space it takes, so the largest ones stand out at a glance. Click to select; double-click a folder to open it.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Find files"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Searches the files of 1 MB or more recorded during the scan, largest first.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Filter by size, how long since they were modified (for example 6+ months), type (videos, archives and installers, disc images and virtual disks…) and name; names can use * and ?, for example *.mp4.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Tick "Only in the current folder" to search just the folder you opened.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Tick "Only in chat apps" to search only the chat data of WeChat, QQ, WeCom, Feishu, DingTalk, Telegram and others, and see which videos and files take up the space.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EEF5FD" BorderBrush="#D2E3FA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE946;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Files in chat data are view-only"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Here they can only be viewed and located, not deleted. To free up space, move the whole chat data to another drive on the "Moved folders" page.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Since last scan"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lists folders that grew or shrank by more than 100 MB since the previous scan, so you can find what has been slowly eating up your space; double-click a row to open that folder. The folder list also shows changes such as "+2.1 GB since last scan".</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Export"/>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Export CSV</Run><Run>: saves the list you see (folders, found files or the comparison) as a CSV file you can open, sort and share in Excel.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Export report</Run><Run>: saves the whole drive as a web page with a treemap, the largest folders and files, space by file type and changes since the last scan; press Ctrl+P in the browser to save it as PDF.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Selecting and acting" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,10,0,0"><Run>Selected rows can be opened in File Explorer, compressed (keeps files) or deleted. Each row has a box at its start, like "Item check boxes" in File Explorer:</Run></TextBlock>
                <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="200"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Click the box" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Selects or clears that row; tick one row or several</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Click elsewhere on a row" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Doesn't select it</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Double-click a folder" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Opens the next level</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Shift + click a box" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Ticks every row from the last one you ticked to this one</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="4" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Drag with either button" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>Drag up or down to tick a run of rows at once; after a right-button drag, the right-click menu opens when you let go</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="5" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Right-click a row" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>The menu acts on that row only, or on all ticked rows if you right-click a ticked one</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="6" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Esc" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Clears them all</Run></TextBlock>
                </Grid>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Prefer no check boxes"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Turn them off in "Settings" to get the usual Windows list behavior: a click selects one row, Ctrl or Shift selects several.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Delete"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Choose "Move to Recycle Bin" (can be restored) or "Delete permanently" (frees space immediately); either way, you must tick the confirmation box first.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#F5F5F7" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Items with a small lock can't be deleted here"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>System folders, app installation folders (uninstall those on the "Apps" page), personal folders on C:, and moved data (the CDriveMoved folder).</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Real space used" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Size on disk and hard links"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>With the fast scan, the line under each name notes how little compressed, sparse and cloud-only (OneDrive and the like) files really take, and how much of folders such as WinSxS is hard links.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>A hard link means the same file also has a name elsewhere, so deleting this name frees nothing.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Disk health cards"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>One card per drive at the top of the page: a usage bar, health status, and for SSDs temperature, wear and hours powered on, colored by level (green normal, amber worth watching, red a problem). Click a card to choose that drive. Read from Windows' storage reliability counters, read-only; it can be turned off in Settings.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Space breakdown"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Click "Space breakdown" to see how the used space splits into file data, the file table (MFT) and the rest, and why it differs from adding up file sizes. Deleting also tells you how much space you will really get back.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE71D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Apps" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="See how much each app takes; uninstall, clean up leftovers, move to another drive" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="App list"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lists all installed apps (including Microsoft Store apps), sorted by size from largest to smallest. You can show only apps installed on C:, or search by name.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Uninstall"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Opens the app's own uninstaller; just follow its prompts.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check leftovers"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>When the uninstall is done, come back here and click "Check leftovers". ClearC looks for folders named after the app that remain after uninstalling, and moves them to the Recycle Bin once you confirm.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>A publisher's top-level folder (such as Tencent or Microsoft) is never treated as leftovers, and neither are built-in Windows programs.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Move to another drive"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>For apps installed on C:, the whole installation folder can be moved to another drive, leaving a link at the original location on C:. Shortcuts, the Start menu, uninstalling and automatic updates all keep working, with no reinstall needed.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>The copy on C: is deleted only after ClearC verifies that the files on both sides are identical; if the app is running, you'll be asked before it's closed.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Not suitable for moving"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>ClearC tells you why and never forces it:</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Apps with system services or drivers (antivirus, VPN, drivers, remote control and so on)</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Apps that add right-click menus to File Explorer, and input methods</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Microsoft's own software (Office, Visual Studio and so on) and built-in Windows components</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Apps whose folder contains links or files compressed with Windows compression (they could be missed when copying)</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Apps that don't state which folder they're installed in</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Microsoft Store apps: use "Move" in Windows Settings → Apps</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="After moving"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Moved apps appear in "Moved folders", where you can "Move back to C:" at any time. When an app gets a major upgrade later, a few installers will reinstall it on C:; just move it again then.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Leftovers"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Finds folders that uninstalled apps may have left behind: the name matches no installed app, no program is using them, nothing changed for a month, and they are at least 1 MB. It is only a guess, so click "Open location" first; they go to the Recycle Bin and can be restored.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check for updates"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Uses Windows' own winget to see which installed apps have a newer version; it goes online only when you click. Apps with an update show "Update available" in the list and get an "Update" button, which runs winget in a terminal window so you can see the progress and prompts. You can also update everything at once.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Startup, scheduled tasks, context menu" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Startup"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The same sources as "Startup apps" in Task Manager: the Run keys in the registry and the two Startup folders. After "Disable", the program no longer starts with Windows; it is not deleted and can be enabled again at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Scheduled tasks"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lists only third-party tasks (Windows' own tasks live in the Microsoft folder and are not listed). A disabled task no longer runs on schedule and can be enabled again at any time. ClearC's own tasks are switched on the "Reminders" page.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Context menu"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lists only third-party extensions added to the File Explorer right-click menu; built-in ones are not listed. Disabling writes the entry to Windows' "Shell Extensions\Blocked" list and applies to newly opened windows; the app itself keeps working.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Moved folders" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="Move several items at once; check that moved folders are OK" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Can be moved" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Move several at once"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Automatically lists what can still be moved off C:, in three groups (chat histories, apps installed on C:, and other folders), each with its size. Tick the items, choose the target drive at the bottom right and click "Move to another drive".</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Before starting, every item is listed, along with any apps that need to be closed first.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Apps that shouldn't be moved"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Apps with system services or drivers, apps that add right-click menu entries to File Explorer, Microsoft's own software and the like are listed separately under "Apps that shouldn't be moved" with the reason, and can't be ticked.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Chat apps installed from the Microsoft Store (such as WhatsApp and Microsoft Teams) are managed by Windows; a note at the bottom of the page explains how to move them with "Move" in Windows Settings.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="Moved" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,10,0,0"><Run>Every folder moved to another drive is listed here, each with its current status:</Run></TextBlock>
                <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="110"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="OK" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>The data is on the target drive, and the original location on C: holds only a link to it, which takes no space on C:. Apps work as usual. If needed, you can "Move back to C:": the data is copied back, the link is removed only after the copy is verified, and finally the copy on the target drive is deleted.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FDEBEC"><TextBlock Text="Broken link" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#C0101C" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>The target drive was unplugged or its drive letter changed. Plug the drive back in (or change the drive letter back) to fix it. If a copy with the same name is found on another drive, use "Repair link" to point the link to it.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="Incomplete" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>The original folder is still on C:, and there is a copy on the target drive. You can move it again under "Can be moved" (only the differences are copied), or delete the extra copy.</Run></TextBlock>
                </Grid>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE823;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Reminders" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="A low-space reminder and a weekly cleanup; both are off by default" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Low-space reminder"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>When turned on, ClearC checks drive C: 2 minutes after each sign-in and again at noon every day. If free space falls below the value you set (20 GB by default), a reminder appears at the bottom right of the screen, at most once a day; if there is enough space, nothing is shown.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Junk reminder"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>You can set a second limit (for example 2 GB): the check also measures the temporary files, caches and logs under "Safe to clean" and reminds you when they exceed it, at most once a day. It only measures; nothing is deleted.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Scheduled cleanup"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>When turned on, temporary files, caches and logs are cleaned up at the time you choose (a day of the week or every day, at 12:30 PM). It doesn't move anything, doesn't empty the Recycle Bin and doesn't touch personal folders or the folders you added yourself; files in use are simply skipped.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Storage Sense"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The page says whether Windows' own Storage Sense is on. If it is, it also cleans temporary files and the Recycle Bin on a schedule; it doesn't conflict with the cleanup here, both simply run.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Space on C: over time"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Free space is recorded each time you open ClearC and at each scheduled check, and shown as a bar chart of the last 30 days.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EEF5FD" BorderBrush="#D2E3FA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE946;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="No need to keep ClearC open"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Windows Task Scheduler runs ClearC on schedule for both, and you don't need to set it to start with Windows either. The task names start with CleanC. Both are off by default, and turning a switch off deletes its task.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Keep it in one place"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Please keep ClearC in a fixed location (such as D:\Tools) and don't delete it. If you move it, open it once and the tasks will switch to the new location automatically.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE81C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Activity log" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="Every change is recorded, and you can search it" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What is recorded"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Every change made by deleting, moving, merging, compressing, uninstalling and system settings: when, what was done, to which file or folder, and the result. Only the actions are recorded; file contents are never saved.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Finding records"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Filter by category (Delete, Move, Merge…), time (7 days, 30 days, All) and keyword. The logs are plain .txt files, one per month; click "Open log folder" to read them directly in Notepad.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="How long records are kept"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>6 months by default; you can change this to anywhere from 1 month to 2 years, or keep them forever.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Each time you open ClearC, records older than the retention period are deleted automatically and can't be recovered.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>When you shorten the retention period, ClearC first tells you the date before which records will be deleted.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE713;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="Settings" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="Appearance, language and what the window shows" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Mode"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Three modes decide how much the window shows. ClearC asks once on first start; after that, change it at the top of Settings at any time. Switching never loses settings or records. The current mode is written under the version number at the bottom left; click it to go to Settings.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Home user</Run><Run>: Clean C:, Save space, Space map, Apps and Help. The cleanup list only has common caches and temporary files that apps rebuild; items with a cost are still skipped by default.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Engineer</Run><Run>: adds Duplicates, Moves, Reminders and the operation log; find files, compare with last time, export and compress in the space map; page file, restore points, compressed folders, virtual disks and merge duplicates in Save space; startup, leftover folders, update check and move in Apps; developer tool caches and driver leftovers in the cleanup list.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Developer and IT</Run><Run>: everything. Adds scheduled tasks, context menu, reserved storage, component store analysis, crash dumps, temp folder location, custom cleanup list and exclusions, the fast scan switch, space breakdown, scan check, the run log, and items such as orphaned Installer packages, event logs and NuGet / Gradle / Maven / JetBrains caches.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Appearance and language"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Light, Dark or Follow Windows (the "Choose your app mode" setting), and 中文 or English. ClearC closes and reopens after you change them. "Appearance" and "Switch language" at the bottom left change them too.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What the window shows"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Pages you don't use, the buttons at the bottom left, the descriptions under page titles, and the space map's check boxes, bars, percentages, details and "Fast scan" switch can all be hidden.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Anything hidden can be turned back on at any time, and its settings and records are kept; "Restore default display" brings everything back at once.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Fast scan"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Reads the NTFS file table (MFT) directly, which is much faster than going through every folder and also shows the real space used and hard links. Turn it off to scan folder by folder.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Give way to other programs when finding duplicates"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Files are read in Windows' background mode, behind other programs for both disk and memory, so the programs you are using don't slow down; the search is slower while you are doing other things.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Cleanup list"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Add your own folders to clean (their contents are deleted, the folders themselves kept), or exclude folders that cleanup must leave alone. Personal folders, system folders and app installation folders can't be added.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
          </StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="Common questions" Style="{StaticResource HelpListHead}" Margin="2,30,2,10"/>
          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,2,22,4">
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpFaq">
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}" BorderThickness="0">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why can't I find some features?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Usually the mode: Home user shows only the basics, Engineer adds more, and Developer and IT shows everything. Change it at the top of Settings. Anything hidden by hand under "What the window shows" is turned back on there too. The cleanup list is built by mode when scanning, so scan again after switching.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why does ClearC need administrator rights?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Cleaning locations such as system temporary files and the Windows Update cache requires administrator rights.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Can I cancel partway?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Yes. The progress card and the bottom of the window both have a "Cancel" button. It stops at a safe point and doesn't undo what's already done:</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,6,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Cleanup</Run><Run> stops.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Moving</Run><Run>: if it is still copying, the original folder on C: is left untouched and the copied part stays on the target drive, so the next move picks up where it left off.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Moving back to C:</Run><Run>: the partial copy is deleted and nothing is changed.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>While it is creating a link, deleting a backup or running a system command (such as cleaning up Windows Update), the button is greyed out; you can cancel as soon as that step is done.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Can I close the window while it's running?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Please don't close the window until the work is done; to stop, click "Cancel". You can click "Continue in background" to collapse the progress card; progress is still shown at the bottom of the window and on the taskbar icon.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Where can I see the details?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Deletions and moves that were made: see "Activity log" on the left.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Technical details of what the program did: see "Run log" at the bottom left; the full file is at %TEMP%\CleanC-run.log.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Less space freed than expected?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Files moved to the Recycle Bin only free up space after you empty the Recycle Bin, and files in use by other programs are skipped.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Is there a dark mode?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Yes. On the "Settings" page on the left (or with "Appearance" at the bottom left), choose Light, Dark or Follow Windows. ClearC closes and reopens after you change it.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Can I hide pages and buttons I don't use?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Yes, turn them off on the "Settings" page on the left. Anything hidden can be turned back on there at any time, and its settings and records are kept.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why doesn't the scanned total match the used space?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Adding up file sizes is not the same as the space really used on the drive:</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,6,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Hard links (one file with several names, common in WinSxS and System32) are counted more than once.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Compressed, sparse and cloud-only files take less space than their size.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>The file table (MFT), the NTFS logs and the space Windows reserves for updates (reserved storage) take space without being ordinary files.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>After a fast scan, click "Space breakdown" in the space map to see how big each part is.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="WinSxS looks huge. Can I delete it?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Not by hand; that can break Windows.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>Many of its files are the same files as in System32 and other places (hard links), so File Explorer counts them twice and WinSxS looks bigger than it is; with the fast scan, the space map notes how much of it is hard links.</Run></TextBlock>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>What can really go is the old components left behind by updates: use "WinSxS component cleanup (DISM)" on the "Clean up C:" page.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why doesn't ClearC clean the Prefetch folder or &quot;boost memory&quot;?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Prefetch</Run><Run> records which files programs read when they start, so Windows can open your usual programs faster. It is only a few dozen MB, deleting it makes the next starts slower, and it grows back within days.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Memory</Run><Run> is similar: Windows uses free memory to cache files you use often ("Cached" in Task Manager) and hands it over the moment another program needs it, so forcing it empty only slows the PC down.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>That is why ClearC does neither.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why is there no registry cleaner?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>A few stale entries in the registry take no space and cost no speed; Microsoft itself says cleaning the registry has no benefit, while a wrong deletion can break apps or Windows and is hard to fix. So ClearC doesn't do it, for the same reason it doesn't clean Prefetch or "boost memory".</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="How do I know about new versions?"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Click "Check for updates" under "Feedback" below. If there is a new version, the download page opens; replace the old exe with the new one and your settings, logs and reminders are kept. ClearC does not go online otherwise; it contacts GitHub only when you click that button.</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border x:Name="FeedbackCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,18,22,22" Margin="0,30,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><TextBlock Text="Feedback" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0" Text="If you run into a problem, find a bug or have a suggestion, please open an issue on GitHub."/>
              <Border Background="#F5F5F7" CornerRadius="10" Padding="18,14" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <DockPanel>
                  <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnIssue" Content="Report an issue" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="BtnGitHub" Content="Open page" Padding="14,7"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Border Width="40" Height="40" CornerRadius="20" Background="#E8F0FE">
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE943;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="18" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Border>
                    <StackPanel Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="GitHub project page: downloads, source code, issues" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                      <TextBlock x:Name="GitHubUrl" Text="github.com/Xuanqiyun/ClearC" FontSize="16" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,1,0,0" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Border>
              <StackPanel x:Name="FbCopyDiag" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Include diagnostic info"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="A screenshot of the problem and the diagnostic info help find the cause faster. Diagnostic info includes the app version, Windows version, space on C: and the recent run log (which contains folder paths), so you may want to review it before sending."/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCopyDiag" Content="Copy diagnostic info" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnOpenLog" Content="Open run log file"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="CopyHint" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#248A3D" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="FbSelfTest" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,18"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check scanning"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="Verifies the fast scan on this PC: it compares reading the file table with a folder-by-folder scan, then creates a few files in ClearC's own folder, changes and deletes them to check updates from the change journal. It only reads drive C:, leaves your files alone and takes a minute or two; the result is copied so you can paste it into a GitHub issue."/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnSelfTest" Content="Check scanning"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="FbCheckUpdate" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,18"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check for updates"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="If there is a new version, the download page opens; replace the old exe with the new one. ClearC contacts GitHub only when you click this button."/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCheckUpdate" Content="Check for updates"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>
'@

# ---------- 界面语言：设置里的 Lang=zh / en；没设过就跟系统显示语言走（中文系统用中文，其他用英文） ----------
function Get-UiLang {
    try {
        $f = Join-Path $env:LOCALAPPDATA 'CleanC\settings.txt'
        if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $f) { foreach ($l in [IO.File]::ReadAllLines($f, [Text.Encoding]::UTF8)) { if ($l -match '^\s*Lang\s*=\s*(zh|en)\s*$') { return $matches[1] } } }
    } catch {}
    if ([Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentUICulture.Name -like 'zh*') { return 'zh' }
    return 'en'
}
$script:Lang = Get-UiLang
$script:L10n = $null
if ($script:Lang -eq 'en') {
    $script:L10n = New-Object 'System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary[string,string]'
    $unesc = { param($x) $x.Replace('\\', [string][char]1).Replace('\t', "`t").Replace('\r', "`r").Replace('\n', "`n").Replace([string][char]1, '\') }
    foreach ($l in ($script:l10nData -split "`r?`n")) {
        $i = $l.IndexOf("`t"); if ($i -le 0) { continue }
        $script:L10n[(& $unesc $l.Substring(0, $i))] = (& $unesc $l.Substring($i + 1))
    }
}
try { [L10n]::Map = $script:L10n } catch {}

Invoke-Expression $engine
$catalog = Get-Catalog

# ---------- 外观：浅色 / 深色 / 跟随系统。存在设置里，换了以后重新打开本工具生效 ----------
$script:themePref = Get-Setting 'Theme' 'light'
$script:sysDark = $false
try { $script:sysDark = ((Get-ItemProperty 'HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Themes\Personalize' -Name AppsUseLightTheme -ErrorAction Stop).AppsUseLightTheme -eq 0) } catch {}
[Theme]::Dark = ($script:themePref -eq 'dark') -or ($script:themePref -eq 'system' -and $script:sysDark)
try { [RowTheme]::Map = [Delegate]::CreateDelegate([Func[string, char, string]], [Theme].GetMethod('Map')) } catch {}

# ============================================================
# 定时任务调用的两种模式（不打开主窗口）：
#   /check      检查 C 盘剩余空间，低于设定值时在右下角提醒（每天最多一次）
#   /autoclean  每周自动清理一次「安全清理」里的缓存，做完在右下角告诉你
# ============================================================
function Show-Toast([string]$Title, [string]$Text, [string[]]$Buttons = @((T '好')), [int]$AutoClose = 0) {
    $x = @'
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        WindowStyle="None" AllowsTransparency="True" Background="Transparent" ResizeMode="NoResize" ShowInTaskbar="True" Topmost="True"
        SizeToContent="Height" Width="400" FontFamily="Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D1D1F" Title="腾挪 ClearC">
  <Border Margin="14" Background="White" CornerRadius="14" BorderBrush="#D9D9DE" BorderThickness="1" Padding="20,16,20,14">
    <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="24" ShadowDepth="6" Direction="270" Opacity="0.22"/></Border.Effect>
    <StackPanel>
      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,8">
        <Border Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="6" Background="#0071E3">
          <TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="Segoe Fluent Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets" FontSize="12" Foreground="White" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock Text="腾挪 ClearC" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
      </StackPanel>
      <TextBlock x:Name="TTitle" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
      <TextBlock x:Name="TText" Margin="0,6,0,0" Foreground="#3A3A3C" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="20"/>
      <StackPanel x:Name="TButtons" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Border>
</Window>
'@
    $x = $x.Replace('腾挪 ClearC', (T '腾挪 ClearC'))
    $w = [Windows.Markup.XamlReader]::Parse([Theme]::Xaml($x))
    $w.FindName('TTitle').Text = $Title
    $w.FindName('TText').Text = $Text
    $script:toastResult = ''
    $panel = $w.FindName('TButtons')
    for ($i = 0; $i -lt $Buttons.Count; $i++) {
        $b = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.Button
        $b.Content = $Buttons[$i]; $b.Tag = $Buttons[$i]; $b.MinWidth = 76
        $b.Padding = New-Object System.Windows.Thickness 14, 6, 14, 6; $b.Margin = New-Object System.Windows.Thickness 8, 0, 0, 0
        $b.Cursor = [System.Windows.Input.Cursors]::Hand
        if ($i -eq $Buttons.Count - 1) { $b.Background = New-Object System.Windows.Media.SolidColorBrush ([System.Windows.Media.Color]::FromRgb(0, 0x71, 0xE3)); $b.Foreground = [System.Windows.Media.Brushes]::White; $b.BorderThickness = 0 }
        $b.Add_Click({ $script:toastResult = [string]$this.Tag; [System.Windows.Window]::GetWindow($this).Close() })
        [void]$panel.Children.Add($b)
    }
    $w.Add_MouseLeftButtonDown({ try { $this.DragMove() } catch {} })
    $w.Add_Loaded({
        $wa = [System.Windows.SystemParameters]::WorkArea
        $this.Left = $wa.Right - $this.ActualWidth - 4
        $this.Top = $wa.Bottom - $this.ActualHeight - 4
    })
    if ($AutoClose -gt 0) {
        $script:toastWin = $w
        $t = New-Object System.Windows.Threading.DispatcherTimer
        $t.Interval = [TimeSpan]::FromSeconds($AutoClose)
        $t.Add_Tick({ $this.Stop(); try { $script:toastWin.Close() } catch {} })
        $t.Start()
    }
    [void]$w.ShowDialog()
    return $script:toastResult
}

$script:mode = [string]$env:CLEANC_ARGS
if ($script:mode -match '(?i)/check') {
    Add-History
    $gb = 20; [void][int]::TryParse((Get-Setting 'RemindGB' '20'), [ref]$gb)
    $free = [double](FreeC)
    $today = (Get-Date).ToString('yyyy-MM-dd')
    $shown = $false
    if ($free -lt $gb * 1GB -and (Get-Setting 'LastRemind' '') -ne $today) {
        Set-Setting 'LastRemind' $today; $shown = $true
        $ans = Show-Toast -Title ((T "C 盘只剩 {0} 了") -f (GB $free)) -Text ((T "低于你设定的 {0} GB。打开腾挪 ClearC，看看能清掉或搬走什么？`n（在工具的「自动提醒」页可以关掉这个提醒）") -f $gb) -Buttons @((T '稍后'), (T '打开腾挪 ClearC'))
        if ($ans -eq (T '打开腾挪 ClearC') -and $env:CLEANC_SELF) { Start-Process -FilePath $env:CLEANC_SELF }
    }
    # 可以清理的垃圾超过设定值时也提醒（每天最多一次；只统计「安全清理」里的缓存，不碰任何东西）
    $jgb = 0; [void][int]::TryParse((Get-Setting 'JunkGB' '0'), [ref]$jgb)
    if (-not $shown -and $jgb -gt 0 -and (Get-Setting 'LastJunkRemind' '') -ne $today) {
        try { [Diagnostics.Process]::GetCurrentProcess().PriorityClass = 'BelowNormal' } catch {}
        $junk = [double]0
        foreach ($it in (Get-Catalog)) {
            if ($it.Kind -ne 'cache' -or $it.Def -ne (T '删除') -or $it.Act -or -not ([string]$it.G).StartsWith('安全清理')) { continue }
            $junk += [double](Measure-Item $it)
        }
        if ($junk -ge $jgb * 1GB) {
            Set-Setting 'LastJunkRemind' $today
            $ans = Show-Toast -Title ((T "C 盘上有约 {0} 可以清理") -f (GB $junk)) -Text ((T "临时文件、缓存和日志加起来超过了你设定的 {0} GB。打开腾挪 ClearC 清一清？`n（在工具的「自动提醒」页可以改界限或关掉这个提醒）") -f $jgb) -Buttons @((T '稍后'), (T '打开腾挪 ClearC'))
            if ($ans -eq (T '打开腾挪 ClearC') -and $env:CLEANC_SELF) { Start-Process -FilePath $env:CLEANC_SELF }
        }
    }
    $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
    return
}
# 界面自测（给自动测试用）：照常打开窗口，点一遍界面功能，对话框一律当作点了「取消」，做完自己关掉
$script:uiTest = [bool]($script:mode -match '(?i)/uitest')
# 这个 exe 是什么时候构建的（同一个版本号可能构建过好几次，反馈问题时好对上）
$script:AppBuild = ''
try {
    if ($script:AppBuildStamp) { $script:AppBuild = '{0:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm}' -f ([DateTime]::Parse($script:AppBuildStamp, [Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture, [Globalization.DateTimeStyles]::AdjustToUniversal -bor [Globalization.DateTimeStyles]::AssumeUniversal)).ToLocalTime() }
    elseif ($script:selfScript -and (Test-Path -LiteralPath $script:selfScript)) { $script:AppBuild = '{0:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm}' -f (Get-Item -LiteralPath $script:selfScript).LastWriteTime }   # 直接运行脚本：用脚本的修改时间
} catch {}
$script:uiSheets = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string]
if ($script:mode -match '(?i)/selftest') {
    Init-DriveThreads
    [DiskMap]::MftOff = ((Get-Setting 'FastScan' '1') -eq '0')
    $r = Invoke-SelfTest $script:AppVersion
    $file = if ($env:CLEANC_REPORT) { [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($env:CLEANC_REPORT) } else { Join-Path $script:appDir 'selftest.txt' }
    $dir = Split-Path $file
    try { if ($dir) { New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $dir | Out-Null } } catch {}
    try { [IO.File]::WriteAllText($file, (@($r.Lines) -join "`r`n"), (New-Object Text.UTF8Encoding $true)) } catch {}
    if (-not $env:CLEANC_QUIET) {
        $ans = Show-Toast -Title (T '扫描功能检查完了') -Text ((T "{0} 项正常，{1} 项提醒，{2} 项有问题") -f $r.Res.Pass, $r.Res.Warn, $r.Res.Fail) -Buttons @((T '好'), (T '打开结果'))
        if ($ans -eq (T '打开结果')) { Start-Process -FilePath "$env:SystemRoot\System32\notepad.exe" -ArgumentList ('"{0}"' -f $file) }
    }
    $global:CLEANC_EXIT = [int]$r.Res.Fail
    $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
    return
}
if ($script:mode -match '(?i)/autoclean') {
    [void](Prune-OpLog (Get-LogMonths))
    $r = Invoke-AutoClean
    Add-History
    OpLog '删除' (T '每周自动清理完成') '' ((T "C 盘多出 {0}；{1}") -f (GB $r.Freed), ($r.Items -join (T '；')))
    [void](Show-Toast -Title (T '每周自动清理完成') -Text ((T "C 盘多出 {0}。只清了临时文件、缓存和日志，没有碰任何个人文件。每一项都记在「操作日志」里。") -f (GB $r.Freed)) -Buttons @((T '好')) -AutoClose 30)
    $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
    return
}

# ============================================================
# 界面
# ============================================================
[xml]$xaml = @"
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="腾挪 ClearC" Width="1220" Height="860" MinWidth="980" MinHeight="620"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen" FontFamily="Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="13" Background="#F5F5F7"
        Foreground="#1D1D1F" UseLayoutRounding="True" SnapsToDevicePixels="True" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Display">
  <Window.Resources>
    <!-- 设置里可以关掉的显示项：改这几个资源，界面上用到的地方都跟着变 -->
    <Visibility x:Key="MapCkVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapBarVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapPctVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapMetaVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapHealthVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="AppMoveVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="SubVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <!-- 配色：浅灰底 #F5F5F7、白色卡片、正文 #1D1D1F、次要文字 #6E6E73、分隔线 #E5E5EA、唯一的强调色是蓝 #0071E3，红色只给删除 -->
    <FontFamily x:Key="Icons">Segoe Fluent Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets</FontFamily>

    <!-- ===== 文字 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="PageTitle" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="26"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="PageSub" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,5,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="{DynamicResource SubVis}"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 设置页：每一项的名字和说明 -->
    <Style x:Key="SetName" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="SetNote" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#86868B"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="18"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,3,0,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="SectionTitle" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="RowLabel" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,6,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Caption" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#86868B"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Note" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
    <Style x:Key="HelpHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="15"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpPara" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="22"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 帮助页：每一节是一张能折叠的卡片；条目是一行粗体标题，下面一两行说明 -->
    <Style x:Key="HelpLead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13.5"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpBody" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#515154"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="21"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,3,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="720"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpGroup" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0066CC"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpSum" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,2,0,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpListHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Bottom"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpIcon" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="36"/>
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="36"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="10"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#EAF2FD"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,14,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpPill" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#F0F0F3"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="6"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,1,8,2"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,1,12,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpTile" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#F5F5F7"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="10"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="14,11,14,13"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpSection" TargetType="Expander">
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,10"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Expander">
            <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12">
              <DockPanel>
                <ToggleButton DockPanel.Dock="Top" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                              IsChecked="{Binding IsExpanded, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <ToggleButton.Template>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                      <Border x:Name="Hd" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="11" Padding="16,13,20,13">
                        <DockPanel>
                          <TextBlock x:Name="Chev" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="&#xE70D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="12"
                                     Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="14,0,0,0" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
                            <TextBlock.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="0"/></TextBlock.RenderTransform>
                          </TextBlock>
                          <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </DockPanel>
                      </Border>
                      <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
                        <MultiTrigger>
                          <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"/><Condition Property="IsChecked" Value="False"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                          <Setter TargetName="Hd" Property="Background" Value="#F7F7F9"/>
                        </MultiTrigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                          <Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="RenderTransform"><Setter.Value><RotateTransform Angle="180"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                        </Trigger>
                      </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                  </ToggleButton.Template>
                </ToggleButton>
                <StackPanel x:Name="Body" Visibility="Collapsed">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="16,0,16,0"/>
                  <ContentPresenter Margin="22,0,22,20"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsExpanded" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Body" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 常见问题：一行一个问题，点开看答案 -->
    <Style x:Key="HelpQ" TargetType="Expander">
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#EDEDF0"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,1,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Expander">
            <Border BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}" BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}">
              <DockPanel>
                <ToggleButton DockPanel.Dock="Top" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                              IsChecked="{Binding IsExpanded, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <ToggleButton.Template>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                      <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="0,13,2,13">
                        <DockPanel>
                          <TextBlock x:Name="Chev" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="&#xE70D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11"
                                     Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
                            <TextBlock.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="0"/></TextBlock.RenderTransform>
                          </TextBlock>
                          <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </DockPanel>
                      </Border>
                      <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                          <Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="RenderTransform"><Setter.Value><RotateTransform Angle="180"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                        </Trigger>
                      </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                  </ToggleButton.Template>
                </ToggleButton>
                <ContentPresenter x:Name="Body" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="0,0,30,15"/>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsExpanded" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Body" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 卡片 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Card" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#E5E5EA"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="SegBox" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#EBEBF0"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 按钮：圆角 8，悬停/按下时整体轻微变暗 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Secondary" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#E8E8ED"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="14,6"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="30"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Grid>
              <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                      BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}" CornerRadius="8"/>
              <Border x:Name="Shade" Background="#000000" Opacity="0" CornerRadius="8"/>
              <Border x:Name="Ring" BorderBrush="#7FB5F0" BorderThickness="0" CornerRadius="8" Margin="-2"/>
              <ContentPresenter Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Shade" Property="Opacity" Value="0.06"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Shade" Property="Opacity" Value="0.14"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsKeyboardFocused" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Ring" Property="BorderThickness" Value="2"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}"/>
    <!-- 列表自带的样式会把文字设成固定的深色，这里改回正文颜色（深色模式会跟着换） -->
    <Style TargetType="ListView"><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/></Style>
    <Style TargetType="ListBox"><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/></Style>
    <Style x:Key="Primary" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Danger" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#D70015"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Small" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,3"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="26"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="LinkButton" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0066CC"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2,2"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.7"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 侧边栏导航 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Nav" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,3"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="8" Padding="11,8" Background="Transparent">
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                <TextBlock x:Name="Glyph" Text="{Binding Tag, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}"
                           FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,11,0"/>
                <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E1E1E6"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Glyph" Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 分段控件（单选） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Seg" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="6" Padding="12,4,12,5" Background="Transparent">
              <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#DEDEE4"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#FEFEFE"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Effect"><Setter.Value><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="4" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" Opacity="0.16"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="ChipRadio" TargetType="RadioButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
    <!-- 每一行的「删除 / 搬到其他盘 / 跳过」：一个横排的列表当分段控件用，选中项绑定到这一行的操作 -->
    <Style x:Key="SegList" TargetType="ListBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#EBEBF0"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
      <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False"/>
      <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
        <Setter.Value><ItemsPanelTemplate><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBox">
            <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="8" Padding="2"><ItemsPresenter/></Border>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
      <Setter Property="ItemContainerStyle">
        <Setter.Value>
          <Style TargetType="ListBoxItem">
            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
            <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
            <Setter Property="Template">
              <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem">
                  <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="6" Padding="11,4,11,5" Background="Transparent">
                    <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                  </Border>
                  <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#DEDEE4"/></Trigger>
                    <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True">
                      <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#FEFEFE"/>
                      <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Effect"><Setter.Value><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="4" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" Opacity="0.16"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
                    </Trigger>
                    <MultiTrigger>
                      <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsSelected" Value="True"/><Condition Property="Content" Value="删除"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#D70015"/>
                    </MultiTrigger>
                    <MultiTrigger>
                      <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsSelected" Value="True"/><Condition Property="Content" Value="搬到其他盘"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/>
                    </MultiTrigger>
                    <MultiTrigger>
                      <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsSelected" Value="True"/><Condition Property="Content" Value="执行"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/>
                    </MultiTrigger>
                  </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
              </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
          </Style>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 文件类型胶囊（多选） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Chip" TargetType="ToggleButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,6,6"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="13" Padding="12,4,12,5" Background="#F2F2F7">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E5E5EA"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 勾选框：圆角小方块，勾上变蓝 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="CheckBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <Border x:Name="Box" Width="17" Height="17" CornerRadius="4.5" BorderThickness="1" BorderBrush="#B8B8BE" Background="White" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Grid>
                  <Path x:Name="Mark" Data="M 3.5 7.6 L 6.5 10.6 L 11.6 4.8" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2"
                        StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" StrokeLineJoin="Round" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                  <Path x:Name="Dash" Data="M 4.5 7.5 L 10.5 7.5" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2" StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                </Grid>
              </Border>
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="CP" Grid.Column="1" Margin="9,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Mark" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="{x:Null}">
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Dash" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="HasContent" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="CP" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 右键菜单 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Menu" TargetType="ContextMenu">
      <Setter Property="OverridesDefaultStyle" Value="True"/>
      <Setter Property="SnapsToDevicePixels" Value="True"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ContextMenu">
            <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#D2D2D7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="4" Margin="0,0,8,8">
              <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="12" ShadowDepth="2" Direction="270" Opacity="0.18"/></Border.Effect>
              <StackPanel IsItemsHost="True" KeyboardNavigation.DirectionalNavigation="Cycle"/>
            </Border>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="MenuRow" TargetType="MenuItem">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="MenuItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="5" Padding="12,6,28,6" MinWidth="180">
              <ContentPresenter ContentSource="Header" RecognizesAccessKey="False" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsHighlighted" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="MenuSep" TargetType="Separator">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Separator">
            <Border Height="1" Background="#E5E5EA" Margin="8,4"/>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 输入框 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="TextBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#D2D2D7"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,0"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="30"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="TextBox">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="7">
              <ScrollViewer x:Name="PART_ContentHost" Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Focusable="False"
                            HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#AEAEB2"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsKeyboardFocused" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 运行记录用系统默认的多行文本框（有滚动条），只改颜色 -->
    <Style x:Key="LogBox" TargetType="TextBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 下拉框 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="ComboBoxItem">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="9,6"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ComboBoxItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="5" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}" Background="Transparent">
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsHighlighted" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="ComboBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="30"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ComboBox">
            <Grid>
              <ToggleButton x:Name="Toggle" Focusable="False" ClickMode="Press"
                            IsChecked="{Binding IsDropDownOpen, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <ToggleButton.Template>
                  <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                    <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="White" BorderBrush="#D2D2D7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="7">
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE70D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#6E6E73"
                                 HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,11,0"/>
                    </Border>
                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#AEAEB2"/></Trigger>
                      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                  </ControlTemplate>
                </ToggleButton.Template>
              </ToggleButton>
              <ContentPresenter IsHitTestVisible="False" Content="{TemplateBinding SelectionBoxItem}" ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding SelectionBoxItemTemplate}"
                                Margin="11,4,30,4" VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
              <Popup x:Name="PART_Popup" Placement="Bottom" AllowsTransparency="True" Focusable="False" PopupAnimation="Fade"
                     IsOpen="{Binding IsDropDownOpen, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#D2D2D7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="9" Padding="4" Margin="0,4,12,14"
                        MinWidth="{Binding ActualWidth, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="18" ShadowDepth="3" Direction="270" Opacity="0.16"/></Border.Effect>
                  <ScrollViewer MaxHeight="{TemplateBinding MaxDropDownHeight}" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                    <StackPanel IsItemsHost="True" KeyboardNavigation.DirectionalNavigation="Contained"/>
                  </ScrollViewer>
                </Border>
              </Popup>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 细滚动条 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="SlimThumb" TargetType="Thumb">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Thumb">
            <Border x:Name="T" Background="#C7C7CC" CornerRadius="4" Margin="2"/>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="T" Property="Background" Value="#AEAEB2"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsDragging" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="T" Property="Background" Value="#8E8E93"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="ScrollBar">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="11"/>
      <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="11"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ScrollBar">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Track x:Name="PART_Track" Orientation="Vertical" IsDirectionReversed="True">
                <Track.Thumb><Thumb Style="{StaticResource SlimThumb}"/></Track.Thumb>
              </Track>
            </Grid>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
      <Style.Triggers>
        <Trigger Property="Orientation" Value="Horizontal">
          <Setter Property="Width" Value="Auto"/>
          <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="0"/>
          <Setter Property="Height" Value="11"/>
          <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="11"/>
          <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
              <ControlTemplate TargetType="ScrollBar">
                <Grid Background="Transparent">
                  <Track x:Name="PART_Track" Orientation="Horizontal" IsDirectionReversed="False">
                    <Track.Thumb><Thumb Style="{StaticResource SlimThumb}"/></Track.Thumb>
                  </Track>
                </Grid>
              </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
          </Setter>
        </Trigger>
      </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 进度条：圆角细条；不确定进度时轻轻闪烁 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="ProgressBar">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#E5E5EA"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ProgressBar">
            <Grid>
              <Border x:Name="PART_Track" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="3"/>
              <Border x:Name="PART_Indicator" Background="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" CornerRadius="3" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsIndeterminate" Value="True">
                <Trigger.EnterActions>
                  <BeginStoryboard x:Name="Pulse">
                    <Storyboard RepeatBehavior="Forever" AutoReverse="True">
                      <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="PART_Indicator" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity" From="0.25" To="0.85" Duration="0:0:0.8"/>
                    </Storyboard>
                  </BeginStoryboard>
                </Trigger.EnterActions>
                <Trigger.ExitActions><StopStoryboard BeginStoryboardName="Pulse"/></Trigger.ExitActions>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="ToolTip">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#D2D2D7"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="9,6"/>
      <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="420"/>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 查找条件的折叠面板：左边一个小箭头，展开时转向下 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="Expander">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Expander">
            <DockPanel>
              <ToggleButton DockPanel.Dock="Top" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                            IsChecked="{Binding IsExpanded, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <ToggleButton.Template>
                  <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                    <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="2,6">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="Chev" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11"
                                   Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,10,0" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
                          <TextBlock.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="0"/></TextBlock.RenderTransform>
                        </TextBlock>
                        <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                        <Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="RenderTransform"><Setter.Value><RotateTransform Angle="90"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                      </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                  </ControlTemplate>
                </ToggleButton.Template>
              </ToggleButton>
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="Body" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            </DockPanel>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsExpanded" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Body" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 清理列表：每组一张圆角白卡片，行之间一条细线 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="CardGroup" TargetType="GroupItem">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="GroupItem">
            <StackPanel Margin="0,0,0,22">
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="4,0,0,8">
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupTitle}" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F"/>
                <Border Background="#E5E5EA" CornerRadius="8" Padding="7,0" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <TextBlock Text="{Binding ItemCount, StringFormat='{}{0} 项'}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#3A3A3C"/>
                </Border>
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupNote}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#86868B" Margin="10,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Bottom"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="12" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" Padding="0,2">
                <ItemsPresenter/>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="PlainRow" TargetType="ListViewItem">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Rectangle x:Name="Sep" Height="1" Fill="#E5E5EA" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="18,0,0,0"/>
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding First}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Sep" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <DataTemplate x:Key="CleanRow">
      <Grid Margin="18,12,14,12">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,18,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F"/>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Note}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,5,0,0">
            <TextBlock.Style>
              <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                <Style.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Status}" Value=""><Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                </Style.Triggers>
              </Style>
            </TextBlock.Style>
          </TextBlock>
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontSize="13.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                   MinWidth="90" TextAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,18,0"/>
        <ListBox Grid.Column="2" ItemsSource="{Binding Actions}" SelectedItem="{Binding Action, Mode=TwoWay}" Style="{StaticResource SegList}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
      </Grid>
    </DataTemplate>

    <!-- ===== 重复文件结果表 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="GridViewColumnHeader">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Left"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#86868B"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="11.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="GridViewColumnHeader">
            <Grid>
              <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="6,8,6,7">
                <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </Border>
              <Thumb x:Name="PART_HeaderGripper" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Width="9" Margin="0,0,-4,0" Cursor="SizeWE">
                <Thumb.Template>
                  <ControlTemplate TargetType="Thumb">
                    <Border Background="Transparent"><Rectangle Width="1" Fill="#E5E5EA" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,8"/></Border>
                  </ControlTemplate>
                </Thumb.Template>
              </Thumb>
            </Grid>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="GridRow" TargetType="ListViewItem">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,5"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
              <GridViewRowPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center" Columns="{TemplateBinding GridView.ColumnCollection}"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#F5F5F7"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="RootRow" TargetType="ListBoxItem">
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,6,6"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem"><ContentPresenter/></ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 查找位置：和文件类型一样的胶囊，勾上变蓝；自己加的文件夹带一个小叉可以移除 -->
    <Style x:Key="PillCheck" TargetType="CheckBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="13" Padding="12,4,12,5" Background="#F2F2F7">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E5E5EA"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="PillX" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Width="16" Height="16" CornerRadius="8" Background="Transparent">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE711;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="8" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#26000000"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 侧边栏分组标题 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="NavHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="11.5"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#86868B"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="11,12,0,5"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 开关（勾选框的另一种样子） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Switch" TargetType="CheckBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Background="Transparent">
              <Grid Width="40" Height="24" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border x:Name="Track" CornerRadius="12" Background="#D1D1D6"/>
                <Ellipse x:Name="Knob" Width="20" Height="20" Fill="White" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="2,0,0,0">
                  <Ellipse.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="3" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" Opacity="0.25"/></Ellipse.Effect>
                </Ellipse>
              </Grid>
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="CP" Margin="10,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Track" Property="Background" Value="#34C759"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Knob" Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Right"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Knob" Property="Margin" Value="0,0,2,0"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="HasContent" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="CP" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 可以选中的列表行（空间地图、软件、搬家记录） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="SelRow" TargetType="ListViewItem">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="8" Margin="6,1">
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#F5F5F7"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="CardHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="15"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Body" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="21"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 空间地图的一行：图标、名字、占比条、大小、百分比 -->
    <DataTemplate x:Key="CandRowTpl">
      <Grid Margin="14,11,14,11">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <CheckBox x:Name="Ck" Grid.Column="0" IsChecked="{Binding Checked, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" IsEnabled="{Binding CanMove}" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="0,0,14,0">
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding PathText}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding PathText}"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="Nt" Text="{Binding Note}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="St" Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
        <Button x:Name="CandOpen" Grid.Column="3" Content="打开" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
      </Grid>
      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Status}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="St" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Note}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="Nt" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanMove}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="Ck" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></DataTrigger>
      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
    </DataTemplate>
    <DataTemplate x:Key="MapRowTpl">
      <Grid Margin="12,7,14,7">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="92"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <!-- 项目复选框：和这一行是否选中绑在一起，点它只增减这一行，不影响其他已选的行 -->
        <CheckBox Grid.Column="0" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapCkVis}" Focusable="False" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0" Cursor="Hand"
                  IsChecked="{Binding IsSelected, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=ListViewItem}}"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Glyph}" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="{Binding GlyphBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Margin="0,0,14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <DockPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="Lk" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11" Foreground="#86868B"
                       Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed" ToolTip="{Binding LockTip}"/>
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Path}"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,1,0,0" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapMetaVis}" ToolTip="{Binding Meta}"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <Border Grid.Column="3" Height="8" Width="160" Margin="0,0,12,0" CornerRadius="4" Background="#EFEFF4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapBarVis}">
          <Border Width="{Binding Bar}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" CornerRadius="4" Background="#0071E3"/>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="5" Width="58" Text="{Binding Pct}" Foreground="#86868B" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapPctVis}"/>
      </Grid>
      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Locked}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Lk" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
    </DataTemplate>
  </Window.Resources>

  <Grid x:Name="Root">
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
      <ColumnDefinition Width="220"/>
      <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

    <!-- ==================== 侧边栏 ==================== -->
    <Border Grid.Column="0" Grid.RowSpan="3" Background="#ECECF0" BorderBrush="#DCDCE1" BorderThickness="0,0,1,0">
      <DockPanel Margin="14,20,14,16">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="6,0,0,26">
          <Border Width="36" Height="36" CornerRadius="9">
            <Border.Background>
              <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1">
                <GradientStop Color="#3A9BFF" Offset="0"/>
                <GradientStop Color="#0062D6" Offset="1"/>
              </LinearGradientBrush>
            </Border.Background>
            <TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="18" Foreground="White" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          </Border>
          <StackPanel Margin="11,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <TextBlock Text="腾挪 ClearC" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="AppVer" Text="" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="ModeTag" Text="" FontSize="11" Foreground="#0066CC" Margin="0,1,0,0" Cursor="Hand" ToolTip="点一下到设置里换模式"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Bottom">
          <Button x:Name="BtnTheme" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE706;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="BtnThemeText" Text="外观：浅色" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <Button x:Name="BtnLang" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left" ToolTip="中文 / English">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE774;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="BtnLangText" Text="English" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <Button x:Name="BtnFeedback" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock Text="使用反馈" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <Button x:Name="BtnLog" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE8A5;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="BtnLogText" Text="运行记录" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
        </StackPanel>
        <!-- 窗口矮的时候（比如笔记本 150% 缩放）放不下全部页面：这一栏可以上下滚动，「设置」不会被挤掉 -->
        <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="清理" Style="{StaticResource NavHead}" Margin="11,0,0,5"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavClean" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xEDA2;" Content="清理 C 盘" IsChecked="True"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavDup" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE8C8;" Content="重复文件"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavSave" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE7B8;" Content="省空间"/>
          <TextBlock Text="分析" Style="{StaticResource NavHead}"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavMap" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE9D9;" Content="空间地图"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavApps" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE71D;" Content="软件管理"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavHealth" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE95E;" Content="系统健康"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="NavHeadManage" Text="管理" Style="{StaticResource NavHead}"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavMoves" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE8AB;" Content="搬家管理"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavAuto" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE823;" Content="自动提醒"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavLog" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE81C;" Content="操作日志"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavHelp" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE897;" Content="帮助" Margin="0,12,0,3"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavSettings" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE713;" Content="设置"/>
        </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </DockPanel>
    </Border>

    <!-- ==================== 清理 C 盘 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageClean" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,18">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnCleanCustom" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="自定义清理项…" Margin="0,0,14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" ToolTip="自己加要清理的文件夹，或者排除不想碰的文件夹（在「设置」里）"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnHogs" Content="分析占用" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="打开「空间地图」扫描 C 盘，看清哪些文件夹和文件最占地方"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnScan" Content="扫描"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="清理 C 盘" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="Hint" Style="{StaticResource PageSub}"
                     Text="「一键清理」会自动扫描并处理默认选中的项目。也可以先扫描，再逐项选择删除、搬到其他盘或跳过。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>

      <!-- 容量卡片、搬家目标和清理列表放在同一个滚动区里，整页一起滚，列表不再挤在一小块里 -->
      <Grid Grid.Row="1">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="CleanScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False" Padding="0,0,6,0">
      <StackPanel>
      <!-- 存储空间：已用 / 可释放 / 可用 -->
      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,18" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="BtnOneClick" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Content="一键清理" FontSize="14" Padding="24,9"
                  VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="28,0,0,0"
                  ToolTip="自动扫描，清掉所有安全项和默认选中的项目，并把微信、QQ、飞书、钉钉等聊天记录搬到空间最大的其他盘。不会关闭休眠、不清空回收站，个人文件夹（桌面、文档、下载等）里的东西一律不删。"/>
          <StackPanel>
            <DockPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="CapTotal" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="12,0,0,3"/>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                <TextBlock x:Name="CapFree" Text="—" FontSize="24" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                <TextBlock Text="可用" FontSize="14" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="8,0,0,4"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
            <Border Height="10" CornerRadius="5" Background="#E5E5EA" Margin="0,11,0,10">
              <Grid x:Name="CapBar">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="1*"/>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="0*"/>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="1*"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Column="0" Background="#8E8E93" CornerRadius="5,0,0,5"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="1" Background="#0071E3"/>
              </Grid>
            </Border>
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock Text="已用" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,18,0"/>
              <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="CapReclaim" Text="可释放（扫描后显示）" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,18,0"/>
              <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="#D1D1D6" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock Text="可用" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,0,0"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- 搬家目标 -->
      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="18,12" Margin="0,0,0,20">
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel LastChildFill="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE8B7;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
            <TextBlock Text="搬家目标" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
            <ComboBox x:Name="DestPick" Width="380" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            <Button x:Name="BtnDestBrowse" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="选择文件夹…" Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="DestHint" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="26,7,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                     Text="聊天记录等搬到这里，C 盘原位置留一个链接，软件照常使用。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- 扫描结果总览：一共几类、每类几项，一眼看出下面还有很多 -->
      <Border x:Name="CleanOverview" Background="#EAF3FF" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,10" Margin="0,0,0,16" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE8FD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,1,10,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="CleanOverviewText" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#1D1D1F" LineHeight="20"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <!-- 列表自己不滚动（没有内部滚动条），所有项目都排开，跟着整页滚 -->
      <ListView x:Name="List" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="0"
                ItemTemplate="{StaticResource CleanRow}" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource PlainRow}">
        <ListView.Template>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListView"><ItemsPresenter/></ControlTemplate>
        </ListView.Template>
        <ListView.GroupStyle>
          <GroupStyle ContainerStyle="{StaticResource CardGroup}"/>
        </ListView.GroupStyle>
      </ListView>
      <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyClean" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,40,0,40" IsHitTestVisible="False">
        <TextBlock Text="&#xE721;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="34" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyCleanText" Text="点「扫描」看看 C 盘里有什么可以清理" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
      </StackPanel>
      </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
      <!-- 下面还有内容时浮在底部的提示，点一下往下翻一屏 -->
      <Button x:Name="CleanMore" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed" Cursor="Hand" ToolTip="往下翻一屏">
        <Button.Template>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border Background="#1D1D1F" CornerRadius="16" Padding="16,7">
              <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="14" ShadowDepth="3" Direction="270" Opacity="0.25"/></Border.Effect>
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Border>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Button.Template>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
          <TextBlock x:Name="CleanMoreText" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE74B;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,1,0,0"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Button>
      </Grid>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <Button x:Name="BtnRun" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Content="执行所选操作" Padding="22,8" IsEnabled="False"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="Summary" Text="" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2,0,16,0"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 重复文件 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageDup" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupStop" Content="停止" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupScan" Content="开始查找" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="20,6"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="重复文件" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="找出内容完全相同的文件，每组只留一份，其余删除。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>

      <Expander Grid.Row="1" x:Name="FilterExpander" IsExpanded="True" Margin="0,0,0,12">
        <Expander.Header>
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <TextBlock Text="查找条件" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" FontSize="13.5"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="FilterSummary" Margin="12,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Expander.Header>
        <!-- 位置和条件放在同一张卡片里，一行一类；选项都用胶囊和分段控件 -->
        <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="20,4,20,4" Margin="0,8,0,0">
          <StackPanel>
            <Grid Margin="0,12,0,10">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="92"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="查找位置" Style="{StaticResource RowLabel}"/>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="1">
                <ListBox x:Name="Roots" BorderThickness="0" Background="Transparent" Padding="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource RootRow}"
                         ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                  <ListBox.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ListBox.ItemsPanel>
                  <ListBox.ItemTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <CheckBox IsChecked="{Binding Enabled, Mode=TwoWay}" Style="{StaticResource PillCheck}" ToolTip="{Binding Detail}">
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Label}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <Button x:Name="X" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource PillX}" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="6,0,-5,0" ToolTip="不在这里找了，移除"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </CheckBox>
                      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Removable}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="X" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </ListBox.ItemTemplate>
                </ListBox>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnAddRoot" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="添加文件夹…" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                             Text="系统目录、Program Files、AppData 和开发环境（.git、node_modules、conda）会自动跳过。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
            <Rectangle Height="1" Fill="#E5E5EA"/>
            <Grid Margin="0,12,0,10">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="92"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="文件类型" Style="{StaticResource RowLabel}"/>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="1">
                <WrapPanel x:Name="TypeChips"/>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,2,0,0" MaxWidth="560" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="其他扩展名" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="TypeReset" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全部重置" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                  <TextBox x:Name="ExtraExt" MinWidth="240" ToolTip="上面没有的类型，用空格隔开，例如 .dwg .step .sldprt"/>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
            <Rectangle Height="1" Fill="#E5E5EA"/>
            <Grid Margin="0,10,0,10">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="92"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="文件大小" Style="{StaticResource RowLabel}"/>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="1">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}"><StackPanel x:Name="SizeChips" Orientation="Horizontal"/></Border>
                <StackPanel x:Name="SizeCustomRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,9,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                  <TextBlock Text="从" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <TextBox x:Name="SizeMin" Width="76"/>
                  <ComboBox x:Name="SizeMinUnit" Width="66" Margin="6,0,0,0" SelectedIndex="1">
                    <ComboBoxItem Content="KB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="MB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="GB"/>
                  </ComboBox>
                  <TextBlock Text="到" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="16,0,8,0"/>
                  <TextBox x:Name="SizeMax" Width="76"/>
                  <ComboBox x:Name="SizeMaxUnit" Width="66" Margin="6,0,0,0" SelectedIndex="1">
                    <ComboBoxItem Content="KB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="MB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="GB"/>
                  </ComboBox>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SizeHint" Text="留空表示不限" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
            <Rectangle Height="1" Fill="#E5E5EA"/>
            <Grid Margin="0,10,0,12">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="92"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="怎样算重复" Style="{StaticResource RowLabel}"/>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="1">
                <WrapPanel>
                  <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" Margin="0,0,28,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                      <RadioButton x:Name="ModeName" GroupName="dupmode" Content="名字和内容都相同" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="ModeContent" GroupName="dupmode" Content="只看内容，名字不同也算" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="ModeSimilar" GroupName="dupmode" Content="相似照片" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"
                                   ToolTip="找看起来一样的照片：不同分辨率、重新压缩过、轻微裁剪过的也算。只看 jpg、png、bmp、gif、tif、webp、heic。不是同一个文件，删之前自己看一眼"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <StackPanel x:Name="SimilarRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,28,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                    <TextBlock Text="相似程度" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}">
                      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <RadioButton x:Name="SimStrict" GroupName="simlvl" Content="几乎一样" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="64 位指纹相差 4 位以内：同一张照片的不同尺寸、不同压缩"/>
                        <RadioButton x:Name="SimNormal" GroupName="simlvl" Content="相似" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="相差 8 位以内：加上轻微裁剪、调色"/>
                        <RadioButton x:Name="SimLoose" GroupName="simlvl" Content="大致相似" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="相差 12 位以内：连拍、构图相近的也会归到一起，误判会多"/>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <TextBlock Text="比对方式" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}">
                      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <RadioButton x:Name="SpeedFast" GroupName="dupspeed" Content="快速" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"
                                     ToolTip="16 MB 以内的文件读全文；更大的读头尾和 16 处抽样（每个约 1 MB）。删除前再逐字节完整比对。"/>
                        <RadioButton x:Name="SpeedExact" GroupName="dupspeed" Content="完整比对" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"
                                     ToolTip="每个可疑文件都读完全部内容。大视频多的时候会慢很多。"/>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </StackPanel>
                </WrapPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2,8,0,0"
                           Text="快速模式下大文件只抽样读约 1 MB；删除前都会逐字节完整核对，有任何不同就不删。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
      </Expander>

      <!-- 结果 -->
      <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,0,0,6">
        <DockPanel>
          <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="18,12,14,10">
            <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="每组只留一份：" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepNew"  Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留最新的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepOld"  Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留最早的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickC"    Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="优先留 C 盘以外的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepIn"   Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留某个文件夹里的…" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="选一个文件夹：每组优先保留在这个文件夹（含子文件夹）里的那份，其余勾上；这一组里没有的就留最新的"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepShort" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留路径最短的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="每组保留路径最短（层级最浅）的那份"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickNone" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="全部取消" IsEnabled="False"/>
            </StackPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="DupProgressText" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Foreground="#6E6E73"
                       Text="只有内容逐字节完全相同才算重复。"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <Grid>
            <ListView x:Name="DupList" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}"
                      VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizingWhenGrouping="True"
                      VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling" ScrollViewer.CanContentScroll="True">
              <ListView.GroupStyle>
                <GroupStyle>
                  <GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <Border BorderBrush="#EFEFF4" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="16,14,12,6" Margin="0,4,0,0">
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                          <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Margin="0,0,10,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Fill="{Binding Items[0].TypeBrush}"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupName}" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupMeta}" Foreground="#86868B" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <Border CornerRadius="9" Padding="8,1,8,2" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                  Background="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadgeBg}" ToolTip="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadgeTip}">
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadge}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadgeFg}"/>
                          </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </Border>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                </GroupStyle>
              </ListView.GroupStyle>
              <ListView.View>
                <GridView>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="删除" Width="52">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                      <DataTemplate>
                        <Grid>
                          <CheckBox x:Name="Chk" IsChecked="{Binding ToDelete, Mode=TwoWay}" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <TextBlock x:Name="Lock" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" Foreground="#86868B" HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                     VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed" ToolTip="C 盘个人文件夹里的文件受保护，不会删除"/>
                        </Grid>
                        <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                          <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanDelete}" Value="False">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chk" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/>
                            <Setter TargetName="Lock" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
                          </DataTrigger>
                        </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      </DataTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="位置" Width="520">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                      <DataTemplate>
                        <TextBlock ToolTip="{Binding Path}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis">
                          <Run Text="{Binding Dir, Mode=OneWay}" Foreground="#86868B"/><Run Text="{Binding FileName, Mode=OneWay}" Foreground="#1D1D1F"/>
                        </TextBlock>
                      </DataTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="修改时间" Width="136">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Modified}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="注意" Width="230">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Risk}" ToolTip="{Binding Risk}" Foreground="#C93400" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="" Width="80">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><Button Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding Path}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                </GridView>
              </ListView.View>
            </ListView>
            <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyDup" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,10,0,30" IsHitTestVisible="False">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE8C8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyDupText" Text="设置好条件后，点右上角「开始查找」" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Grid>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
          <CheckBox x:Name="DupProtect" Content="不删 C 盘个人文件夹里的文件" IsChecked="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,16,0"
                    ToolTip="桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频、音乐等 C 盘个人文件夹里的副本一律保留，只删其他位置的副本"/>
          <CheckBox x:Name="DupRecycle" Content="放入回收站，可以恢复" IsChecked="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,16,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupMove" Content="归档勾选的…" Margin="0,0,8,0" Padding="16,8" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="不删，把勾选的文件搬到你选的一个文件夹里（按原来的盘符和路径放，不会重名覆盖），想清楚了再删"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupMerge" Content="合并为一份" Margin="0,0,8,0" Padding="16,8" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="勾选的副本换成指向保留那份的硬链接：每个位置的文件都还在，只占一份空间。只适用于同一块盘上的副本"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupDelete" Content="删除勾选的文件" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="20,8" IsEnabled="False"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="DupSummary" Text="" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2,0,16,0"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 空间地图 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageMap" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <CheckBox x:Name="MapFast" Content="快速扫描" IsChecked="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"
                    ToolTip="直接读取 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多。少数安全软件对直接读盘会提示，可以关掉，改为逐个文件夹扫描。清理、搬家、软件管理统计大小时也按这个设置。"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapDrive" Width="200" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapStop" Content="停止" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapScan" Content="扫描" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="20,6"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="扫描整块盘，看清每个文件夹占了多少。双击文件夹往里点，一层层找到真正的大户。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <!-- 每块盘一张卡片：用量条、温度、磨损、健康状态。颜色按档位：绿正常、橙要留意、红有问题 -->
      <Border x:Name="MapHealthBox" Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,0,0,12" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapHealthVis}">
        <StackPanel>
          <ItemsControl x:Name="MapHealth">
            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Width="300" Margin="0,0,12,8" Padding="0" Cursor="Hand" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}" Tag="{Binding}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="5" Background="{Binding Stripe}" CornerRadius="12,0,0,12"/>
                    <StackPanel Margin="14,10,14,10">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="{Binding Letter}" FontSize="17" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Model}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                      <Grid Margin="0,8,0,0" Height="6">
                        <Border Background="#EBEBF0" CornerRadius="3"/>
                        <Border Background="{Binding BarBrush}" CornerRadius="3" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Width="{Binding BarW}"/>
                      </Grid>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding UsedText}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                      <WrapPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                        <Border Background="{Binding HealthBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding HealthText}" FontSize="11.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding HealthFg}"/></Border>
                        <Border x:Name="TempChip" Background="{Binding TempBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding TempText}" FontSize="11.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding TempFg}"/></Border>
                        <Border x:Name="WearChip" Background="{Binding WearBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding WearText}" FontSize="11.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding WearFg}"/></Border>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="HoursText" Text="{Binding HoursText}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,0,4"/>
                      </WrapPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasTemp}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="TempChip" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasWear}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="WearChip" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasHours}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="HoursText" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
          </ItemsControl>
          <TextBlock x:Name="MapHealthNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Text="正在读取各块盘的健康信息…"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,0,0,10">
        <Border x:Name="MapViewBox" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewDirs" GroupName="mapview" Content="文件夹" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewTree" GroupName="mapview" Content="方块图" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="每个方块的大小就是它占的空间。单击选中，双击文件夹往里点"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewTypes" GroupName="mapview" Content="按类型" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="这块盘上视频、图片、文档、程序、日志各占多少。双击一类，到「找文件」里看这一类最大的文件"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewFiles" GroupName="mapview" Content="找文件" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewGrow" GroupName="mapview" Content="和上次比" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewRecent" GroupName="mapview" Content="最近改动" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="按文件系统的变更日志，看这几天哪些文件夹新建、改写的文件最多：多出来的空间多半在那里"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <Button x:Name="BtnMapExport" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="导出 CSV" Margin="0,0,10,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsEnabled="False"
                ToolTip="把现在看到的列表存成 CSV 文件，可以用 Excel 打开"/>
        <Button x:Name="BtnMapReport" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="导出报告" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsEnabled="False"
                ToolTip="把这块盘的空间情况存成一个网页报告：方块图、最大的文件夹和文件、各类文件占多少、和上次比的变化。在浏览器里按 Ctrl+P 可以存成 PDF"/>
        <!-- 左边是「上一级」和路径；地方不够时说明文字末尾省略，「空间明细」靠右一直看得见，不会被右边的按钮挡住 -->
        <DockPanel VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapUp" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,10,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="回到上一级文件夹" VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE72B;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
              <TextBlock Text="上一级" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <TextBlock x:Name="MapPath" Text="还没有扫描" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" MaxWidth="560" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
            <DockPanel>
              <Button x:Name="BtnMapAcct" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="空间明细" FontSize="12" Padding="10,0,2,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed"
                      ToolTip="已用空间都花在哪：文件实际占用、文件表（MFT）、硬链接、压缩和稀疏文件，以及为什么和按文件大小相加对不上"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="MapInfo" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Text, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Self}}" Text="选一块盘，点「扫描」。C 盘通常一两分钟就能扫完。"/>
            </DockPanel>
          </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <!-- 找文件的条件：只在「找文件」时显示 -->
      <WrapPanel x:Name="MapFilter" Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="大小至少" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapMinSize" Width="96" SelectedIndex="2">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="1 MB" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="10 MB" Tag="10"/><ComboBoxItem Content="50 MB" Tag="50"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="100 MB" Tag="100"/><ComboBoxItem Content="500 MB" Tag="500"/><ComboBoxItem Content="1 GB" Tag="1024"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="多久没改过" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapAge" Width="120" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="不限" Tag="0"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 天以上" Tag="30"/><ComboBoxItem Content="半年以上" Tag="182"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="1 年以上" Tag="365"/><ComboBoxItem Content="2 年以上" Tag="730"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="类型" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapType" Width="190" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="全部" Tag=""/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="视频" Tag="video"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="压缩包和安装包" Tag="archive"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="光盘映像和虚拟磁盘" Tag="image"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="图片" Tag="picture"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="音乐" Tag="music"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="文档" Tag="doc"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="程序和游戏数据" Tag="program"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="日志、转储和临时文件" Tag="log"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="代码和开发文件" Tag="code"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="所有者" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapOwner" Width="170" SelectedIndex="0" ToolTip="按文件的所有者（Windows 账户）筛选。只在列出来的这些文件里分">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="全部" Tag=""/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="排序" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapSort" Width="140" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="大的在前" Tag="size"/><ComboBoxItem Content="最近改过的在前" Tag="new"/><ComboBoxItem Content="最久没改的在前" Tag="old"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="名称" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <TextBox x:Name="MapName" Width="150" ToolTip="文件名里包含这些字。可以用 * 和 ?，比如 *.mp4、备份*"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <CheckBox x:Name="MapUnder" Content="只找当前文件夹里的" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,18,2"/>
        <CheckBox x:Name="MapChat" Content="只找聊天软件里的" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,2"
                  ToolTip="微信、QQ、企业微信、飞书、钉钉、Telegram 等聊天记录文件夹里的大文件。这些文件只能查看、打开位置；要腾地方，可以到「搬家管理」把整个聊天记录搬到其他盘。"/>
      </WrapPanel>
      <WrapPanel x:Name="MapGrowBar" Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="和哪次比" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapGrowBase" Width="150" SelectedIndex="0" ToolTip="每次扫描都会存一份快照（每块盘最多留 40 份）。选一个时间，和那时候的快照比">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="上一次扫描" Tag="0"/><ComboBoxItem Content="1 天前" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="3 天前" Tag="3"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="7 天前" Tag="7"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 天前" Tag="30"/><ComboBoxItem Content="最早的一次" Tag="9999"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
      </WrapPanel>
      <WrapPanel x:Name="MapRecentBar" Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="最近" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapRecentDays" Width="120" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="24 小时" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="3 天" Tag="3"/><ComboBoxItem Content="7 天" Tag="7"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 天" Tag="30"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <Button x:Name="BtnMapRecent" Content="查看" Style="{StaticResource Small}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,2"/>
      </WrapPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="4" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,6,0,6">
        <Grid x:Name="MapGrid">
          <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="0"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
          </Grid.RowDefinitions>
          <!-- 概览：这块盘用了多少，系统、个人文件、缓存各占多少（扫描后才有） -->
          <Border x:Name="MapOverview" Grid.Row="0" Margin="18,6,18,8" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                  <TextBlock Text="已使用" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvPct" Text="" FontSize="26" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvTitle" Text="" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvUsed" Text="" FontSize="26" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <Grid x:Name="MapOvBar" Height="10" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="1*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Column="0" Background="#3B82F6" CornerRadius="5,0,0,5" Margin="0,0,1,0"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="1" Background="#E0A731" Margin="0,0,1,0"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="2" Background="#3FA37E" Margin="0,0,1,0"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="3" Background="#8E8E93" Margin="0,0,1,0"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="4" Background="#9B6FD6" CornerRadius="0,5,5,0"/>
              </Grid>
              <WrapPanel x:Name="MapOvLegend" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Canvas x:Name="MapTree" Grid.Row="1" Margin="10,4,10,8" ClipToBounds="True" Background="White" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
          <ListView x:Name="MapList" Grid.Row="2" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource MapRowTpl}" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}" SelectionMode="Extended"
                    ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.ContextMenu>
              <ContextMenu x:Name="MapMenu" Style="{StaticResource Menu}">
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmEnter" Header="打开文件夹" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmOpen" Header="在资源管理器里显示" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmCopy" Header="复制路径" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <Separator Style="{StaticResource MenuSep}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmCompress" Header="压缩（不删文件）" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmDelete" Header="删除…" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
              </ContextMenu>
            </ListView.ContextMenu>
          </ListView>
          <ListView x:Name="MapGrow" Grid.Row="2" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <ListView.View>
              <GridView>
                <GridViewColumn Header="文件夹" Width="480">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Path}" ToolTip="{Binding Path}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="上次" Width="110">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Before}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="这次" Width="110">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Now}"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="变化" Width="120">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Change}" Foreground="{Binding ChangeBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
              </GridView>
            </ListView.View>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyMap" Grid.Row="2" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,0,24" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE9D9;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="34" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyMapText" Text="点右上角「扫描」，看看这块盘的空间都去哪了" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
      </Border>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="5" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapOpen" Content="打开位置" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapCompress" Content="压缩（不删文件）" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="用 NTFS 压缩这个文件夹：文件照常打开、照常修改，只是占的空间变小。适合不常用的资料、旧项目"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapDelete" Content="删除…" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="18,6" IsEnabled="False"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <CheckBox x:Name="MapAll" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Content="全选" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapCkVis}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="18,0,12,0" ToolTip="选中这一层列出的全部项目；再点一下全部取消"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="MapSel" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="2,0,16,0"
                   Text="选中一行可以打开位置、压缩或删除；勾选前面的方框，或按住 Ctrl、Shift，可以选多项一起删；按住鼠标（左键或右键）上下拖可以一次选中连着的几行。系统文件夹、软件安装文件夹、C 盘个人文件夹和搬家后的数据带小锁，不能在这里删。"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 省空间（不删文件） ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageSave" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="SaveScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel Margin="30,24,30,28" MaxWidth="900" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
          <DockPanel>
            <Button x:Name="BtnSaveRefresh" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="刷新" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0"/>
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="省空间" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="不删任何文件也能腾出空间：系统压缩、把大系统文件挪到其他盘、压缩不常用的文件夹和虚拟磁盘。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </DockPanel>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardCos" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                <Button x:Name="BtnCosOff" Content="关闭" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnCosOn" Content="开启" Style="{StaticResource Primary}"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="系统压缩（CompactOS）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveCosState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="Windows 自带的功能：把系统文件压缩存放，通常能省 2 到 4 GB，不影响使用。压缩要 10 到 30 分钟，期间可以照常用电脑。固态硬盘几乎感觉不到变慢；很老的机械硬盘电脑不建议开。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardPf" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="页面文件（pagefile.sys）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SavePfState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                         Text="内存不够用时，Windows 把暂时用不到的数据放进这个文件，通常有几个 GB 到十几 GB。可以把它放到其他硬盘，C 盘就不再占这块空间。要重启电脑才生效。改了以后蓝屏时可能无法保存完整的内存转储，对普通用户没有影响；如果有问题，随时点「恢复系统默认」。"/>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <ComboBox x:Name="SavePfDrive" Width="220" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnPfMove" Content="改到这块盘" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnPfAuto" Content="恢复系统默认"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardHib" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="休眠文件（hiberfil.sys）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SaveHibState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                         Text="休眠和「快速启动」用的文件，大小约等于内存的四成到七成。「只留快速启动」能缩小到原来的一半左右，开机速度不变，只是不能手动休眠；「关闭休眠」整个删掉它，睡眠不受影响，只是没有休眠和快速启动。"/>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <Button x:Name="BtnHibReduced" Content="只留快速启动（缩小）" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnHibOff" Content="关闭休眠" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnHibFull" Content="恢复完整休眠"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardRp" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <Button x:Name="BtnRestoreOpen" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="打开系统保护设置" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="系统还原点（卷影副本）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveRpState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="装更新、装驱动之前 Windows 会自动建还原点，系统出问题时可以退回去。还原点放在 C 盘的 System Volume Information 里（空间地图里带小锁的那个文件夹），只记改动过的部分，占的空间有上限，到了上限会自动删掉最旧的。觉得占得多，可以在 Windows 的「系统保护」里点「配置」，调小「最大使用量」，或者删掉这块盘的全部还原点（删了就不能再退回去）。本工具不直接删还原点。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardFc" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <Button x:Name="BtnFolderCompress" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="选择文件夹…" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="压缩文件夹（NTFS 压缩）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="文件照常打开、照常修改，只是占的空间变小。文档、代码、日志、旧项目通常能省一半；照片、视频、压缩包本身已经压缩过，几乎省不了。也可以在「空间地图」里选中文件夹直接压缩。"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveFcState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardOd" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <Button x:Name="BtnOdFree" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="改成仅在线" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="OneDrive 文件改成「仅在线」" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveOdState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="同步过的文件本地都留着一份副本。改成「仅在线」后文件还在云端，资源管理器里照常显示，打开时才下载，本地不再占空间。什么都不删。你设了「始终保留在此设备」的文件不动；OneDrive 要开着才会真正释放。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardRs" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                <Button x:Name="BtnRsOn" Content="重新开启" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnRsOff" Content="关闭" IsEnabled="False"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="Windows 保留的存储" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveRsState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="Windows 给系统更新预留的空间，通常 7 GB 左右，空间明细里的「其他」有一部分就是它。关掉以后这块空间还给你，更新时 Windows 改为临时借用空闲空间；C 盘很满时更新可能提示空间不够，再开回来就好。有更新正在安装时改不了。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardCs" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                <Button x:Name="BtnCsAnalyze" Content="分析" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnCsClean" Content="去清理"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="组件存储（WinSxS）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveCsState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="点「分析」让 Windows 算一下实际多大、能清多少（要一两分钟）。"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="C:\Windows\WinSxS 看着很大，其中很多文件和 System32 是同一份（硬链接），真正能清的是更新替换下来的旧组件。Windows 自己能算出可回收多少、建不建议清理；清理在「清理 C 盘」里的「WinSxS 组件清理 (DISM)」。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardDump" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                <Button x:Name="BtnDumpSmall" Content="改成小转储" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnDumpAuto" Content="恢复自动"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="蓝屏时保存多大的转储" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveDumpState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="蓝屏时 Windows 会把内存里的内容存成 C:\Windows\MEMORY.DMP，「自动」模式下可能和内存一样大，清掉了下次蓝屏又会生成。改成「小内存转储」只存 256 KB 的摘要，够看出是哪个驱动出的问题。随时可以恢复。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardTmp" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="临时文件夹的位置" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SaveTmpState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                         Text="各软件的临时文件默认放在 C 盘的用户目录里。可以改到其他盘，以后的临时文件就不占 C 盘了。改完要注销再登录（或重启）才对所有软件生效；个别安装程序对 C 盘以外的临时文件夹不兼容，遇到就点「恢复默认」。"/>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <ComboBox x:Name="SaveTmpDrive" Width="220" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnTmpMove" Content="改到这块盘" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnTmpAuto" Content="恢复默认"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardVd" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20,24,14" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="虚拟磁盘、模拟器和虚拟机" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,4"
                         Text="WSL、Docker、安卓模拟器、虚拟机的磁盘文件动辄几十 GB，而且在里面删了东西也不会自动变小。压缩能把空出来的部分还给 Windows；WSL 发行版和文件夹形式的可以整个搬到其他盘。"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="VdList">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <Border BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="0,12,0,10">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0">
                          <Button x:Name="VdOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                          <Button x:Name="VdMove" Content="搬到其他盘" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                          <Button x:Name="VdCompact" Content="压缩" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Path}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Note}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanCompact}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="VdCompact" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanMove}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="VdMove" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                    </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock x:Name="VdEmpty" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" Text="这台电脑上没找到 WSL、Docker、安卓模拟器或虚拟机的磁盘。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SaveCardMerge" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,18" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <Button x:Name="BtnGoDup" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="去找重复文件" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="合并重复文件" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="同一块盘上内容完全相同的文件，可以合并成一份：每个位置的文件都还在，只占一份空间。在「重复文件」页找完后，点「合并为一份」。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 软件管理 ==================== -->
    <!-- ===== 系统健康：硬件、启动、蓝屏、活动监控、事件。读不到的明说读不到 ===== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageHealth" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="HealthScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel Margin="30,24,30,28" MaxWidth="960" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
          <DockPanel>
            <Button x:Name="BtnHealthRefresh" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="刷新" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0"/>
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="系统健康" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="硬件状态、开机用时、蓝屏原因、谁在吃资源。只看不改；读不到的数据直接写明读不到，不用估算冒充。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </DockPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="HealthNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" Text="正在读取…"/>

          <!-- 硬件：每一项一张小卡片 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardHw" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="硬件" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthCards" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <Border Width="290" Margin="0,0,12,12" Padding="0" Background="#F7F7F9" CornerRadius="10" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="5" Background="{Binding Stripe}" CornerRadius="10,0,0,10"/>
                        <StackPanel Margin="14,10,14,12">
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Sub}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                          <Grid x:Name="HcBar" Margin="0,8,0,0" Height="6">
                            <Border Background="#EBEBF0" CornerRadius="3"/>
                            <Border Background="{Binding BarBrush}" CornerRadius="3" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Width="{Binding BarW}"/>
                          </Grid>
                          <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Chips}" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                              <DataTemplate>
                                <Border Background="{Binding Bg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}" FontSize="11.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding Fg}"/></Border>
                              </DataTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                          </ItemsControl>
                          <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Lines}">
                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/></DataTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                          </ItemsControl>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasBar}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="HcBar" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                    </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="温度、磨损来自 SMART 和 ACPI；CPU 内核温度和显卡温度 Windows 不提供，要厂商工具。所有数字都是读取那一刻的。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <!-- 开机 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardBoot" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="开机用时" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthBootText" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text=""/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthSlow" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding Body}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding Head}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Path}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="数据来自 Windows 自己的「诊断-性能」日志（事件 100 和 101）。拖慢开机的程序可以到「软件管理 → 开机启动」里关掉。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <!-- 蓝屏和崩溃 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardCrash" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnSfcCheck" Content="检查系统文件（只看）" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="在终端窗口里运行 sfc /verifyonly 和 DISM /ScanHealth：只检查，不改任何东西。要几分钟"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnSfcRepair" Content="修复系统文件…" ToolTip="在终端窗口里运行 sfc /scannow 和 DISM /RestoreHealth：会把损坏的系统文件换成正常的副本（会改系统文件，可能要联网下载）。点了会先确认"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="蓝屏和崩溃" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthCrashText" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text=""/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthDumps" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <Border Background="#F7F7F9" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12,8" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" x:Name="DumpOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding When}" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Code}" Margin="10,0,0,0" FontFamily="Consolas"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Suspect}" Margin="10,0,0,0" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding SuspectBrush}"/>
                          </StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Detail}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthEventsHead" Text="最近 30 天的相关事件" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthEvents">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding Body}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Top"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding Head}" TextWrapping="Wrap" ToolTip="{Binding Path}"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthDriversHead" Text="最近 30 天装的驱动" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthDrivers">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding Body}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding Head}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Path}"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="转储文件是本工具自己解析的（错误码、参数、出事时加载的驱动、栈上出现的驱动），不如 WinDbg 准确；「可能的驱动」只是提示，不是定论。蓝屏时间和最近装的驱动对得上的，优先怀疑那个驱动。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <!-- 活动监控 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardMon" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                      <RadioButton x:Name="MonSortWrite" GroupName="monsort" Content="写入最多" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="MonSortCpu" GroupName="monsort" Content="CPU 最高" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="MonSortMem" GroupName="monsort" Content="内存最多" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnMonStart" Content="开始监控" Style="{StaticResource Primary}"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnMonStop" Content="停止" Margin="8,0,0,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="谁在让电脑变慢" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="HealthMonText" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="点「开始监控」，每 3 秒采一次样：各个程序这段时间用了多少 CPU、占多少内存、往磁盘写了多少。不装常驻服务，关掉本工具就停。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <ListView x:Name="MonList" Margin="0,12,0,0" MaxHeight="420" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}">
                <ListView.View>
                  <GridView>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="程序" Width="250">
                      <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><StackPanel><TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/><TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></StackPanel></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="CPU" Width="70"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding CpuText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="内存" Width="90"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding WsText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="写入速度" Width="100"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding RateText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="本次监控写入" Width="200">
                      <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><Border Width="{Binding Bar}" Height="8" Background="#3B82F6" CornerRadius="4" VerticalAlignment="Center"/><TextBlock Text="{Binding SinceText}" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></StackPanel></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="启动以来写入" Width="110"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding TotalText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                  </GridView>
                </ListView.View>
              </ListView>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="「启动以来写入」是 Windows 从进程启动起累计的，重启过的进程从头算；写入量不等于磁盘净占用增长（临时文件写了又删）。哪个进程写了哪个文件，只有监控开着的时候能对上：把「空间地图 → 最近改动」里变大的文件夹和这里写入多的程序放在一起看。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <!-- Windows 事件 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardEvents" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="Windows 事件：最近 7 天的严重错误" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthWinText" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text=""/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthErrors" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding Body}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Top"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding Head}" TextWrapping="Wrap" ToolTip="{Binding Path}"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="系统日志里「严重」和「错误」两级，按来源归并。很多错误是无害的（比如某个服务启动慢了一次）；同一个来源反复出现、时间又和故障对得上的才值得查。详细内容在 Windows 的「事件查看器」里。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>
    <Grid x:Name="PageApps" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsUpdates" Content="检查新版本" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="用 Windows 自带的 winget 查一下装过的软件有没有新版本。只在你点的时候联网，只查不改"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsRefresh" Content="刷新"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="软件管理" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="装过的软件按占用空间从大到小排。装在 C 盘的可以「搬到其他盘」，软件照常使用、不用重装；不用的可以直接卸载，卸载后再检查有没有残留文件夹。开机启动的程序、第三方的计划任务和右键菜单也在这里管。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,0,0,10">
        <Border x:Name="AppsViewBox" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewApps" GroupName="appsv" Content="软件" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewStartup" GroupName="appsv" Content="开机启动" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewTasks" GroupName="appsv" Content="计划任务" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewMenu" GroupName="appsv" Content="右键菜单" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewLeft" GroupName="appsv" Content="残留文件夹" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <Border x:Name="AppsFilterBox" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsAll" GroupName="appsf" Content="全部" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsC" GroupName="appsf" Content="装在 C 盘的" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsStore" GroupName="appsf" Content="应用商店" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock x:Name="AppsInfo" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="14,0,0,0" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Text, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Self}}"/>
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE721;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <TextBox x:Name="AppsSearch" MaxWidth="320" HorizontalAlignment="Left" MinWidth="200" ToolTip="按名字或发行商搜索"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="2" x:Name="AppsLeftBox" Background="#FFF8EC" BorderBrush="#F3D9A8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="16,10" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsLeftClose" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="不用了" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsLeft" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="检查残留" Style="{StaticResource Small}"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="AppsLeftText" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,6,0,6">
        <Grid>
          <ListView x:Name="AppsList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}"
                    ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Grid Margin="12,8,10,8">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="40"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                  </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Border Width="30" Height="30" CornerRadius="8" Background="#EFEFF4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Icon}" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#6E6E73" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                  </Border>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="3" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="AppUpgrade" Content="升级" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Foreground="#0066CC" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"
                            ToolTip="在终端窗口里用 winget 升级这个软件，过程和提示都看得见"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppMove" Content="搬到其他盘" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="{DynamicResource AppMoveVis}"
                            ToolTip="把整个安装文件夹搬到其他盘，C 盘原位置留一个链接，软件照常使用，不用重装"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppUninstall" Content="卸载" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanMove}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="AppMove" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasUpgrade}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="AppUpgrade" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
          </ListView>
          <!-- 开机启动 / 计划任务 / 右键菜单：同一个列表，按视图换内容 -->
          <ListView x:Name="StartList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}" Visibility="Collapsed"
                    ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Grid Margin="12,8,10,8">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                  </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Detail}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,1,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding Detail}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding StatusText}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="StartOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="StartToggle" Content="{Binding ToggleText}" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" MinWidth="64"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Open}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="StartOpen" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Ours}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="StartToggle" Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"/><Setter TargetName="StartToggle" Property="ToolTip" Value="本工具自己的任务，请在「自动提醒」页开关"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyApps" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE71D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyAppsText" Text="正在读取已安装的软件…" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
      </Border>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 搬家管理 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageMoves" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <Button x:Name="BtnMovesRefresh" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="刷新" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0" ToolTip="重新看看 C 盘上还有什么能搬，并刷新已经搬走的状态"/>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="搬家管理" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="把 C 盘上的聊天记录、软件和其他大文件夹搬到其他盘，原位置留一个链接，软件照常使用。搬走的也在这里：看链接是否正常、搬回 C 盘、修复断掉的链接。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,0,0,12">
        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="MovesTabCand" GroupName="movestab" Content="可以搬的" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MovesTabDone" GroupName="movestab" Content="已经搬走的" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock x:Name="MovesInfo" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="2,0,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
      </DockPanel>
      <Grid Grid.Row="2">
        <!-- 可以搬的：按聊天记录、软件、其他文件夹分组，勾选后一起搬 -->
        <ListView x:Name="CandList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource PlainRow}" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource CandRowTpl}"
                  ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
          <ListView.GroupStyle>
            <GroupStyle ContainerStyle="{StaticResource CardGroup}"/>
          </ListView.GroupStyle>
        </ListView>
        <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyCand" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyCandText" Text="正在看 C 盘上还有什么能搬…" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxWidth="520" TextAlignment="Center"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <!-- 已经搬走的 -->
        <Border x:Name="MovesCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,6,0,6" Visibility="Collapsed">
          <Grid>
          <ListView x:Name="MovesList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}" ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Grid Margin="14,10,10,10">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                  </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,12,0">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                    <TextBlock FontSize="11.5" Foreground="#86868B" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0">
                      <Run Text="{Binding Src, Mode=OneWay}"/><Run Text="  →  "/><Run Text="{Binding Dst, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                    </TextBlock>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="MvOpen" Content="打开" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="MvFix" Content="修复链接" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                    <Button x:Name="MvDrop" Content="删除多余副本" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                    <Button x:Name="MvBack" Content="搬回 C 盘" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanFix}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="MvFix" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanDrop}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="MvDrop" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanBack}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="MvBack" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyMoves" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyMovesText" Text="还没有搬过文件夹。在「可以搬的」里勾选要搬的项目，或者在「清理 C 盘」里选「搬到其他盘」，搬好的就会出现在这里。" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxWidth="520" TextAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
        </Border>
      </Grid>
      <DockPanel x:Name="CandStore" Grid.Row="3" Margin="2,10,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <Button x:Name="BtnCandStore" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="打开 Windows 设置" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="CandStoreText" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
      </DockPanel>
      <DockPanel x:Name="CandBar" Grid.Row="4" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
          <TextBlock Text="搬到" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MovesDest" Width="320" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnCandMove" Content="搬到其他盘" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="20,6" IsEnabled="False"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <Button x:Name="BtnCandAll" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全选" Margin="0,0,12,0" ToolTip="勾选所有聊天记录和软件。「其他文件夹」请看清说明再自己勾选"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnCandNone" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全不选" Margin="0,0,16,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="CandSel" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#6E6E73" Text="勾选要搬的项目。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 自动提醒 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageAuto" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel Margin="30,24,30,28" MaxWidth="900" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
          <TextBlock Text="自动提醒" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="C 盘快满或者垃圾攒多了时提醒你，定期自动清一次缓存，并记下空间的变化。两项都默认关闭，打开开关才生效。开启后由 Windows 自己定时运行，不需要一直开着本工具，也不需要开机启动。"/>

          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <CheckBox x:Name="AutoRemindOn" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <TextBlock Text="C 盘空间不足时提醒我" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <TextBlock Text="剩余空间低于" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                <ComboBox x:Name="AutoRemindGB" Width="100">
                  <ComboBoxItem Content="10 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="20 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="50 GB"/>
                </ComboBox>
                <TextBlock Text="时，在屏幕右下角弹出提醒（每天最多一次）" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="AutoJunkRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                <TextBlock Text="可以清理的临时文件、缓存和日志超过" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                <ComboBox x:Name="AutoJunkGB" Width="100">
                  <ComboBoxItem Content="不提醒"/><ComboBoxItem Content="1 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="2 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="5 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="10 GB"/>
                </ComboBox>
                <TextBlock Text="时也提醒（检查时只统计，不删任何东西）" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="AutoRemindNote" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,12,0,0" Foreground="#6E6E73"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <CheckBox x:Name="AutoCleanOn" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <TextBlock Text="定期自动清理" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <TextBlock Text="什么时候清理" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                <ComboBox x:Name="AutoCleanWhen" Width="110">
                  <ComboBoxItem Content="每周日"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周一"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周二"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周三"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周四"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周五"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周六"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每天"/>
                </ComboBox>
                <TextBlock Text="中午 12:30（错过了就在下次开机后）" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,10,0,0"
                         Text="不用开着本工具。到时间由 Windows 任务计划在后台自动做一遍「安全清理」里的项目：临时文件、各类缓存和日志。不搬家、不清空回收站、不碰任何个人文件夹、不碰你自己加的文件夹，也不会关闭正在运行的软件（被占用的文件直接跳过）。做完在右下角告诉你释放了多少，每一项都记在「操作日志」里。"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="AutoCleanNote" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,10,0,0" Foreground="#6E6E73"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="C 盘空间变化" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HistInfo" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,12" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
              <Border Height="150" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1">
                <ItemsControl x:Name="HistChart" VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
                  <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                  <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <Border Width="16" Height="{Binding H}" Background="{Binding Fill}" CornerRadius="4,4,0,0" Margin="2,0" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}"/>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
              </Border>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,6,0,0">
                <TextBlock x:Name="HistLast" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="HistFirst" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                         Text="柱子越高表示 C 盘已经用掉的越多（每天取最后一次记录）。每次打开本工具、每次定时检查都会记一笔。想知道是哪些文件夹变大了，到「空间地图」扫一遍，再选「和上次比」。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 操作日志 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageLog" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnLogOpenDir" Content="打开日志文件夹" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnLogRefresh" Content="刷新"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="操作日志" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="删除、搬运、合并、压缩、卸载和系统设置的每一次改动都记在这里，可以按类别、时间和关键字查找。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="20,14" Margin="0,0,0,12">
        <DockPanel>
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Left" Margin="0,2,24,0">
            <TextBlock Text="日志保存时间" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
            <ComboBox x:Name="LogKeep" Width="150" Margin="0,8,0,0">
              <ComboBoxItem Content="1 个月" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="3 个月" Tag="3"/><ComboBoxItem Content="半年（默认）" Tag="6"/>
              <ComboBoxItem Content="1 年" Tag="12"/><ComboBoxItem Content="2 年" Tag="24"/><ComboBoxItem Content="永久保存" Tag="0"/>
            </ComboBox>
          </StackPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="LogKeepNote" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Foreground="#3A3A3C"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <WrapPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,0,0,10">
        <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" Margin="0,0,12,6" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <StackPanel x:Name="LogCats" Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="全部" Tag="" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="删除" Tag="删除" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="搬运" Tag="搬运" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="合并" Tag="合并" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="压缩" Tag="压缩" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="卸载" Tag="卸载" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="系统设置" Tag="系统设置" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" Margin="0,0,12,6" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <StackPanel x:Name="LogRange" Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton GroupName="logrange" Content="7 天" Tag="7" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logrange" Content="30 天" Tag="30" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logrange" Content="全部" Tag="0" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <TextBox x:Name="LogSearch" Width="220" Margin="0,0,12,6" ToolTip="按文件名、文件夹或操作搜索"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="LogCount" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
      </WrapPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,0,0,6">
        <Grid>
          <ListView x:Name="LogList" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}"
                    VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.View>
              <GridView>
                <GridViewColumn Header="时间" Width="150">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Time}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="类别" Width="84">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <Border CornerRadius="9" Padding="8,1,8,2" Background="{Binding CatBg}" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding CatText}" FontSize="11.5" Foreground="{Binding CatFg}"/>
                      </Border>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="操作" Width="210">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding What}" ToolTip="{Binding What}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="对象" Width="360">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Target}" ToolTip="{Binding Target}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="详情" Width="250">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Detail}" ToolTip="{Binding Detail}" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
              </GridView>
            </ListView.View>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyLog" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" Margin="0,30,0,0">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE81C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyLogText" Text="还没有操作记录" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
      </Border>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 设置：外观、语言、显示哪些内容 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageSettings" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="SetScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel Margin="30,24,30,28" MaxWidth="900" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
          <DockPanel>
            <Button x:Name="BtnSetReset" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="恢复默认显示" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0"
                    ToolTip="页面、按钮、列和说明全部恢复成默认显示。外观、语言和扫描设置不变"/>
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="设置" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="外观、语言，以及界面上显示哪些内容。用不上的页面、按钮和说明可以关掉，界面更清爽；随时可以回来打开，不会丢任何设置和记录。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </DockPanel>

          <Border x:Name="SetCardMode" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="使用模式" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="按你的需要决定界面上有多少东西。换模式不会丢任何设置和记录，随时可以换回来。"/>
              <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SetModeBasic" GroupName="mode" Content="普通用户" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SetModePro" GroupName="mode" Content="工程师" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SetModeExpert" GroupName="mode" Content="开发者和 IT" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetModeNote" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="外观和语言" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <Border DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetThemeLight" GroupName="settheme" Content="浅色" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetThemeDark" GroupName="settheme" Content="深色" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetThemeSystem" GroupName="settheme" Content="跟随系统" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <TextBlock Text="外观" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="跟随系统会照 Windows 设置里「选择应用模式」来。换了以后本工具会关闭，再自动打开。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <Border DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetLangZh" GroupName="setlang" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetLangEn" GroupName="setlang" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <TextBlock Text="界面语言" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="换了以后本工具会关闭，再用新的语言打开。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SetCardDisplay" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="界面上显示什么" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock Text="左侧显示的页面" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="「清理 C 盘」「空间地图」「帮助」和「设置」一直显示。关掉的页面只是不在左侧列出，里面的设置、搬家记录和自动提醒都照旧。"/>
              <WrapPanel Margin="0,2,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageDup" Content="重复文件" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageSave" Content="省空间" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageApps" Content="软件管理" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageHealth" Content="系统健康" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageMoves" Content="搬家管理" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageAuto" Content="自动提醒" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageLog" Content="操作日志" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
              </WrapPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="左下角的按钮" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,18,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="外观和语言也可以在这一页上面改；「使用反馈」和「运行记录」也在「帮助」页里。"/>
              <WrapPanel Margin="0,2,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkTheme" Content="外观" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkLang" Content="切换语言" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkFeedback" Content="使用反馈" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkLog" Content="运行记录" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
              </WrapPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageSub" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="页面标题下的说明" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="每一页标题下面那行灰色的说明文字。用熟了可以关掉，列表能多显示几行。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapCheck" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="项目复选框" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="每一行前面显示一个复选框（和资源管理器「查看」里的「项目复选框」一样）：只有点方框才选中或取消，单击行的其他地方不会选中，按 Esc 全部取消。关掉就照 Windows 列表原来的做法：单击选中一行，按住 Ctrl、Shift 多选。开不开都可以按住鼠标（左键或右键）上下拖，一次选中连着的几行。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapBar" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="占比条" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="名字右边的蓝色横条，一眼看出谁大。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapPct" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="百分比" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="占这一层的百分之几。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapMeta" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="名字下面的详细信息" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="文件个数、最近修改时间、比上次扫描变了多少、链接指向哪里。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapDisk" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="实际占用和硬链接" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="快速扫描时在名字下面注明：压缩、稀疏和只在云端（OneDrive 等）的文件实际占的盘比文件大小小；WinSxS 这类文件夹里很多文件和系统其他位置是同一份（硬链接），删了也不腾空间。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapHealth" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="磁盘健康卡片" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="页面上方每块盘一张卡片：用了多少、健康状态，固态硬盘还有温度、磨损和通电时间。只读，不改任何东西。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapFastBtn" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="右上角的「快速扫描」开关" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="关掉只是不在空间地图上显示这个开关；快速扫描本身在下面「扫描和查重」里开关。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SetCardScan" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="扫描和查重" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetFast" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="快速扫描" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="直接读取 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多，还能看出实际占用和硬链接。少数安全软件对直接读盘会提示，可以关掉，改为逐个文件夹扫描。清理、搬家、软件管理统计大小时也按这个设置。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetLowIo" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="查重复文件时让着其他程序" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="读文件时用 Windows 的后台模式，磁盘和内存都排在其他程序后面：不拖慢正在用的程序，也不把它们缓存在内存里的数据挤掉。电脑空闲时速度基本不受影响，同时在做别的事时查得慢一些。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          <Border x:Name="SetCleanCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0,14,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="清理列表" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <DockPanel x:Name="SetRecycleRow" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <CheckBox x:Name="SetRecycle" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="删除时先放进回收站" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="手动清理删掉的文件先放进回收站，删错了可以从回收站恢复。慢一些，回收站会变大（清空回收站才真正腾出空间）；太大放不进回收站的文件，Windows 会问你。定期自动清理不受这个影响，照样直接删。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetCustomHead" Text="自己加的文件夹" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetCustomNote" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="清理时删掉这些文件夹里的东西，文件夹本身保留。在「清理 C 盘」页单独列成一组，默认选「删除」，每次执行前照样要确认；定期自动清理不碰它们。个人文件夹、系统文件夹和软件的安装文件夹加不进来。"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="SetCustomList" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <Button x:Name="SetListRemove" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="移除" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="12.5" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding}" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding}"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetCustomEmpty" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="还没有加。" Margin="0,6,0,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnSetCustomAdd" Content="添加文件夹…" Style="{StaticResource Small}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetExcludeHead" Text="排除的文件夹" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,20,0,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetExcludeNote" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="清理时一律不碰这些文件夹和里面的东西，估算大小时也不算。比如临时文件夹里某个你要留着的子文件夹。"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="SetExcludeList" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                      <Button x:Name="SetListRemove" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="移除" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="12.5" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="{Binding}" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding}"/>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock x:Name="SetExcludeEmpty" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="还没有排除。" Margin="0,6,0,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnSetExcludeAdd" Content="添加文件夹…" Style="{StaticResource Small}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 帮助：使用说明、安全风险提示、使用反馈 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageHelp" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="HelpScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel Margin="30,24,30,28" MaxWidth="880" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
          <TextBlock Text="帮助" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="使用说明、安全风险提示，以及怎么反馈问题。"/>
          <Border x:Name="RiskCard" Background="#FFF6F6" BorderBrush="#F3C4C8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="24,20,24,20" Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <DockPanel>
              <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#D70015" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,1,14,0"/>
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="安全风险提示" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" Foreground="#A1000F"/>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>删除操作会把文件从电脑上移除。没有放进回收站的文件，删除后通常无法恢复，可能造成资料丢失。</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>每次删除前，请确认这些资料确实不再需要、删除不会给你带来损失。重要资料请先备份。</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>本工具只按你的选择执行操作。因使用本工具删除、搬移文件造成的资料丢失或其他损失，</Run><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#A1000F">责任由使用者自行承担，开发者不承担责任</Run><Run>。</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Foreground="#86868B" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>继续使用本工具，即表示你已了解并接受上述风险。</Run></TextBlock>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,18,22,22" Margin="0,16,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE768;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><TextBlock Text="快速上手" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
              <Grid Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="10"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="1" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="一键清理" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「清理 C 盘」页点「一键清理」。先扫描，再处理默认选中的项目：删除缓存、临时文件和日志，把微信、QQ 等聊天记录搬到空间最大的其他盘。开始前会列出全部项目让你确认。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="2" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="自己挑选" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>先点「扫描」，在每一行选「删除」「搬到其他盘」或「跳过」，再点右下角「执行所选操作」。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="3" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="找重复文件" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在左边切到「重复文件」，选好位置和条件，点「开始查找」。核对勾选后，点「删除勾选的文件」。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="11" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,11,0"><TextBlock Text="4" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="看谁占地方" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在左边切到「空间地图」，选 C 盘点「扫描」，双击文件夹一层层往里看。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
              </Grid>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <DockPanel Margin="2,30,2,10">
            <Button x:Name="BtnHelpExpand" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全部展开" FontSize="12.5" VerticalAlignment="Bottom"/>
            <TextBlock Text="功能说明" Style="{StaticResource HelpListHead}"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <StackPanel x:Name="HelpSections">
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="清理 C 盘" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="删除缓存和临时文件；聊天记录整体搬到其他盘" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="列表里有什么" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="100"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="安全清理" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>缓存、临时文件和日志，删了软件会自动重建。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="需确认" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>有代价的项目，默认跳过，看清说明再选。比如删掉 Windows.old 后不能退回旧系统，清空回收站后找不回以前删的文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC"><TextBlock Text="只能搬走" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>「聊天软件的聊天记录」和「其他可搬的文件夹」：数据不能删，只能整体搬到其他盘。</Run></TextBlock>
                </Grid>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="扫完一目了然"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>列表上方写明一共扫到几项、分成几类，每组标题旁也标着几项。项目多时整页往下滚动，底部会提示「下面还有几项」。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="分析占用"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>打开「空间地图」并扫描 C 盘，看清哪些文件夹和文件最占地方。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="清的是哪些缓存"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>几十种：Windows 自己的临时文件、更新缓存、崩溃转储和日志；Chrome、Edge、Firefox、Brave、360、QQ 等浏览器的网页缓存；显卡的着色器缓存；Steam、Epic 的缓存；Adobe 的媒体缓存；Teams、Discord、Slack、VS Code、Spotify、网易云音乐等软件的缓存；pip、npm、NuGet、Go、Rust 等开发工具的下载缓存。电脑上有哪个，扫描后就列出哪个。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>只删缓存，不碰 Cookie、历史记录、密码、设置和保存的数据。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>删了要重新下载、重新生成而且比较慢的（NuGet 全局包、Gradle、Maven、JetBrains 索引、虚幻引擎缓存等）放在「需确认」里，默认跳过。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="驱动残留、失效快捷方式、事件日志"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>都在「需确认」里，默认跳过：显卡和品牌机驱动解压到 C 盘根目录的安装文件；开始菜单里指向已不存在程序的快捷方式（不碰桌面）；Windows 事件日志（排查问题的工程师会看，不确定就跳过）。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Windows Installer 孤儿安装包"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「需确认」里。C:\Windows\Installer 里没有任何已装软件和补丁再引用的安装包，常有好几 GB，判断方法和 PatchCleaner 一样。默认跳过，看清说明再选。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="自己加文件夹、排除文件夹"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「设置」的「清理列表」里（页面右上角「自定义清理项」直达）。加的文件夹单独列成一组，每次删里面的东西、文件夹本身保留；排除的文件夹清理时一律不碰，估算时也不算。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="个人文件夹里的东西一律不删"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频、音乐、收藏夹、OneDrive 等 C 盘个人文件夹，清理时不删除里面的任何文件，误选也会自动跳过。桌面和下载只能「搬到其他盘」（文件原样保留），而且默认跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="搬聊天记录" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="支持的软件"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>微信（新版和旧版）、QQ、企业微信、腾讯会议、飞书、钉钉，以及 Telegram、Discord、Slack、Signal、LINE、Viber、KakaoTalk、Zoom。电脑上装了哪个，扫描后就列出哪个。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>从应用商店装的（比如 WhatsApp、Microsoft Teams）由 Windows 管理，请在 Windows 设置 → 应用里用「移动」换盘。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="搬到哪里"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认选空闲最多的本机硬盘，也可以从下拉框换盘，或点「选择文件夹…」。只能选本机硬盘，网络盘、网盘和 U 盘不行。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="怎么搬"/>
                  <WrapPanel Margin="0,8,0,0">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="1" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="关闭占用的软件" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="2" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="复制到目标盘" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="3" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="核对两边大小" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="4" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="原位置换成链接" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#86868B" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,6"/>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,6"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="5" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="删除 C 盘上的原文件夹" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="6,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                  </WrapPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,1,0,0"><Run>之后 C 盘原位置只剩一个链接，几乎不占空间。软件打开原来的路径时，Windows 自动转到目标盘上读写，软件察觉不到变化，不用改任何设置。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="一个文件都不少才删"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>软件还开着会先提示你退出。复制完重新核对两边的文件个数和大小，一个文件都不少，才删除 C 盘上的原文件夹。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>原文件夹万一仍被别的程序占用，已复制好的副本会保留；退出相关软件后再执行一次，只补复制有变化的文件，很快就好。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#FFF8EC" BorderBrush="#F5E1BC" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#B25E00" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不要动目标盘上的 CDriveMoved 文件夹"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>删除、改名或移动它，微信、QQ 等就会找不到聊天记录和文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8C8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="重复文件" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="找出内容完全相同的文件，留一份、删其余" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="查找条件" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="查找位置"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>点胶囊勾选或取消；「添加文件夹…」可以加自己的位置，带小叉的可以移除。系统目录、程序目录和开发环境会自动跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="文件类型和大小"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>只找选中的类型和大小范围，范围越小找得越快。选「自定义」可以手填大小。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="怎样算重复"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认要求文件名和内容都相同；选「只看内容」时，名字不同但内容相同也算。无论哪种，内容都要逐字节完全相同。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="比对方式"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>「快速」对大文件只抽样读取；「完整比对」读完每个文件，更慢但更彻底。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>快速模式下，删除前也会逐字节完整核对，有任何不同就不删。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="结果和删除" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="留哪一份"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>每组列出所有副本。默认每组留最新的一份、勾选其余的；也可以改成留最早的、优先留 C 盘以外的，或者自己勾选。「打开位置」可以在资源管理器里看到这个文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="放入回收站"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认放入回收站，误删可以从回收站恢复；取消勾选「放入回收站」就是永久删除，不能恢复。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="带「注意」的"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>是程序目录或微信数据里的副本，删除前请看清楚。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="C 盘个人文件夹受保护"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>默认勾选「不删 C 盘个人文件夹里的文件」：桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频、音乐等位置的副本显示一把小锁，不会被勾选或删除，只删其他位置的副本。确实要删这些位置的副本，取消勾选并再次确认才行。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE7B8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="省空间（不删文件）" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="压缩，或者换个位置放，文件都还在" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <Grid Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="10"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="10"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="系统压缩（CompactOS）"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Windows 自带，把系统文件压缩存放，通常省 2 到 4 GB，不影响使用。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="页面文件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把 pagefile.sys 改到其他硬盘，C 盘多出几个 GB。重启后生效，随时可以恢复系统默认。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="休眠文件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>「只留快速启动」能把 hiberfil.sys 缩小一半左右；「关闭休眠」整个删掉它。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="系统还原点"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>显示还原点有几个、占了多少、最多能用到多少。要调小上限或删掉还原点，点「打开系统保护设置」在 Windows 自己的设置里改；本工具不直接删还原点。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="压缩文件夹"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS 压缩：文件照常打开和修改，只是占的空间变小。适合文档、代码、旧项目。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="虚拟磁盘"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>WSL、Docker 的虚拟磁盘在里面删了文件也不会自动变小，压缩一下就能把空间还给 Windows；安卓模拟器和虚拟机的文件夹可以整个搬到其他盘。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="合并重复文件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「重复文件」页点「合并为一份」，同一块盘上的重复文件只占一份空间，每个位置的文件都还在。合并后改动其中一个位置，其他位置会跟着变，所以适合不会再改的照片、视频、安装包。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="OneDrive 改成仅在线"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>同步过的文件本地都留着副本。改成「仅在线」后文件还在云端，资源管理器里照常显示，打开时才下载。什么都不删；设了「始终保留在此设备」的不动。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="8" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="保留的存储"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Windows 给更新预留的 7 GB 左右。关掉就还给你，更新时 Windows 临时借用空闲空间；随时能开回来。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="8" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="组件存储分析"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>让 Windows 算一下 WinSxS 实际多大、能回收多少、建不建议清理，再决定要不要做 DISM 清理。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="10" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="蓝屏小转储"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>蓝屏时只存 256 KB 的小转储，不再生成几个 GB 的 MEMORY.DMP。够看出是哪个驱动出的问题，随时可以恢复自动。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="10" Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="临时文件夹改到其他盘"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>当前用户的 TEMP 指向其他盘，以后的临时文件不占 C 盘。注销再登录后生效；个别安装程序不兼容就恢复默认。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Border Grid.Row="12" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="3" Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="WSL 搬到其他盘"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>用 WSL 自己的 wsl --manage --move 把整个发行版搬走，搬完照常使用。需要 WSL 2.5 以后。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                </Grid>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE9D9;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="看清哪些文件夹和文件最占地方" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="扫描" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="开始扫描"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>选一块盘点「扫描」，把每个文件夹的大小都数一遍。只是查看，不改动任何东西。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么快"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS 格式的盘（C 盘基本都是）直接读盘上的文件表（MFT），几十万个文件一般几秒到十几秒就读完，不用一个个文件夹去看。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>读完会和直接列目录的结果核对。对不上或读不了（不是 NTFS、权限不够等），就自动改回逐个文件夹扫描，多个线程一起数（固态硬盘多一些，机械硬盘少一些）。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>同一次打开工具里再扫描，按系统的变更日志只更新改过的部分，更快。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>读文件表能看到逐个扫描进不去的文件夹（比如 System Volume Information），所以两种方式的总数可能略有出入。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不想直接读盘"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>少数安全软件对直接读盘会提示。取消右上角的「快速扫描」，以后都逐个文件夹扫描；清理、搬家、软件管理统计大小时也一样。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="各页共用一次读取"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>「清理 C 盘」「搬家管理」「软件管理」统计大小时也先读一次 C 盘的文件表。这些数字只用来显示和估算；真正删除、搬家时，每一项都会重新统计、重新检查，不会拿这份结果做判断。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="浏览" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="往里点"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>双击文件夹进入下一层，点「上一级」返回。每一行的蓝色条表示它在这一层里有多大。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>一层里东西很多时（比如 WinSxS 有上万个），只列最大的 500 项，其余合成最后一行；点「打开位置」可以在资源管理器里看全部。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="方块图"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把这一层的文件夹和文件画成方块，方块越大占的空间越多，一眼看出谁最大。单击选中，双击文件夹往里点。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="找文件"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在扫描时记下的 1 MB 以上的文件里找，从大到小排。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>可以按大小、多久没改过（比如半年以上）、类型（视频、压缩包和安装包、光盘映像和虚拟磁盘……）和名称筛选；名称里可以用 * 和 ?，比如 *.mp4。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>勾选「只找当前文件夹里的」，就只找刚才点进去的那个文件夹。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>勾选「只找聊天软件里的」，就只在微信、QQ、企业微信、飞书、钉钉、Telegram 等的聊天记录里找，看清是哪些视频和文件占了地方。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EEF5FD" BorderBrush="#D2E3FA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE946;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="聊天记录里的文件只能查看"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>在这里只能查看、打开位置，不能删。要腾地方，到「搬家管理」把整个聊天记录搬到其他盘。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="和上次比"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>列出比上一次扫描变大或变小超过 100 MB 的文件夹，找出空间是被谁慢慢吃掉的；双击一行跳到那个文件夹。文件夹列表里也会标出「比上次 +2.1 GB」这样的变化。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="导出"/>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">导出 CSV</Run><Run>：把现在看到的列表（文件夹、找到的文件或和上次比的结果）存成 CSV 文件，可以用 Excel 打开、排序、发给别人。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">导出报告</Run><Run>：把整块盘的情况存成一个网页，有方块图、最大的文件夹和文件、各类文件占多少、和上次比的变化；在浏览器里按 Ctrl+P 可以存成 PDF。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="选中和操作" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,10,0,0"><Run>选中后可以「打开位置」「压缩（不删文件）」或「删除」。每一行前面有方框，和资源管理器的「项目复选框」一样：</Run></TextBlock>
                <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="150"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="点方框" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>选中或取消这一行，可以勾一项或多项</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="点行的其他地方" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>不会选中</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="双击文件夹" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>进入下一层</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Shift + 点方框" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>把上次勾的那一行到这一行都勾上</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="4" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="按住左键或右键拖" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>上下拖，一次勾上连着的几行；用右键拖的话，松开后弹出右键菜单</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="5" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="右键点一行" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>菜单只对这一行起作用；点在勾着的行上，就对全部勾着的行起作用</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="6" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}"><TextBlock Text="Esc" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>全部取消</Run></TextBlock>
                </Grid>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不想要复选框"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「设置」里关掉，就照 Windows 列表原来的做法：单击选中一行，按住 Ctrl 或 Shift 多选。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="删除"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>可以选「移到回收站」（能恢复）或「永久删除」（立刻腾出空间），都要先勾选确认。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#F5F5F7" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="带小锁的不能在这里删"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>系统文件夹、软件的安装文件夹（请到「软件管理」卸载）、C 盘个人文件夹，以及搬家后的数据（CDriveMoved 文件夹）。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="实际占用" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="实际占用和硬链接"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>快速扫描时，名字下面会注明压缩、稀疏和只在云端（OneDrive 等）的文件实际只占多少，以及 WinSxS 这类文件夹里有多少是硬链接。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>硬链接是同一份文件在别处也有名字，删了这个名字不腾空间。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="磁盘健康卡片"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>页面上方每块盘一张卡片：用量条、健康状态，固态硬盘还有温度、磨损和通电时间，按档位标色（绿正常、橙要留意、红有问题）。点卡片就选中这块盘。数据从 Windows 的存储可靠性计数器读，只读不改；在「设置」里可以关掉。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="空间明细"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>点「空间明细」，看已用空间分成哪几块：文件实际占用、文件表（MFT）和其他，以及为什么和按文件大小相加对不上。删除时也会写明实际能腾出多少。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE71D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="软件管理" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="看软件占多少；卸载、清残留、搬到其他盘" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="软件列表"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>列出装过的所有软件（包括应用商店里的），按占用空间从大到小排。可以只看装在 C 盘的，或者按名字搜索。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="卸载"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>打开软件自带的卸载程序，按提示操作即可。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查残留"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>卸载完回到这里点「检查残留」，找出以软件名命名、卸载后剩下的文件夹，确认后移到回收站。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>发行商的总文件夹（比如 Tencent、Microsoft）不会被当成残留，系统自带的程序也不会。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="搬到其他盘"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>装在 C 盘的软件可以把整个安装文件夹搬到其他硬盘，C 盘原位置留一个链接。快捷方式、开始菜单、卸载和自动更新都照常可用，不用重装。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>核对两边文件完全一致，才删掉 C 盘上的那份；正在运行的会先问你再关掉。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不适合搬的"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>会直接告诉你原因，不会硬搬：</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>带系统服务或驱动的（杀毒、VPN、驱动、远程控制等）</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>给资源管理器装了右键菜单的，以及输入法</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>微软自己的软件（Office、Visual Studio 等）和 Windows 自带组件</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>文件夹里有链接或用 Windows 压缩功能压过的文件（复制时可能漏掉）</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>没写明装在哪个文件夹的</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>应用商店的软件：请在 Windows 设置 → 应用里用「移动」</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="搬走以后"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「搬家管理」里能看到，随时可以「搬回 C 盘」。以后软件大版本升级时，个别安装程序会把它重新装回 C 盘，到时再搬一次即可。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="残留文件夹"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>找已卸载软件可能留下的文件夹：名字对不上任何已装软件、没有程序在用、一个月没动过、至少 1 MB。只是猜测，先点「打开位置」看一眼再决定；移到回收站，能恢复。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查新版本"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>用 Windows 自带的 winget 查一下装过的软件有没有新版本，只在你点的时候联网。查到的在列表里标出「可升级到」，旁边多一个「升级」按钮：在终端窗口里用 winget 升级，过程和提示都看得见。也可以一次全部升级。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="开机启动、计划任务、右键菜单" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="开机启动"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>和任务管理器「启动应用」一样的来源：注册表里的 Run 项和两个「启动」文件夹。点「禁用」以后开机不再自动启动，程序本身不删，随时可以重新启用。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="计划任务"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>只列第三方的计划任务（Windows 自己的在 Microsoft 文件夹里，不列）。禁用后到时间不再运行，随时可以重新启用。本工具自己的任务请在「自动提醒」页开关。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="右键菜单"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>只列第三方装进资源管理器右键菜单的扩展，系统自带的不列。禁用是写进 Windows 的「Shell Extensions\Blocked」，对新打开的窗口生效，软件本身照常用。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="搬家管理" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="一次搬好几项；看搬走的文件夹是否正常" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="可以搬的" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="批量搬走"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>自动列出 C 盘上还能搬走的东西，分成聊天记录、装在 C 盘的软件和其他文件夹三组，每项都标着大小。勾选后在右下角选好目标盘，点「搬到其他盘」。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>开始前会列出全部项目，要先关掉的软件也会告诉你。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不适合搬的软件"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>带系统服务或驱动的、给资源管理器装了右键菜单的、微软自己的软件等，单独列在「不适合搬的软件」里，写明原因，不能勾选。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>从应用商店装的聊天软件（比如 WhatsApp、Microsoft Teams）由 Windows 管理，页面下方会提示在 Windows 设置里用「移动」换盘。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,26,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="已经搬走的" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,10,0,0"><Run>所有搬到其他盘的文件夹都列在这里，每一项都显示现在的状态：</Run></TextBlock>
                <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="96"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
                  <Border Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="正常" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>数据在目标盘上，C 盘原位置只留一个指向它的链接，不占 C 盘空间，软件照常使用。需要时可以「搬回 C 盘」：复制回来、核对一致后才拆掉链接，最后删除目标盘上的那份。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FDEBEC"><TextBlock Text="链接断了" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#C0101C" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,9"><Run>目标盘拔了或者盘符变了。把硬盘插回去（或改回原来的盘符）就好；如果在其他盘找到了同名的副本，可以「修复链接」改指向它。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="没搬完" FontSize="12.5" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>C 盘原文件夹还在，目标盘上有一份副本。可以在「可以搬的」里再搬一次（只补差异），或者删掉这份多余的副本。</Run></TextBlock>
                </Grid>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE823;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="自动提醒" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="空间不够时提醒，每周自动清理；默认都关着" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="空间不足提醒"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>打开后，每次登录电脑 2 分钟后、以及每天中午各检查一次 C 盘，低于你设定的值（默认 20 GB）就在屏幕右下角提醒，每天最多一次；空间够就什么都不显示。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="垃圾攒多了也提醒"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>可以再设一个界限（比如 2 GB）：检查时顺便统计「安全清理」里的临时文件、缓存和日志，超过就提醒，每天最多一次。只统计，不删任何东西。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="定期自动清理"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>打开后，在你选的时间（每周某一天或每天，中午 12:30）自动清理一次临时文件、缓存和日志。不搬家、不清空回收站、不碰个人文件夹和你自己加的文件夹，被占用的文件直接跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="存储感知"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>页面上会写明 Windows 自带的「存储感知」开没开。开着的话它也会定期清临时文件和回收站，和这里的自动清理不冲突，只是各做一遍。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="C 盘空间变化"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>每次打开本工具、每次定时检查都记一笔，画成最近 30 天的柱状图。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <Border Background="#EEF5FD" BorderBrush="#D2E3FA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,11,16,12" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE946;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,12,0"/>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不用一直开着本工具"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>这两项都由 Windows「任务计划程序」按时运行本工具，也不需要设置开机启动。任务名字以 CleanC 开头，默认关闭，关掉开关就删除任务。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="放在固定的位置"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>请把本工具放在一个固定的位置（比如 D:\工具），不要删掉。挪了位置后打开一次，任务会自动改用新位置。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE81C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="操作日志" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="每一次改动都记下来，可以查" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="记什么"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>删除、搬运、合并、压缩、卸载和系统设置的每一次改动：什么时间、做了什么、对哪个文件或文件夹、结果怎样。只记操作，不保存文件内容。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="怎么查"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>按类别（删除、搬运、合并……）、时间（7 天、30 天、全部）和关键字查找。日志是普通的 txt 文件，每月一个，点「打开日志文件夹」可以用记事本直接看。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="保存多久"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认半年，可以改成 1 个月到 2 年，或者永久保存。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>每次打开本工具时，超过保存时间的记录会自动删除，删掉后找不回来。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>把保存时间改短时，会先提示哪天之前的记录会被删掉。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
            <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpSection}">
              <Expander.Header>
                <DockPanel>
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE713;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="17" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="设置" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="外观、语言，以及界面上显示什么" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Expander.Header>
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="使用模式"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>三种，按你的需要决定界面上有多少东西。第一次打开时会问一句，之后在「设置」最上面随时换，换了不丢任何设置和记录。左下角版本号下面写着当前模式，点一下就到设置。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">普通用户</Run><Run>：清理 C 盘、省空间、空间地图、软件管理、帮助。清理列表里只有常见的缓存和临时文件，删了软件会自动重建；有代价的项目仍然默认跳过。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">工程师</Run><Run>：再加上重复文件、搬家管理、自动提醒、操作日志；空间地图的找文件、和上次比、导出、压缩；省空间的页面文件、还原点、压缩文件夹、虚拟磁盘、合并重复文件；软件管理的开机启动、残留文件夹、检查新版本、搬到其他盘；清理列表里多出开发工具的缓存和驱动残留。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">开发者和 IT</Run><Run>：全部功能。再加上计划任务、右键菜单、保留的存储、组件存储分析、蓝屏转储、临时文件夹位置、自定义清理列表和排除、快速扫描开关、空间明细、检查扫描功能、运行记录，以及 Installer 孤儿安装包、事件日志、NuGet / Gradle / Maven / JetBrains 缓存这类项目。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="外观和语言"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>浅色、深色或跟随系统（照 Windows 设置里「选择应用模式」来），中文或 English。换了以后本工具会关闭，再自动打开。左下角的「外观」和「切换语言」也能改。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="界面上显示什么"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>用不上的页面、左下角的按钮、页面标题下的说明，以及空间地图的复选框、占比条、百分比、详细信息和「快速扫描」开关都可以关掉。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,5,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>关掉的随时可以回来打开，里面的设置和记录都不受影响；「恢复默认显示」一下全部恢复。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="快速扫描"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>直接读 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多，还能看出实际占用和硬链接。关掉就改为逐个文件夹扫描。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="查重复文件时让着其他程序"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>读文件时用 Windows 的后台模式，磁盘和内存都排在其他程序后面，不拖慢正在用的程序；同时在做别的事时，查得会慢一些。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="清理列表"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>自己加要清理的文件夹（删里面的东西，文件夹本身保留），或排除清理时不想碰的文件夹。个人文件夹、系统文件夹和软件的安装文件夹加不进来。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Expander>
          </StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="常见问题" Style="{StaticResource HelpListHead}" Margin="2,30,2,10"/>
          <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,2,22,4">
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpFaq">
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}" BorderThickness="0">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么有些功能找不到？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>多半是使用模式的关系：普通用户模式只显示基础功能，工程师模式多一些，开发者和 IT 模式才是全部。到「设置」最上面换一下模式就有了；另外「界面上显示什么」里手动隐藏过的也要在那里打开。清理列表是扫描时按模式决定列什么的，换了模式再扫描一次。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么要管理员权限？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>清理系统临时文件、Windows 更新缓存等位置，需要管理员权限。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="做到一半能取消吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>可以。进度卡片和窗口底部都有「取消」按钮，会停在安全的地方，已经做完的不会撤销：</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,6,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">清理</Run><Run>：停下来。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">搬家</Run><Run>：如果还在复制，C 盘上的原文件夹不动，已复制的部分留在目标盘，下次再搬会接着复制。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">搬回 C 盘</Run><Run>：复制回来的那一半会删掉，什么都不改。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>正在换成链接、删除备份或运行系统命令（比如清理 Windows 更新）时按钮是灰的，等这一步做完就能取消。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="执行时能关窗口吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>做完前请不要关闭窗口，想停下请点「取消」。可以点「在后台继续」收起进度卡片，窗口底部和任务栏图标上都能看到进度。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="在哪看详细过程？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>做过哪些删除和搬运：看左侧的「操作日志」。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>程序运行的技术细节：看左下角「运行记录」，完整文件在 %TEMP%\CleanC-run.log。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="释放的空间比预计少？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>放进回收站的文件，要清空回收站后才真正释放空间；正被其他程序占用的文件会被跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="能用深色界面吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>可以。在左边的「设置」里（或点左下角的「外观」）选浅色、深色或跟随系统。换了以后本工具会关闭，再自动打开。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="能把用不上的页面和按钮藏起来吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>可以，在左边的「设置」里关掉就行。藏起来的随时可以在那里打开，里面的设置和记录都不受影响。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么扫描出来的合计和「已用空间」对不上？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>按文件大小相加，和盘上实际用掉的空间不是一回事：</Run></TextBlock>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,6,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>硬链接（同一份文件有好几个名字，WinSxS 和 System32 里很多）会重复算。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>压缩、稀疏和只在云端的文件，实际占得比文件大小少。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>文件表（MFT）、NTFS 的日志、Windows 给更新预留的空间（保留的存储）也占地方，但不是普通文件。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>快速扫描后，在空间地图点「空间明细」可以看到每一块各多少。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="WinSxS 看起来很大，能删吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>不能手动删，删了系统可能坏掉。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>里面很多文件和 System32 等位置是同一份（硬链接），资源管理器按名字相加会重复算，实际占的比看上去小；快速扫描时，空间地图会注明其中多少是硬链接。</Run></TextBlock>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>真正能清掉的是更新替换下来的旧组件：用「清理 C 盘」里的「WinSxS 组件清理 (DISM)」。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么不清理 Prefetch 文件夹，也没有「内存加速」？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Prefetch</Run><Run> 里记的是程序启动时要读哪些文件，Windows 靠它让常用软件打开得更快。一共只有几十 MB，删了下次启动反而变慢，过几天又会长回来。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <DockPanel Margin="0,3,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="16" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#86868B"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">内存</Run><Run>也一样：Windows 会把空闲的内存拿来缓存常用的文件（任务管理器里的「已缓存」），别的程序要用时马上让出来，强行清空只会让电脑变慢。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0"><Run>所以这两样本工具都不做。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么没有注册表清理？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>注册表里多几条没用的记录，既不占空间也不影响速度，微软自己的说法是清理注册表没有收益；清错了反而可能让软件打不开、系统出问题，而且很难修。所以本工具不做，和不清 Prefetch、不做「内存加速」是一个道理。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
              <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="怎么知道有没有新版本？"/></Expander.Header>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>在下面「使用反馈」里点「检查新版本」，有新版本会打开下载页面；下载新的 exe 换掉旧的就行，设置、日志和自动提醒都会保留。本工具平时不联网，只在你点这个按钮时连一次 GitHub。</Run></TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
              </Expander>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border x:Name="FeedbackCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,18,22,22" Margin="0,30,0,0">
            <StackPanel>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/><TextBlock Text="使用反馈" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,8,0,0" Text="遇到问题、发现错误或有改进建议，欢迎在 GitHub 上提交问题（Issues）。"/>
              <Border Background="#F5F5F7" CornerRadius="10" Padding="18,14" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                <DockPanel>
                  <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnIssue" Content="提交问题" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="BtnGitHub" Content="打开主页" Padding="14,7"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Border Width="40" Height="40" CornerRadius="20" Background="#E8F0FE">
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE943;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="18" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Border>
                    <StackPanel Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="GitHub 项目主页：下载新版本、看源代码、提交问题" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                      <TextBlock x:Name="GitHubUrl" Text="github.com/Xuanqiyun/ClearC" FontSize="16" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,1,0,0" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Border>
              <StackPanel x:Name="FbCopyDiag" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="附上诊断信息"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="提交问题时附上截图和诊断信息，能更快找到原因。诊断信息包括软件版本、Windows 版本、C 盘空间和最近的运行记录（里面有文件夹路径），贴出去之前可以先看一下。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCopyDiag" Content="复制诊断信息" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnOpenLog" Content="打开运行记录文件"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="CopyHint" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#248A3D" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="FbSelfTest" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,18"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查扫描功能"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="在这台电脑上核对快速扫描：比较直接读文件表和逐个文件夹扫描的结果，再在本工具自己的文件夹里建几个文件、改一改、删掉，看按变更日志更新对不对。只读 C 盘，不动你的文件，大约要一两分钟；结果会复制下来，可以贴到 GitHub 的问题里。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnSelfTest" Content="检查扫描功能"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="FbCheckUpdate" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,18"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查新版本"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="有新版本会打开下载页面，下载新的 exe 换掉旧的就行。只在你点这个按钮时连一次 GitHub。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCheckUpdate" Content="检查新版本"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 底部：进度条（有操作时出现） ==================== -->
    <Border Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="1" x:Name="OpPanel" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,11,16,12" Margin="30,0,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <StackPanel>
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="OpCancel" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="取消" Margin="14,0,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed"
                  ToolTip="停在安全的地方，已经做完的不会撤销"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpTime" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpTitle" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
        </DockPanel>
        <ProgressBar x:Name="OpBar" Height="6" Margin="0,8,0,7" Minimum="0" Maximum="100"/>
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpSubTime" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="12" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpDetail" Foreground="#86868B" FontSize="12" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
        </DockPanel>
        <ProgressBar x:Name="OpSubBar" Height="4" Margin="0,6,0,0" Minimum="0" Maximum="100" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
      </StackPanel>
    </Border>

    <!-- ==================== 运行记录（默认收起） ==================== -->
    <Border Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="2" x:Name="LogPanel" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Height="170" Margin="30,0,30,16" Padding="14,10,6,8" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <DockPanel>
        <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="2,0,8,4">
          <Button x:Name="BtnLogHide" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="收起"/>
          <TextBlock Text="运行记录" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}"/>
        </DockPanel>
        <TextBox x:Name="Log" Style="{StaticResource LogBox}" IsReadOnly="True" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" TextWrapping="NoWrap"
                 HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" FontFamily="Cascadia Mono, Consolas, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="12"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Border>

    <!-- ==================== 进度卡片：执行时盖在窗口中间；做完后留下结果，点「完成」才消失 ==================== -->
    <Border x:Name="Overlay" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Grid.RowSpan="3" Background="#38000000" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="14" Width="640" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Padding="28,24,28,22">
        <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" ShadowDepth="8" Direction="270" Opacity="0.22"/></Border.Effect>
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="OvTime" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="OvTitle" FontSize="17" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <ProgressBar x:Name="OvBar" Height="6" Margin="0,14,0,18" Minimum="0" Maximum="100"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvStep" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvWhat" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,5,0,12"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvChecklist" Margin="2,0,0,8" LineHeight="24" FontSize="13.5"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvDetail" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="12.5" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
          <ProgressBar x:Name="OvSubBar" Height="4" Margin="0,8,0,0" Minimum="0" Maximum="100" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
          <StackPanel x:Name="OvPlanBox" Margin="0,18,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <TextBlock Text="全部项目" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="2,0,0,6"/>
            <Border CornerRadius="9" Padding="14,8" Background="#F5F5F7">
              <ScrollViewer x:Name="OvPlanScroll" MaxHeight="190" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                <TextBlock x:Name="OvPlan" LineHeight="23"/>
              </ScrollViewer>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
          <DockPanel Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <Button x:Name="OvClose" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="完成" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="26,7" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            <Button x:Name="OvHide" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="在后台继续" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
            <Button x:Name="OvCancel" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="取消" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="OvNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
          </DockPanel>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
    </Border>

    <!-- 弹出对话框时把主窗口压暗 -->
    <Border x:Name="Dim" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Grid.RowSpan="3" Background="#33000000" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
  </Grid>
</Window>
"@

# 对话框（代替系统消息框）：圆角白卡片，主窗口同时压暗
$script:sheetXaml = @'
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        WindowStyle="None" AllowsTransparency="True" Background="Transparent" ResizeMode="NoResize" ShowInTaskbar="False"
        SizeToContent="Height" Width="500" WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        FontFamily="Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D1D1F" UseLayoutRounding="True" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Display">
  <Border Margin="20,14,20,28" Background="White" CornerRadius="14" BorderBrush="#D9D9DE" BorderThickness="1">
    <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="34" ShadowDepth="8" Direction="270" Opacity="0.24"/></Border.Effect>
    <StackPanel Margin="26,24,26,20">
      <Grid Width="44" Height="44" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <Ellipse x:Name="SIconBg" Fill="#E8F1FC"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="SIconGlyph" FontFamily="Segoe Fluent Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3"
                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="&#xE946;"/>
      </Grid>
      <TextBlock x:Name="STitle" FontSize="17" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
      <TextBlock x:Name="SText" Margin="0,8,0,0" Foreground="#3A3A3C" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="21"/>
      <Border x:Name="SListBox" Margin="0,14,0,0" Background="#F5F5F7" CornerRadius="9" Padding="14,9" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <ScrollViewer MaxHeight="230" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
          <TextBlock x:Name="SList" LineHeight="22" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Border>
      <Border x:Name="SAckBox" Margin="0,16,0,0" Background="#FFF6F6" BorderBrush="#F3C4C8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="9" Padding="12,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <CheckBox x:Name="SAck" VerticalContentAlignment="Top">
          <TextBlock x:Name="SAckText" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#1D1D1F" LineHeight="20"/>
        </CheckBox>
      </Border>
      <StackPanel x:Name="SButtons" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Border>
</Window>
'@

if ($script:Lang -eq 'en') {
    # 换成英文的帮助页
    try {
        $ns = New-Object System.Xml.XmlNamespaceManager $xaml.NameTable
        $ns.AddNamespace('w', 'http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation'); $ns.AddNamespace('x', 'http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml')
        $old = $xaml.SelectSingleNode("//w:Grid[@x:Name='PageHelp']", $ns)
        $frag = [xml]("<R xmlns='http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation' xmlns:x='http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml'>" + $script:helpEnXaml + '</R>')
        $new = $frag.DocumentElement.SelectSingleNode("w:Grid[@x:Name='PageHelp']", $ns)
        if ($old -and $new) { [void]$old.ParentNode.ReplaceChild($xaml.ImportNode($new, $true), $old) }
    } catch {}
    # 英文词更长：重复文件页左边那一列标签放宽一点
    foreach ($cd in $xaml.SelectNodes("//*[local-name()='ColumnDefinition' and @Width='92']")) { $cd.SetAttribute('Width', '108') }
    # 其余文字逐个查表
    $attrs = @('Text', 'Content', 'ToolTip', 'Header', 'Title')
    foreach ($el in $xaml.SelectNodes('//*')) {
        foreach ($a in @($el.Attributes)) {
            # 触发器里和数据比较的值（比如行的操作「删除」）也要换成同样的英文，否则颜色等样式对不上
            $use = ($attrs -contains $a.LocalName) -or ($a.LocalName -eq 'Value' -and (($el.LocalName -eq 'Setter' -and ($attrs -contains [string]$el.GetAttribute('Property'))) -or $el.LocalName -in @('Condition', 'DataTrigger', 'Trigger')))
            if ($use -and $a.Value -and -not $a.Value.StartsWith('{')) { $a.Value = T $a.Value }
            elseif ($use -and $a.Value -like "*StringFormat='{}{0} 项'*") { $a.Value = $a.Value.Replace("{}{0} 项", '{}' + (T '{0} 项')) }
        }
        foreach ($c in @($el.ChildNodes)) { if ($c.NodeType -eq 'Text' -and $c.Value) { $c.Value = T $c.Value } }
    }
}
$win = $null; $script:themeFail = ''
if ([Theme]::Dark) {
    # 深色版本万一打不开，就用浅色打开（不然连换回浅色的按钮都看不到）
    try { $win = [Windows.Markup.XamlReader]::Parse([Theme]::Xaml($xaml.OuterXml)) } catch { $script:themeFail = $_.Exception.Message; [Theme]::Dark = $false; $win = $null }
}
if (-not $win) { $win = [Windows.Markup.XamlReader]::Load((New-Object System.Xml.XmlNodeReader $xaml)) }
# 深色的窗口标题栏
$win.Add_SourceInitialized({ try { [Theme]::DarkTitle((New-Object System.Windows.Interop.WindowInteropHelper $win).Handle) } catch {} })
$script:tUi = $script:startClock.Elapsed.TotalSeconds
$ctl = @{}
foreach ($n in 'NavSave','NavMap','NavApps','NavMoves','NavAuto','NavLog','PageMap','PageSave','PageApps','PageMoves','PageAuto','PageLog','BtnDupMerge',
               'MapDrive','BtnMapStop','BtnMapScan','MapViewDirs','MapViewFiles','MapViewGrow','BtnMapUp','MapPath','MapInfo','MapList','MapGrow','EmptyMap','EmptyMapText','BtnMapOpen','BtnMapCompress','BtnMapDelete','MapSel',
               'SaveScroll','BtnSaveRefresh','BtnCosOff','BtnCosOn','SaveCosState','SavePfState','SavePfDrive','BtnPfMove','BtnPfAuto','SaveHibState','BtnHibReduced','BtnHibOff','BtnHibFull','BtnFolderCompress','SaveFcState','VdList','VdEmpty','BtnGoDup',
               'BtnAppsRefresh','AppsAll','AppsC','AppsStore','AppsInfo','AppsSearch','AppsLeftBox','BtnAppsLeftClose','BtnAppsLeft','AppsLeftText','AppsList','EmptyApps','EmptyAppsText',
               'BtnAppsUpdates','AppsViewApps','AppsViewStartup','AppsViewTasks','AppsViewMenu','AppsViewLeft','AppsViewBox','AppsFilterBox','StartList','MapHealthBox','MapHealth','MapHealthNote','SetMapHealth',
               'MapViewTypes','MapViewRecent','MapOwner','MapSort','MapGrowBar','MapGrowBase','MapRecentBar','MapRecentDays','BtnMapRecent','MapGrid','MapOverview','MapOvPct','MapOvTitle','MapOvUsed','MapOvBar','MapOvLegend',
               'NavHealth','PageHealth','HealthScroll','BtnHealthRefresh','HealthNote','HealthCardHw','HealthCards','HealthCardBoot','HealthBootText','HealthSlow','HealthCardCrash','BtnSfcCheck','BtnSfcRepair','HealthCrashText','HealthDumps','HealthEventsHead','HealthEvents','HealthDriversHead','HealthDrivers',
               'HealthCardMon','MonSortWrite','MonSortCpu','MonSortMem','BtnMonStart','BtnMonStop','HealthMonText','MonList','HealthCardEvents','HealthWinText','HealthErrors','SetPageHealth',
               'SaveCardCos','SaveCardPf','SaveCardHib','SaveCardRp','SaveCardFc','SaveCardOd','SaveCardRs','SaveCardCs','SaveCardDump','SaveCardTmp','SaveCardVd','SaveCardMerge','SetCardMode','SetCardDisplay','SetCardScan','SetModeBasic','SetModePro','SetModeExpert','SetModeNote','ModeTag','AutoJunkRow','FbCopyDiag','FbSelfTest','FbCheckUpdate','MapViewBox',
               'BtnOdFree','SaveOdState','BtnRsOn','BtnRsOff','SaveRsState','BtnCsAnalyze','BtnCsClean','SaveCsState','BtnDumpSmall','BtnDumpAuto','SaveDumpState','SaveTmpState','SaveTmpDrive','BtnTmpMove','BtnTmpAuto','BtnCleanCustom','AutoJunkGB','AutoCleanWhen','SetCleanCard','SetRecycle','SetRecycleRow','SetCustomHead','SetCustomNote','SetExcludeHead','SetExcludeNote','SetCustomList','SetCustomEmpty','BtnSetCustomAdd','SetExcludeList','SetExcludeEmpty','BtnSetExcludeAdd',
               'BtnMovesRefresh','MovesInfo','MovesList','EmptyMoves','EmptyMovesText',
               'AutoRemindOn','AutoRemindGB','AutoRemindNote','AutoCleanOn','AutoCleanNote','HistInfo','HistChart','HistLast','HistFirst',
               'BtnLogOpenDir','BtnLogRefresh','LogKeep','LogKeepNote','LogCats','LogRange','LogSearch','LogCount','LogList','EmptyLog','EmptyLogText',
               'BtnLang','BtnLangText','BtnTheme','BtnThemeText','NavHelp','PageHelp','HelpScroll','HelpSections','HelpFaq','BtnHelpExpand','FeedbackCard','RiskCard','BtnFeedback','BtnGitHub','BtnIssue','BtnCopyDiag','BtnOpenLog','CopyHint','BtnSelfTest','BtnCheckUpdate','MapFast','MapChat',
               'NavClean','NavDup','PageClean','PageDup','AppVer','BtnLog','BtnLogText','BtnLogHide','LogPanel','Dim',
               'CapFree','CapTotal','CapBar','CapReclaim','EmptyClean','EmptyCleanText','EmptyDup','EmptyDupText','SizeCustomRow',
               'DestPick','BtnDestBrowse','DestHint','BtnOneClick','BtnScan','BtnRun','BtnHogs','Hint','List','Summary','Log',
               'Roots','BtnAddRoot','BtnDupScan','BtnDupStop',
               'FilterExpander','FilterSummary','TypeChips','TypeReset','ExtraExt','SizeChips',
               'SizeMin','SizeMinUnit','SizeMax','SizeMaxUnit','SizeHint','ModeName','ModeContent','SpeedFast','SpeedExact',
               'DupProgressText','DupList','DupRecycle','DupProtect','BtnDupDelete','ModeSimilar','SimilarRow','SimStrict','SimNormal','SimLoose','BtnKeepIn','BtnKeepShort','BtnDupMove',
               'OpPanel','OpTime','OpTitle','OpBar','OpSubTime','OpDetail','OpSubBar','Root',
               'Overlay','OvTitle','OvTime','OvBar','OvStep','OvWhat','OvChecklist','OvDetail','OvSubBar','OvPlanBox','OvPlanScroll','OvPlan','OvHide','OvClose','OvNote',
               'BtnKeepNew','BtnKeepOld','BtnPickC','BtnPickNone','DupSummary',
               'CleanScroll','CleanMore','CleanMoreText','CleanOverview','CleanOverviewText',
               'OvCancel','OpCancel','MovesTabCand','MovesTabDone','CandList','EmptyCand','EmptyCandText','MovesCard','CandStore','BtnCandStore','CandStoreText','CandBar','MovesDest','BtnCandMove','BtnCandAll','BtnCandNone','CandSel','MapViewTree','BtnMapReport','MapTree','BtnMapExport','MapFilter','MapMinSize','MapAge','MapType','MapName','MapUnder',
               'MapAll','BtnMapAcct','MapMenu','MmEnter','MmOpen','MmCopy','MmCompress','MmDelete','NavHeadManage','NavSettings','PageSettings','SetScroll','BtnSetReset',
               'SetThemeLight','SetThemeDark','SetThemeSystem','SetLangZh','SetLangEn','SetPageDup','SetPageSave','SetPageApps','SetPageMoves','SetPageAuto','SetPageLog',
               'SetLinkTheme','SetLinkLang','SetLinkFeedback','SetLinkLog','SetPageSub','SetMapCheck','SetMapBar','SetMapPct','SetMapMeta','SetMapDisk','SetMapFastBtn','SetFast','SetLowIo',
               'SaveRpState','BtnRestoreOpen') { $ctl[$n] = $win.FindName($n) }
# 右键菜单不在窗口的元素树里：万一按名字找不到，就从菜单里一个个取
if (-not $ctl.MmDelete -and $ctl.MapList.ContextMenu) { $ctl.MapMenu = $ctl.MapList.ContextMenu; foreach ($it in $ctl.MapMenu.Items) { if ($it.Name) { $ctl[$it.Name] = $it } } }

# ---------- 左侧导航：两页切换 ----------
$script:pageList = [ordered]@{
    clean = @('PageClean', 'NavClean'); dup = @('PageDup', 'NavDup'); save = @('PageSave', 'NavSave'); map = @('PageMap', 'NavMap'); apps = @('PageApps', 'NavApps'); health = @('PageHealth', 'NavHealth')
    moves = @('PageMoves', 'NavMoves'); auto = @('PageAuto', 'NavAuto'); log = @('PageLog', 'NavLog'); help = @('PageHelp', 'NavHelp'); settings = @('PageSettings', 'NavSettings')
}
$script:pageLoaded = @{}
function Show-Page([string]$key) {
    $script:curPage = $key
    foreach ($k in $script:pageList.Keys) {
        $on = ($k -eq $key)
        $ctl[$script:pageList[$k][0]].Visibility = if ($on) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' }
        $nav = $ctl[$script:pageList[$k][1]]
        if ($nav.IsChecked -ne $on) { $nav.IsChecked = $on }
    }
    # 第一次打开某一页时才去读数据
    switch ($key) {
        'map'   { if (-not $script:pageLoaded.map) { $script:pageLoaded.map = $true; Fill-MapDrives; Start-DiskHealth } }
        'save'  { if (-not $script:pageLoaded.save) { $script:pageLoaded.save = $true; Load-Save } }
        'apps'  { if (-not $script:pageLoaded.apps -and -not $script:worker) { $script:pageLoaded.apps = $true; Load-Apps } }
        'health' { if (-not $script:pageLoaded.health) { $script:pageLoaded.health = $true; Load-Health } }
        'moves' { if (-not $script:candScanned) { $script:candPending = $true }; if (-not $script:worker) { Load-Moves } }
        'auto'  { Load-Auto }
        'log'   { Load-Log }
        'settings' { Load-Settings }
    }
}
foreach ($k in $script:pageList.Keys) {
    $ctl[$script:pageList[$k][1]].Add_Checked({
        foreach ($kk in $script:pageList.Keys) { if ([object]::ReferenceEquals($ctl[$script:pageList[$kk][1]], $this)) { Show-Page $kk } }
    })
}

# ---------- 帮助页：使用反馈 ----------
function Show-CopyHint([string]$t) { $ctl.CopyHint.Text = $t }
$ctl.BtnFeedback.Add_Click({
    Show-Page 'help'
    $ctl.HelpScroll.UpdateLayout()
    $ctl.FeedbackCard.BringIntoView()
})
# 点左侧「帮助」总是回到帮助的开头（先点「使用反馈」滚到下面后，帮助已是选中状态，Checked 不会再触发）
$ctl.NavHelp.Add_Click({ $ctl.HelpScroll.ScrollToTop() })
# 帮助的各节默认收起，点标题展开；「全部展开」一下展开或收起全部
function Get-HelpSections { @($ctl.HelpSections.Children | Where-Object { $_ -is [System.Windows.Controls.Expander] }) }
function Update-HelpExpand {
    $all = Get-HelpSections
    $open = @($all | Where-Object { $_.IsExpanded }).Count
    $ctl.BtnHelpExpand.Content = if ($all.Count -and $open -eq $all.Count) { T '全部收起' } else { T '全部展开' }
}
$script:helpBulk = $false
$ctl.BtnHelpExpand.Add_Click({
    $all = Get-HelpSections
    $open = @($all | Where-Object { -not $_.IsExpanded }).Count -gt 0
    $script:helpBulk = $true
    try { foreach ($x in $all) { $x.IsExpanded = $open } } finally { $script:helpBulk = $false }
    Update-HelpExpand
})
# 单独点开的一节（或一个问题）在页面下方时，往上滚到能看见它的内容
$helpOpened = {
    param($s, $e)
    if (-not [object]::ReferenceEquals($e.OriginalSource, $s)) { return }
    Update-HelpExpand
    if ($script:helpBulk) { return }
    $x = $s
    [void]$win.Dispatcher.BeginInvoke([Action]{ try { $x.BringIntoView() } catch {} }.GetNewClosure(), [System.Windows.Threading.DispatcherPriority]::Loaded)
}
foreach ($x in @(Get-HelpSections) + @($ctl.HelpFaq.Children)) {
    $x.Add_Expanded($helpOpened)
    $x.Add_Collapsed({ param($s, $e) if ([object]::ReferenceEquals($e.OriginalSource, $s)) { Update-HelpExpand } })
}
$script:projectPage = 'https://github.com/Xuanqiyun/ClearC'
function Open-Web([string]$url) {
    # 用资源管理器打开网址：浏览器不会以管理员身份运行
    try { Start-Process -FilePath "$env:SystemRoot\explorer.exe" -ArgumentList $url; UI-Log ((T "打开网页：{0}") -f $url) }
    catch { Show-CopyHint ((T "打不开浏览器，请手动访问 {0}") -f $url) }
}
$ctl.BtnGitHub.Add_Click({ Open-Web $script:projectPage })
$ctl.BtnIssue.Add_Click({ Open-Web ($script:projectPage + '/issues') })
$ctl.BtnCopyDiag.Add_Click({
    $c = $null; try { $c = New-Object System.IO.DriveInfo 'C:\' } catch {}
    $info = @(
        ((T "腾挪 ClearC {0}") -f $script:AppVersion) + $(if ($script:AppBuild) { " ($($script:AppBuild))" } else { '' })
        ((T "Windows {0}，{1} 位") -f [Environment]::OSVersion.Version, $(if ([Environment]::Is64BitOperatingSystem) { 64 } else { 32 }))
        $(if ($c) { (T "C 盘剩余 {0} / 共 {1}") -f (Fmt $c.AvailableFreeSpace), (Fmt $c.TotalSize) } else { '' })
        ((T "屏幕可用区域 {0:N0} x {1:N0}") -f [System.Windows.SystemParameters]::WorkArea.Width, [System.Windows.SystemParameters]::WorkArea.Height)
        ''
        (T '---- 最近的运行记录 ----')
    )
    $tail = @()
    try { $tail = @(Get-Content -LiteralPath $script:logFile -Encoding UTF8 -Tail 80 -ErrorAction Stop) } catch { $tail = @(($ctl.Log.Text -split "`r?`n") | Select-Object -Last 80) }
    try { [System.Windows.Clipboard]::SetText((($info + $tail) -join "`r`n")); Show-CopyHint (T '已复制，可以粘贴到 GitHub 的问题（Issue）里') }
    catch { Show-CopyHint (T '复制失败，可以点「打开运行记录文件」再手动复制') }
})
# ---------- 检查扫描功能（自检）、检查新版本 ----------
$ctl.BtnSelfTest.Add_Click({
    if ($script:worker) { Show-Sheet -Title (T '请等当前操作做完') -Text (T '另一个操作还在进行中。') | Out-Null; return }
    $sync.Mode = 'selftest'; $sync.SelfTest = $null
    Start-Op (T '检查扫描功能')
    UI-Busy $true
    UI-Log (T '开始检查扫描功能')
    Start-Worker @'
$sync.SelfTest = Invoke-SelfTest $arg.Version
'@ @{ Version = $script:AppVersion }
})
$script:releasePage = 'https://github.com/Xuanqiyun/ClearC/releases'
$ctl.BtnCheckUpdate.Add_Click({
    if ($script:worker) { Show-Sheet -Title (T '请等当前操作做完') -Text (T '另一个操作还在进行中。') | Out-Null; return }
    $sync.Mode = 'update'; $sync.Update = $null
    Start-Op (T '检查新版本') -NoCard
    UI-Busy $true
    Start-Worker @'
try {
    [Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol -bor [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12
    $r = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'https://api.github.com/repos/Xuanqiyun/ClearC/releases/latest' -Headers @{ 'User-Agent' = 'ClearC'; 'Accept' = 'application/vnd.github+json' } -TimeoutSec 20 -UseBasicParsing -ErrorAction Stop
    $sync.Update = @{ Ok = $true; Tag = [string]$r.tag_name; Url = [string]$r.html_url; Body = [string]$r.body }
} catch { $sync.Update = @{ Ok = $false; Err = $_.Exception.Message } }
'@ $null
})

$ctl.BtnOpenLog.Add_Click({
    if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $script:logFile) { Start-Process -FilePath "$env:SystemRoot\System32\notepad.exe" -ArgumentList ('"{0}"' -f $script:logFile) }
    else { Show-CopyHint (T '还没有运行记录') }
})

# ---------- 运行记录：默认收起，左下角打开 ----------
function Set-LogVisible([bool]$on) {
    $ctl.LogPanel.Visibility = if ($on) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' }
    $ctl.BtnLogText.Text = if ($on) { (T '收起运行记录') } else { (T '运行记录') }
    if ($on) { $ctl.Log.ScrollToEnd() }
}
$ctl.BtnLog.Add_Click({ Set-LogVisible ($ctl.LogPanel.Visibility -ne 'Visible') })
$ctl.BtnLogHide.Add_Click({ Set-LogVisible $false })

# ---------- 对话框：代替系统消息框。返回点中的按钮文字；按 Esc 或关掉窗口返回 $Cancel ----------
#   Kind：info 蓝色信息 / warn 橙色提醒 / danger 红色删除 / done 绿色完成
function Show-Sheet {
    param([string]$Title, [string]$Text = '', [string[]]$Items = $null, [string[]]$Buttons = @((T '好')),
          [string]$Primary = '', [string]$Cancel = '', [string]$Kind = 'info', [string]$Confirm = '')
    if (-not $Primary) { $Primary = $Buttons[-1] }
    if (-not $Cancel)  { $Cancel = $Buttons[0] }
    if ($script:uiTest) { $script:uiSheets.Add(("{0}`n{1}" -f $Title, $Text)); return $Cancel }   # 界面自测：不弹对话框，当作点了取消
    $sw = $null
    try { $sw = [Windows.Markup.XamlReader]::Parse([Theme]::Xaml($script:sheetXaml)) } catch { $sw = $null }
    if (-not $sw) {
        # 万一自绘对话框出问题，退回系统消息框，保证流程能走下去
        $body = $Text; if ($Items) { $body += "`n`n" + (($Items | ForEach-Object { "  · $_" }) -join "`n") }
        if ($Confirm) { $body += "`n`n" + $Confirm + (T "（点「是」表示你确认这一点）") }
        if ($Buttons.Count -le 1) { [System.Windows.MessageBox]::Show($win, $body, $Title) | Out-Null; return $Buttons[0] }
        $r = [System.Windows.MessageBox]::Show($win, $body, $Title, 'YesNo')
        if ($r -eq 'Yes') { return $Primary } else { return $Cancel }
    }
    foreach ($k in @($win.Resources.Keys)) { try { $sw.Resources[$k] = $win.Resources[$k] } catch {} }
    $look = @{
        info   = @(0xE946, '#0071E3', '#E8F1FC')
        warn   = @(0xE7BA, '#C93400', '#FFF1E6')
        danger = @(0xE74D, '#D70015', '#FDECEE')
        done   = @(0xE73E, '#248A3D', '#E6F4EA')
    }
    $lk = if ($look.ContainsKey($Kind)) { $look[$Kind] } else { $look.info }
    $sw.FindName('SIconGlyph').Text = [string][char][int]$lk[0]
    $sw.FindName('SIconGlyph').Foreground = New-Brush $lk[1]
    $sw.FindName('SIconBg').Fill = New-Brush $lk[2] 'b'
    $sw.FindName('STitle').Text = $Title
    $st = $sw.FindName('SText'); $st.Text = $Text; if (-not $Text) { $st.Visibility = 'Collapsed' }
    if ($Items) {
        $sw.FindName('SListBox').Visibility = 'Visible'
        $sw.FindName('SList').Text = (($Items | ForEach-Object { if ([string]$_ -match '^[✓!✗·…]') { [string]$_ } else { "•  $_" } }) -join "`n")
    }
    $panel = $sw.FindName('SButtons')
    $script:sheetResult = $Cancel
    $script:sheetGuarded = New-Object System.Collections.ArrayList
    foreach ($b in $Buttons) {
        $btn = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.Button
        $btn.Content = $b; $btn.Tag = $b; $btn.MinWidth = 88
        $btn.Padding = New-Object System.Windows.Thickness 16, 7, 16, 7; $btn.Margin = New-Object System.Windows.Thickness 8, 0, 0, 0
        if ($b -eq $Primary) { $btn.Style = $win.FindResource($(if ($Kind -eq 'danger') { 'Danger' } else { 'Primary' })); $btn.IsDefault = $true }
        else { $btn.Style = $win.FindResource('Secondary') }
        if ($b -eq $Cancel) { $btn.IsCancel = $true }
        if ($Confirm -and $b -ne $Cancel) { $btn.IsEnabled = $false; [void]$script:sheetGuarded.Add($btn) }
        $btn.Add_Click({ $script:sheetResult = [string]$this.Tag; [System.Windows.Window]::GetWindow($this).Close() })
        [void]$panel.Children.Add($btn)
    }
    if ($Confirm) {
        $sw.FindName('SAckBox').Visibility = 'Visible'
        $sw.FindName('SAckText').Text = $Confirm
        $ack = $sw.FindName('SAck')
        $ack.Style = $win.FindResource([System.Windows.Controls.CheckBox])
        $ack.Add_Checked({ foreach ($x in $script:sheetGuarded) { $x.IsEnabled = $true } })
        $ack.Add_Unchecked({ foreach ($x in $script:sheetGuarded) { $x.IsEnabled = $false } })
    }
    $sw.Add_MouseLeftButtonDown({ try { $this.DragMove() } catch {} })
    if ($win.IsVisible) { $sw.Owner = $win } else { $sw.WindowStartupLocation = 'CenterScreen' }
    $ctl.Dim.Visibility = 'Visible'
    try { [void]$sw.ShowDialog() } finally { $ctl.Dim.Visibility = 'Collapsed' }
    return $script:sheetResult
}

$sync = [hashtable]::Synchronized(@{})
$sync.L10n = $script:L10n   # 后台任务用同一张翻译表
$sync.Log = [System.Collections.Queue]::Synchronized((New-Object System.Collections.Queue))
$script:worker = $null
$script:op = $null
$sync.P = $null
$script:rows = $null
$script:dupRows = $null
$script:dupByGroup = @{}
$script:dupGroups = $null
$script:dupWaste = [double]0

function Fmt($b) {
    $b = [double]$b
    if ($b -ge 1GB) { "{0:N2} GB" -f ($b / 1GB) } elseif ($b -ge 1MB) { "{0:N1} MB" -f ($b / 1MB) } elseif ($b -ge 1KB) { "{0:N0} KB" -f ($b / 1KB) } else { "{0} B" -f $b }
}
function FmtSpan([TimeSpan]$ts) {
    $sec = [int][math]::Floor($ts.TotalSeconds)
    if ($sec -ge 3600) { (T "{0} 小时 {1} 分") -f [int][math]::Floor($sec / 3600), [int][math]::Floor(($sec % 3600) / 60) }
    elseif ($sec -ge 60) { (T "{0} 分 {1} 秒") -f [int][math]::Floor($sec / 60), ($sec % 60) }
    else { ((T "{0} 秒") -f $sec) }
}
function DriveFree([string]$d) { try { [double](New-Object System.IO.DriveInfo $d).AvailableFreeSpace } catch { [double]0 } }
function Clamp01($x) { [math]::Max(0.0, [math]::Min(1.0, [double]$x)) }

# ---------- 运行中的提示：底部进度条 + 窗口中间的进度卡片 ----------
# role：f 文字和图标  b 底色  d 边框（深色模式按用途换颜色）
function New-Brush([string]$hex, [string]$role = 'f') { New-Object System.Windows.Media.SolidColorBrush ([System.Windows.Media.Color][System.Windows.Media.ColorConverter]::ConvertFromString([Theme]::Map($hex, [char]$role))) }
# 把多行带颜色的文字写进一个 TextBlock：$lines = @( @('文字', '#颜色', $粗体), ... )
function Set-Lines($tb, $lines) {
    $tb.Inlines.Clear()
    $first = $true
    foreach ($l in $lines) {
        if (-not $first) { $tb.Inlines.Add((New-Object System.Windows.Documents.LineBreak)) }
        $run = New-Object System.Windows.Documents.Run ([string]$l[0])
        if ($l.Count -gt 1 -and $l[1]) { $run.Foreground = New-Brush $l[1] }
        if ($l.Count -gt 2 -and $l[2]) { $run.FontWeight = 'SemiBold' }
        $tb.Inlines.Add($run)
        $first = $false
    }
}

$script:movePhases = @(
    @('kill',    (T '关闭占用这些文件的聊天软件（开着的话没法搬）')),
    @('measure', (T '统计要搬多少')),
    @('copy',    (T '复制到目标盘')),
    @('verify',  (T '核对复制是否完整')),
    @('link',    (T '把原位置换成链接（软件照常找得到；被占用时会关掉占用的程序重试）')),
    @('cleanup', (T '删除 C 盘上的原目录，腾出空间'))
)
function Move-Checklist($p) {
    $cur = [string]$p.MovePhase
    $order = @($script:movePhases | ForEach-Object { $_[0] })
    $ci = [array]::IndexOf($order, $cur); if ($cur -eq 'done') { $ci = $order.Count }
    $lines = @()
    for ($i = 0; $i -lt $order.Count; $i++) {
        if ($order[$i] -eq 'kill' -and -not $p.HasKill) { continue }
        $text = $script:movePhases[$i][1]
        if ($p.MoveBack) {
            $text = @{ kill = (T '关闭占用这些文件的软件'); measure = (T '统计要搬回多少'); copy = (T '复制回 ') + $p.MoveDest; verify = (T '核对复制是否完整'); link = (T '拆掉链接，换回真正的文件夹'); cleanup = (T '删除目标盘上的那份') }[$order[$i]]
        }
        elseif ($order[$i] -eq 'copy' -and $p.MoveDest) { $text = (T '复制到 ') + $p.MoveDest; if ($p.MoveReuse) { $text = (T '补复制有变化的文件到 ') + $p.MoveDest + (T '（上次的副本接着用）') } }
        if ($i -lt $ci)      { $lines += ,@(('✓  ' + $text), '#248A3D', $false) }
        elseif ($i -eq $ci)  { $lines += ,@(('▶  ' + $text), '#0071E3', $true) }
        else                 { $lines += ,@(('○  ' + $text), '#AEAEB2', $false) }
    }
    return ,$lines
}
function Plan-Lines {
    $lines = @()
    $marks = @{ wait = '○'; run = '▶'; ok = '✓'; warn = '!'; fail = '✗'; skip = '·' }
    foreach ($x in $script:runPlan) {
        $v = if ($sync.Status) { $sync.Status[$x.Idx] } else { $null }
        $kind = if ($v) { [string]$v[1] } else { 'wait' }
        $text = if ($v) { [string]$v[0] } else { (T '等待') }
        $lines += ,@(((T "{0}  {1}：{2}") -f $marks[$kind], $x.Name, $text), $script:statusColor[$kind], ($kind -eq 'run'))
    }
    return ,$lines
}

function Show-Overlay {
    $ctl.Overlay.Visibility = 'Visible'
    $ctl.OvClose.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; $ctl.OvHide.Visibility = 'Visible'
    $ctl.OvNote.Text = (T '可以最小化窗口，任务栏图标上也有进度。做完前不要关闭本窗口。')
    $ctl.OvBar.IsIndeterminate = $true; $ctl.OvSubBar.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
    $ctl.OvStep.Text = (T '准备中…'); $ctl.OvWhat.Text = ''; $ctl.OvDetail.Text = ''; $ctl.OvChecklist.Inlines.Clear()
    $showPlan = (@('run', 'movemany') -contains $sync.Mode) -and $script:runPlan
    $ctl.OvPlanBox.Visibility = if ($showPlan) { 'Visible' } else { 'Collapsed' }
    if ($showPlan) { Set-Lines $ctl.OvPlan (Plan-Lines) }
}

# 开始一项操作：重置进度面板，开始计时，弹出进度卡片
function Start-Op([string]$title, [switch]$NoCard) {
    $sync.P = [hashtable]::Synchronized(@{ Steps = 0; Step = 0; StepName = ''; SubKind = 'none'; SubDone = [double]0; SubTotal = [double]0;
                                          SubStart = (Get-Date); FreeC0 = [double]0; DestDrive = ''; DestFree0 = [double]0; Detail = ''; MoveItem = $false; CanCancel = $true })
    $sync.Cancel = $false; $sync.WasCancelled = $false; $script:cancelUi = ''
    $script:op = @{ Title = $title; Start = (Get-Date) }
    $ctl.OpPanel.Visibility = 'Visible'
    $ctl.OpTitle.Text = $title; $ctl.OpTime.Text = (T '已用 0 秒'); $ctl.OpDetail.Text = ''; $ctl.OpSubTime.Text = ''
    $ctl.OpBar.IsIndeterminate = $true; $ctl.OpBar.Value = 0
    $ctl.OpSubBar.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
    $ctl.OvTitle.Text = $title; $ctl.OvTime.Text = (T '已用 0 秒')
    if (-not $NoCard) { Show-Overlay }
    UI-Log ((T "开始：{0}") -f $title)
}

# 结束：进度条拉满，显示总用时。执行和删除会在卡片上留下结果，等用户点「关闭」
function End-Op([string]$result, [switch]$KeepCard, [string]$headline = '', $reportLines = $null) {
    if (-not $script:op) { return }
    $cx = [bool]$sync.WasCancelled
    $ctl.OvCancel.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; $ctl.OpCancel.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; $script:cancelUi = ''
    $el = (Get-Date) - $script:op.Start
    $ctl.OpBar.IsIndeterminate = $false; $ctl.OpBar.Value = 100
    $ctl.OpSubBar.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
    $ctl.OpTitle.Text = (T "{0}：{1}") -f $script:op.Title, $result
    $ctl.OpTime.Text = (T "共用时 ") + (FmtSpan $el)
    $script:lastElapsed = $el
    if ($win.TaskbarItemInfo) { $win.TaskbarItemInfo.ProgressState = 'None' }
    $ctl.OpDetail.Text = ''; $ctl.OpSubTime.Text = ''
    UI-Log ((T "{0}：{1}，共用时 {2}") -f $script:op.Title, $result, (FmtSpan $el))
    if ($KeepCard -and $ctl.Overlay.Visibility -eq 'Visible') {
        $ctl.OvTitle.Text = $script:op.Title + $(if ($cx) { (T '：已中途取消') } else { (T '：已完成') })
        $ctl.OvTime.Text = (T "共用时 ") + (FmtSpan $el)
        $ctl.OvBar.IsIndeterminate = $false; $ctl.OvBar.Value = 100
        $ctl.OvSubBar.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
        $ctl.OvStep.Text = if ($headline) { $headline } else { $result }
        $ctl.OvWhat.Text = ''; $ctl.OvDetail.Text = ''; $ctl.OvChecklist.Inlines.Clear()
        if ($reportLines) { $ctl.OvPlanBox.Visibility = 'Visible'; Set-Lines $ctl.OvPlan $reportLines }
        $ctl.OvNote.Text = (T '每一项的结果也显示在列表里；详细过程可以在左下角「运行记录」里查看。')
        $ctl.OvClose.Visibility = 'Visible'; $ctl.OvHide.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
        $script:cardShowsResult = $true
    } else {
        $ctl.Overlay.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
        $script:cardShowsResult = $false
    }
    $script:op = $null
}

# ---------- 中途取消 ----------
# 能中途取消的操作。look = 只是查看，不用确认；其余先问一句。
# 不在这里的（删除单个文件夹、系统压缩、压缩虚拟磁盘、卸载、删除多余副本）要么很快做完，要么停在一半不安全
$script:cancelModes = @{ scan = 'look'; apps = 'look'; dup = 'look'; map = 'look'
    run = 'run'; dupdel = 'dupdel'; dupmove = 'dupdel'; similar = 'look'; merge = 'merge'; leftdel = 'leftdel'; fcompress = 'fcompress'; moveback = 'moveback'; vmove = 'move'; appmove = 'move'
    movescan = 'look'; movemany = 'movemany'; mapdel = 'dupdel'; selftest = 'look'; odinfo = 'look'; leftovers = 'look'; odfree = 'look'; recent = 'look' }
$script:cancelUi = ''
function Update-CancelUi {
    $m = [string]$sync.Mode
    if (-not ($script:worker -and $script:op -and $m -and $script:cancelModes.ContainsKey($m))) {
        $ctl.OvCancel.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; $ctl.OpCancel.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; $script:cancelUi = ''; return
    }
    $state = if ($sync.Cancel) { 'pending' } elseif ($sync.P -and $sync.P.CanCancel -eq $false) { 'hold' } else { 'ready' }
    if ($state -eq $script:cancelUi) { return }
    $script:cancelUi = $state
    foreach ($b in @($ctl.OvCancel, $ctl.OpCancel)) {
        $b.Visibility = 'Visible'
        $b.IsEnabled = ($state -eq 'ready')
        $b.Content = if ($state -eq 'pending') { (T '正在取消…') } else { (T '取消') }
    }
    if ($ctl.OvClose.Visibility -ne 'Visible') {   # 卡片上显示的不是上一次的结果
        $ctl.OvNote.Text = switch ($state) {
            'pending' { (T '正在取消：做完手上这一小步就停下，已经做完的不会撤销。') }
            'hold'    { (T '这一步不能中断（正在换成链接、删除备份或运行系统命令），做完就可以取消。') }
            default   { (T '可以最小化窗口，任务栏图标上也有进度。做完前不要关闭本窗口。') }
        }
    }
}
function Request-Cancel {
    $w = $script:worker
    if (-not $w -or $sync.Cancel) { return }
    $m = [string]$sync.Mode
    if (-not $script:cancelModes.ContainsKey($m)) { return }
    if ($sync.P -and $sync.P.CanCancel -eq $false) { return }
    $kind = $script:cancelModes[$m]
    if ($kind -ne 'look') {
        $text = switch ($kind) {
            'run'       { (T "已经做完的项目不会撤销，还没开始的都不做了。`n`n正在做的这一项会停在安全的地方：清理会停下，已经删掉的不会回来；搬家如果还在复制，C 盘上的原文件夹不动，已复制的部分留在目标盘，下次再搬会接着复制；如果正在换成链接或运行系统命令，会等这一步做完再停。") }
            'dupdel'    { (T '已经删掉的文件不会回来，剩下的不删了。') }
            'movemany'  { (T "已经搬好的不会撤销，还没开始的都不搬了。`n`n正在搬的这一项会停在安全的地方：如果还在复制，C 盘上的原文件夹不动，已复制的部分留在目标盘，下次再搬会接着复制；如果正在换成链接，会等这一步做完再停。") }
            'merge'     { (T '已经合并的保持合并，照常可用；剩下的不合并了。') }
            'leftdel'   { (T '已经移到回收站的还在回收站里，剩下的不删了。') }
            'fcompress' { (T '已经压缩的文件保持压缩，照常可用；剩下的不压缩了。') }
            'moveback'  { (T '数据仍在目标盘上，C 盘上的链接不动，软件照常使用；复制回 C 盘的那一半会删掉。如果已经在换回文件夹，会等这一步做完再停。') }
            default     { (T "C 盘上的原文件夹不动，软件照常使用。已复制到目标盘的部分先留着，下次再搬会接着复制；不需要的话，可以在「搬家管理」里删掉这份副本。如果已经在换成链接，会等这一步做完再停。") }
        }
        $ans = Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title ((T "取消「{0}」？") -f $script:op.Title) -Text $text -Buttons @((T '继续做'), (T '停下来')) -Primary (T '停下来') -Cancel (T '继续做')
        if ($ans -ne (T '停下来')) { return }
        if (-not [object]::ReferenceEquals($w, $script:worker)) { return }   # 对话框开着的时候已经做完了
    }
    Set-CancelFlags
    UI-Log (T '正在取消：做完手上这一小步就停下。')
    Update-CancelUi
}
function Set-CancelFlags {
    $m = [string]$sync.Mode
    $sync.Cancel = $true
    if ($script:cancelModes.ContainsKey($m)) { [DirStat]::Cancel = $true; [DiskMap]::Cancel = $true }   # 读文件表、统计大小都停下
    if ($m -eq 'dup' -or $m -eq 'dupdel' -or $m -eq 'merge') { [DupFinder]::Cancel = $true }
    if ($m -eq 'map') { [DiskMap]::Cancel = $true }
    if ($m -eq 'scan') { $script:oneClickPending = $false }
}

# 每 0.3 秒刷新一次：底部进度条和中间的卡片显示同样的内容
function Update-Op {
    if (-not $script:op) { return }
    $p = $sync.P
    $now = Get-Date
    $el = $now - $script:op.Start
    $frac = $null          # 总进度 0~1；$null 表示不确定
    $etaEl = $el           # 用来估算剩余时间的已用时长
    $etaOk = $true         # 各步工作量差不多时，才用总进度估算剩余时间
    $stepLine = ''         # 现在在做第几步
    $what = ''             # 这一步是干什么的
    $detail = ''; $subFrac = $null; $subShow = $false; $subTime = ''

    if ($sync.Mode -eq 'dup') {
        $ph = [DupFinder]::Phase
        if ($ph -eq 'list') {
            $stepLine = (T '第 1 步：列出所有文件')
            $what = (T '先把每个位置里的文件名和大小都看一遍，名字和大小都对得上的才可能是重复文件。')
            $detail = (T "已看过 {0:N0} 个文件夹、{1:N0} 个文件    {2}") -f [DupFinder]::DirsSeen, [DupFinder]::FilesSeen, (Shorten ([DupFinder]::Current))
        } elseif ($ph -eq 'quick' -or $ph -eq 'deep') {
            if ($script:op.PhaseName -ne $ph) { $script:op.PhaseName = $ph; $script:op.PhaseStart = $now }
            $etaEl = $now - $script:op.PhaseStart
            $tot = [double][DupFinder]::BytesTotal
            if ($ph -eq 'quick') {
                $stepLine = (T "第 2 步：快速筛选 {0:N0} 个同名同大小的文件") -f [DupFinder]::FilesTotal
                $what = (T '每个文件只读开头和结尾各 64 KB，内容明显不同的在这一步就排除掉。')
            } else {
                $how = if ($ctl.SpeedExact.IsChecked) { (T '每个文件读完全部内容') } else { (T '小文件读全文，大文件抽 16 处') }
                $stepLine = (T "第 3 步：比对剩下的 {0:N0} 个文件") -f [DupFinder]::FilesTotal
                $what = ((T "确认内容是否真的相同（{0}）。") -f $how)
            }
            if ($tot -gt 0) { $frac = [math]::Min(0.99, [DupFinder]::BytesDone / $tot) } else { $frac = 0.99 }
            $detail = (T "{0:N0} / {1:N0} 个，已读 {2} / {3}") -f [DupFinder]::FilesDone, [DupFinder]::FilesTotal, (Fmt ([DupFinder]::BytesDone)), (Fmt $tot)
            if ($sync.DriveNote) { $detail += "    " + $sync.DriveNote }
        } elseif ($ph -eq 'finish') {
            $stepLine = (T '整理结果')
        }
    }
    elseif ($p -and $p.Steps -gt 0) {
        $step = [math]::Max(1, [int]$p.Step)
        $stepLine = (T "第 {0} / {1} 项：{2}") -f $step, $p.Steps, $p.StepName
        if (@('run', 'movemany') -contains $sync.Mode) {
            $what = [string]$p.StepNote
            if ($p.MoveItem -and [int]$p.PathCount -gt 1 -and [int]$p.PathNo -gt 0) { $what = (T "第 {0} / {1} 个文件夹：{2}") -f $p.PathNo, $p.PathCount, $p.MovePath }
            elseif ($p.MoveItem -and $p.MovePath) { $what = (T "从 {0} 搬到 {1}") -f $p.MovePath, $p.MoveDest }
        } elseif ($sync.Mode -eq 'scan') {
            $what = (T '统计这一项占了多少空间。扫描只是查看，不会删除任何东西。')
        } elseif ($sync.Mode -eq 'movescan') {
            $what = (T '统计每一项占了多少空间，看看哪些能搬。只是查看，不会改动任何东西。')
        } elseif ($sync.Mode -eq 'dupdel') {
            $what = (T '删除前会再确认保留的那份还在、内容相同；抽样判定的文件会逐字节核对。')
        }
        $kind = [string]$p.SubKind
        $subEl = $now - [datetime]$p.SubStart
        if ($kind -eq 'copy') {
            # 已复制量取两种算法的较大者：robocopy 报告的字节数，或目标盘可用空间的减少量
            $df = DriveFree $p.DestDrive
            $base = [double]$p.SubBase
            $drop = if ($df -gt 0 -and [double]$p.DestFree0 -gt 0) { [double]$p.DestFree0 - $df } else { 0 }
            $done = [math]::Max([double]$p.SubDone, [double]($base + $drop))
            $tot  = [double]$p.SubTotal
            $subShow = $true
            if ($tot -gt 0) { $subFrac = [math]::Min(0.99, (Clamp01 ($done / $tot))) }
            $speed = if ($subEl.TotalSeconds -gt 1) { [math]::Max([double]0, [double]($done - $base)) / $subEl.TotalSeconds } else { 0 }
            $detail = (T "已复制 {0} / {1}，{2}/秒") -f (Fmt $done), (Fmt $tot), (Fmt $speed)
            if ($base -gt 0) { $detail = (T "上次已复制 {0}，正在补有变化的文件：{1} / {2}") -f (Fmt $base), (Fmt $done), (Fmt $tot) }
            if ($speed -gt 0 -and $subEl.TotalSeconds -gt 5 -and $tot -gt $done) { $subTime = (T "这一项还要约 ") + (FmtSpan ([TimeSpan]::FromSeconds(($tot - $done) / $speed))) }
            else { $subTime = (T "这一项已用 ") + (FmtSpan $subEl) }
            $etaOk = $false
        } elseif ($kind -eq 'delete') {
            $fc = DriveFree 'C:'
            $done = if ($fc -gt 0) { $fc - [double]$p.FreeC0 } else { 0 }
            $tot  = [double]$p.SubTotal
            $subShow = $true
            if ($tot -gt 0) { $subFrac = [math]::Min(0.99, (Clamp01 ($done / $tot))) }
            $detail = if ($tot -gt 0) { (T "已释放 {0} / 约 {1}") -f (Fmt ([math]::Max([double]0, [double]$done))), (Fmt $tot) } else { [string]$p.Detail }
            $subTime = (T "这一项已用 ") + (FmtSpan $subEl)
            $etaOk = $false
        } elseif ($kind -eq 'verify') {
            $vt = [double][DupFinder]::VerifyTotal
            $subShow = $true
            if ($vt -gt 0) { $subFrac = [math]::Min(0.99, [DupFinder]::VerifyDone / $vt) }
            $detail = (T "逐字节核对 {0}：{1} / {2}") -f (Shorten ([IO.Path]::GetFileName([string]$p.Detail))), (Fmt ([DupFinder]::VerifyDone)), (Fmt $vt)
            $subTime = (T "删除前核对")
        } elseif ($kind -eq 'slow') {
            $subShow = $true
            $detail = [string]$p.Detail
            $subTime = (T "这一项已用 ") + (FmtSpan $subEl)
            $etaOk = $false
        } elseif ($kind -eq 'mft') {
            $subShow = $true
            $rt = [double][Mft]::RecordsTotal
            if ($rt -gt 0) {
                $subFrac = [math]::Min(0.99, [double][Mft]::RecordsDone / $rt)
                $detail = (T "读取 C 盘的文件表：{0:N0} / {1:N0} 条记录") -f [Mft]::RecordsDone, $rt
            } elseif ([string][DiskMap]::Phase -eq 'walk') { $detail = (T '逐个文件夹统计') }
            else { $detail = (T '读取 C 盘的文件表') }
            $subTime = (T "这一项已用 ") + (FmtSpan $subEl)
        } elseif ($kind -eq 'measure') {
            $subShow = $true
            $detail = (T "{0}：已数 {1:N0} 个文件，{2}") -f [string]$p.Detail, [DirStat]::Files, (Fmt ([DirStat]::Bytes))
            $subTime = (T "这一项已用 ") + (FmtSpan $subEl)
        } elseif ($kind -eq 'action') {
            $subShow = $true
            $detail = [string]$p.Detail
            $subTime = (T "这一项已用 ") + (FmtSpan $subEl)
        }
        $sf = if ($subFrac -ne $null) { $subFrac } else { 0 }
        $frac = [math]::Min(0.99, (($step - 1) + $sf) / [double]$p.Steps)
    }
    elseif ($sync.Mode -eq 'hogs') { $stepLine = (T '统计 C 盘各目录的大小'); $what = (T '找出 C 盘上最占地方的文件夹和大文件，目录多时要几分钟。') }
    elseif ($sync.Mode -eq 'map') {
        $stepLine = (T "扫描 {0}") -f $sync.MapRoot
        if ([string][DiskMap]::Phase -eq 'mft') {
            $what = (T '直接读取 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多。只是查看，不会改动任何东西。')
            $rt = [double][Mft]::RecordsTotal
            if ($rt -gt 0) {
                $detail = (T "已读 {0:N0} / {1:N0} 条文件记录") -f [Mft]::RecordsDone, $rt
                $frac = [math]::Min(0.99, [double][Mft]::RecordsDone / $rt)
            } else { $detail = (T '读取文件表') }
        } else {
            $what = (T '把每个文件夹里的文件大小数一遍。只是查看，不会改动任何东西。')
            $detail = (T "已看过 {0:N0} 个文件夹、{1:N0} 个文件，{2}    {3}") -f [DiskMap]::DirsSeen, [DiskMap]::FilesSeen, (Fmt ([DiskMap]::BytesSeen)), (Shorten ([DiskMap]::Current))
            if ([double]$sync.MapUsed -gt 0) { $frac = [math]::Min(0.99, [double][DiskMap]::BytesSeen / [double]$sync.MapUsed) }
        }
    }

    $timeText = (T "已用 ") + (FmtSpan $el)
    if ($frac -ne $null -and $etaOk -and $frac -gt 0.03 -and $etaEl.TotalSeconds -gt 3) {
        $timeText += (T "，预计还要 ") + (FmtSpan ([TimeSpan]::FromSeconds($etaEl.TotalSeconds * (1 - $frac) / $frac)))
    }

    # ---- 底部进度条 ----
    $ctl.OpTitle.Text = if ($stepLine) { (T "{0}，{1}") -f $script:op.Title, $stepLine } else { $script:op.Title }
    $ctl.OpTime.Text = $timeText
    if ($frac -ne $null) { $ctl.OpBar.IsIndeterminate = $false; $ctl.OpBar.Value = 100 * $frac } else { $ctl.OpBar.IsIndeterminate = $true }
    $ctl.OpDetail.Text = $detail
    $ctl.OpSubTime.Text = $subTime
    if ($subShow) {
        $ctl.OpSubBar.Visibility = 'Visible'
        if ($subFrac -ne $null) { $ctl.OpSubBar.IsIndeterminate = $false; $ctl.OpSubBar.Value = 100 * $subFrac } else { $ctl.OpSubBar.IsIndeterminate = $true }
    } else { $ctl.OpSubBar.Visibility = 'Collapsed' }

    # ---- 任务栏图标上的进度，窗口最小化也看得到 ----
    if ($win.TaskbarItemInfo) {
        if ($frac -ne $null) { $win.TaskbarItemInfo.ProgressState = 'Normal'; $win.TaskbarItemInfo.ProgressValue = [double]$frac }
        else { $win.TaskbarItemInfo.ProgressState = 'Indeterminate' }
    }

    # ---- 中间的进度卡片 ----
    if ($ctl.Overlay.Visibility -eq 'Visible') {
        $ctl.OvTime.Text = $timeText
        if ($frac -ne $null) { $ctl.OvBar.IsIndeterminate = $false; $ctl.OvBar.Value = 100 * $frac } else { $ctl.OvBar.IsIndeterminate = $true }
        $ctl.OvStep.Text = if ($stepLine) { $stepLine } else { (T '准备中…') }
        $ctl.OvWhat.Text = $what
        $ctl.OvDetail.Text = if ($subTime) { "$detail        $subTime" } else { $detail }
        if ($subShow) {
            $ctl.OvSubBar.Visibility = 'Visible'
            if ($subFrac -ne $null) { $ctl.OvSubBar.IsIndeterminate = $false; $ctl.OvSubBar.Value = 100 * $subFrac } else { $ctl.OvSubBar.IsIndeterminate = $true }
        } else { $ctl.OvSubBar.Visibility = 'Collapsed' }
        if ((@('run', 'movemany') -contains $sync.Mode) -and $p -and $p.MoveItem) { Set-Lines $ctl.OvChecklist (Move-Checklist $p) } else { $ctl.OvChecklist.Inlines.Clear() }
        if ((@('run', 'movemany') -contains $sync.Mode) -and $script:runPlan) { Set-Lines $ctl.OvPlan (Plan-Lines) }
    }
    Update-CancelUi
}

function Shorten($p) { if (-not $p) { return '' }; if ($p.Length -le 80) { $p } else { '…' + $p.Substring($p.Length - 79) } }

$script:logFile = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) 'CleanC-run.log'
function Write-LogFile([string]$m) { try { [IO.File]::AppendAllText($script:logFile, ("{0:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss}  {1}`r`n" -f (Get-Date), $m), [Text.Encoding]::UTF8) } catch {} }
function UI-Log($m) { $ctl.Log.AppendText("$m`r`n"); $ctl.Log.ScrollToEnd(); Write-LogFile ([string]$m) }
# 存储空间卡片：一条横条分成 已用 / 可释放（按扫描后的默认选择） / 可用 三段
$script:reclaim = [double]0
function UI-Status {
    $total = [double]0; $free = [double]0
    try { $di = New-Object System.IO.DriveInfo 'C:\'; $total = [double]$di.TotalSize; $free = [double]$di.AvailableFreeSpace }
    catch { $d = Get-PSDrive C; $free = [double]$d.Free; $total = [double]($d.Used + $d.Free) }
    $used = [math]::Max([double]0, [double]($total - $free))
    $rec = [math]::Min([double]$script:reclaim, [double]$used)
    $ctl.CapFree.Text = Fmt $free
    $ctl.CapTotal.Text = (T "共 {0}，已用 {1}") -f (Fmt $total), (Fmt $used)
    $star = [System.Windows.GridUnitType]::Star
    $cols = $ctl.CapBar.ColumnDefinitions
    $cols[0].Width = New-Object System.Windows.GridLength ([math]::Max([double]0.0001, [double]($used - $rec))), $star
    $cols[1].Width = New-Object System.Windows.GridLength ([math]::Max([double]0, [double]$rec)), $star
    $cols[2].Width = New-Object System.Windows.GridLength ([math]::Max([double]0.0001, [double]$free)), $star
    $ctl.CapReclaim.Text = if ($rec -gt 0) { (T "可释放约 ") + (Fmt $rec) } else { (T '可释放（扫描后显示）') }
}
function UI-Busy($b) {
    $ctl.BtnScan.IsEnabled = -not $b; $ctl.BtnHogs.IsEnabled = -not $b; $ctl.BtnOneClick.IsEnabled = -not $b
    $ctl.BtnRun.IsEnabled = (-not $b) -and ($script:rows -ne $null)
    $ctl.BtnDupScan.IsEnabled = -not $b
    $ctl.BtnAddRoot.IsEnabled = -not $b; $ctl.Roots.IsEnabled = -not $b
    $has = (-not $b) -and ($script:dupRows -ne $null) -and ($script:dupRows.Count -gt 0)
    foreach ($n in 'BtnKeepNew','BtnKeepOld','BtnPickC','BtnPickNone','BtnKeepIn','BtnKeepShort') { $ctl[$n].IsEnabled = $has }
    $ctl.BtnDupStop.IsEnabled = $b -and ($sync.Mode -eq 'dup' -or $sync.Mode -eq 'similar')
    foreach ($n in 'BtnMapScan','BtnAppsRefresh','BtnMovesRefresh','BtnCosOn','BtnCosOff','BtnPfMove','BtnPfAuto','BtnHibReduced','BtnHibOff','BtnHibFull','BtnFolderCompress','BtnSaveRefresh') { $ctl[$n].IsEnabled = -not $b }
    $ctl.BtnMapStop.IsEnabled = $b -and ($sync.Mode -eq 'map')
    if (-not $b -and $script:pageLoaded.save) { $on = Get-CompactOSOn; $ctl.BtnCosOn.IsEnabled = -not $on; $ctl.BtnCosOff.IsEnabled = $on }
    Update-DupSummary
    Update-MapSel
    Update-CandSel
}

function Start-Worker([string]$code, $arg) {
    $sync.Cancel = $false; $sync.WasCancelled = $false; Set-CanCancel $true
    [DirStat]::Cancel = $false; [DupFinder]::Cancel = $false; [DiskMap]::Cancel = $false
    $rs = [runspacefactory]::CreateRunspace(); $rs.ApartmentState = 'STA'; $rs.ThreadOptions = 'ReuseThread'; $rs.Open()
    $rs.SessionStateProxy.SetVariable('sync', $sync)
    $ps = [powershell]::Create(); $ps.Runspace = $rs
    $ps.AddScript("param(`$arg)`n" + $engine + "`nInit-DriveThreads`n" + $code).AddArgument($arg) | Out-Null
    $script:worker = @{ PS = $ps; Handle = $ps.BeginInvoke(); RS = $rs }
}

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 第一页：清理 C 盘
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 列表上方的总览：「扫描到 23 项，分 4 类：安全清理 9 项、……」
function Update-CleanOverview {
    $col = $script:rows
    if (-not $col -or $col.Count -eq 0) { $ctl.CleanOverview.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; Update-CleanMore; return }
    $order = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string]; $cnt = @{}
    foreach ($r in $col) { if (-not $cnt.ContainsKey($r.GroupTitle)) { $order.Add($r.GroupTitle); $cnt[$r.GroupTitle] = 0 }; $cnt[$r.GroupTitle]++ }
    $parts = @($order | ForEach-Object { (T "{0} {1} 项") -f $_, $cnt[$_] })
    $ctl.CleanOverviewText.Text = (T "扫描到 {0} 项，分成 {1} 类：{2}。每一项都可以单独选「删除」「搬走」或「跳过」，往下滚动查看全部。") -f $col.Count, $order.Count, ($parts -join (T '、'))
    $ctl.CleanOverview.Visibility = 'Visible'
    $script:cleanItems = $null
    $ctl.CleanScroll.ScrollToTop()
    $ctl.CleanScroll.UpdateLayout()
    Update-CleanMore
}
# 下面还有没看到的内容时，底部浮一个「下面还有 N 项」
function Update-CleanMore {
    $sv = $ctl.CleanScroll
    $left = [double]$sv.ScrollableHeight - [double]$sv.VerticalOffset
    if (-not $script:rows -or $script:rows.Count -eq 0 -or $left -lt 30) { $ctl.CleanMore.Visibility = 'Collapsed'; return }
    # 数一数还有几行在可视区下面（列表的行在第一次需要时从界面树里找出来，之后直接用）
    if (-not $script:cleanItems -or $script:cleanItems.Count -ne $script:rows.Count) {
        $found = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[object]
        $stack = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.Stack[object]; $stack.Push($ctl.List)
        while ($stack.Count -gt 0) {
            $v = $stack.Pop()
            if ($v -is [System.Windows.Controls.ListViewItem]) { $found.Add($v); continue }
            $n = [System.Windows.Media.VisualTreeHelper]::GetChildrenCount($v)
            for ($i = 0; $i -lt $n; $i++) { $stack.Push([System.Windows.Media.VisualTreeHelper]::GetChild($v, $i)) }
        }
        $script:cleanItems = $found
    }
    $below = 0
    $bottom = [double]$sv.ViewportHeight
    foreach ($c in $script:cleanItems) {
        try { if ($c.TransformToAncestor($sv).Transform((New-Object System.Windows.Point 0, 0)).Y + 20 -gt $bottom) { $below++ } } catch {}
    }
    $ctl.CleanMoreText.Text = if ($below -gt 0) { (T "下面还有 {0} 项") -f $below } else { (T '下面还有内容') }
    $ctl.CleanMore.Visibility = 'Visible'
}
function Build-Rows($sizes) {
    $col = New-Object 'System.Collections.ObjectModel.ObservableCollection[RowItem]'
    $total = [double]0
    $seen = @{}
    $mode = Get-Mode
    foreach ($it in $catalog) {
        $b = $sizes[$it.Idx]
        if (-not $b) { continue }
        if ($it.Lvl -and [int]$it.Lvl -gt $mode) { continue }   # 这个模式下不列（换到更高的模式再扫描就有）
        $r = New-Object RowItem
        $r.Idx = $it.Idx; $r.Group = $it.G; $r.Name = $it.N; $r.Note = $it.Note; $r.Actions = $it.Actions; $r.Action = $it.Def
        # 组名「安全清理（缓存、临时文件……）」拆成标题和说明两行显示
        $gt = T ([string]$it.G)
        $gp = $gt.Split([char]0xFF08, 2); if ($gp.Count -lt 2) { $gp = $gt.Split([char]'(', 2) }
        $r.GroupTitle = $gp[0].Trim()
        $r.GroupNote = if ($gp.Count -gt 1) { $gp[1].TrimEnd([char]0xFF09).TrimEnd(')') } else { '' }
        $r.First = -not $seen.ContainsKey($it.G); $seen[$it.G] = $true
        $r.SizeText = if ($b -lt 0) { (T '运行后知道') } else { Fmt $b }
        if ($b -gt 0 -and $it.Def -ne (T '跳过')) { $total += $b }
        $col.Add($r)
    }
    $script:rows = $col
    $ctl.List.ItemsSource = $col
    $view = [System.Windows.Data.CollectionViewSource]::GetDefaultView($col)
    $view.GroupDescriptions.Clear()
    $view.GroupDescriptions.Add((New-Object System.Windows.Data.PropertyGroupDescription 'Group'))
    $ctl.EmptyClean.Visibility = if ($col.Count -gt 0) { 'Collapsed' } else { 'Visible' }
    if ($col.Count -eq 0) { $ctl.EmptyCleanText.Text = (T 'C 盘上没找到可以清理的东西') }
    Update-CleanOverview
    $script:reclaim = $total
    UI-Status
    $ctl.Summary.Text = ((T "共 {0} 项。按当前选择，可释放约 {1}。") -f $col.Count, (GB $total))
}

# 用户在列表里改了某一行的操作，就重算「可释放约多少」
$script:planSig = ''
function Update-CleanSummary {
    if (-not $script:rows -or $script:worker -or -not $sync.Sizes) { return }
    $tot = [double]0; $n = 0; $sig = ''
    foreach ($r in $script:rows) {
        $sig += [string]$r.Action
        if ($r.Action -ne (T '跳过')) { $n++; $b = [double]$sync.Sizes[$r.Idx]; if ($b -gt 0) { $tot += $b } }
    }
    if ($sig -eq $script:planSig) { return }
    $script:planSig = $sig
    $script:reclaim = $tot
    UI-Status
    $ctl.Summary.Text = if ($n -gt 0) { (T "已选 {0} 项，可释放约 {1}。") -f $n, (GB $tot) } else { (T '没有选中任何项目。') }
    $ctl.BtnRun.IsEnabled = ($n -gt 0)
}

function Do-Scan([switch]$Quiet) {
    $ctl.Summary.Text = (T '正在扫描，大目录可能要一两分钟…')
    if (-not $script:rows) { $ctl.EmptyCleanText.Text = (T '正在扫描…') }
    $script:prevSizes = $sync.Sizes   # 扫描中途取消时，列表还用上一次的结果
    $sync.Mode = 'scan'; $sync.Sizes = $null
    if (-not $Quiet) { Start-Op (T '扫描可清理项') }
    UI-Busy $true
    Start-Worker @'
$sizes = @{}
$cat = Get-Catalog; $i = 1; $steps = $cat.Count + 1
SetP @{ Steps = $steps; Step = 1; StepName = (T '读取 C 盘的文件表') }
$tree = Get-SysTree
foreach ($it in $cat) { if (Stopping) { break }; $i++; SetP @{ Steps = $steps; Step = $i; StepName = $it.N; SubKind = 'measure'; SubStart = (Get-Date); Detail = (T '统计大小') }; $sizes[$it.Idx] = Measure-Item $it $tree }
if (-not (Stopping)) { $sync.Sizes = $sizes }
'@ $null
}

$ctl.BtnScan.Add_Click({ UI-Log (T "开始扫描..."); Do-Scan })
$ctl.BtnCleanCustom.Add_Click({ Show-Page 'settings'; $ctl.SetScroll.UpdateLayout(); $ctl.SetCleanCard.BringIntoView() })

$ctl.BtnHogs.Add_Click({
    Show-Page 'map'
    if ($ctl.MapDrive.Items.Count -gt 0) { foreach ($it in $ctl.MapDrive.Items) { if ([string]$it.Tag -ieq "$env:SystemDrive\") { $ctl.MapDrive.SelectedItem = $it } } }
    if (-not $script:worker -and -not $script:mapRoot) { Start-MapScan "$env:SystemDrive\" }
})

# ---------- 搬家目标：列出 C 盘以外的本机硬盘，按空闲从大到小，默认选第一个 ----------
$script:customDest = $null
function DriveTypeOf([string]$d) { try { [string](New-Object System.IO.DriveInfo $d).DriveType } catch { 'Unknown' } }
function Fill-DestChoices([string]$keep) {
    if (-not $keep) { $keep = Get-Dest }
    $ctl.DestPick.Items.Clear()
    $drives = @([IO.DriveInfo]::GetDrives() | Where-Object {
        try { $_.DriveType -eq 'Fixed' -and $_.IsReady -and ($_.Name.TrimEnd('\') -ine $env:SystemDrive) } catch { $false } } |
        Sort-Object AvailableFreeSpace -Descending)
    $first = $true
    foreach ($d in $drives) {
        $path = Join-Path $d.RootDirectory.FullName 'CDriveMoved'
        $label = (T "{0}    空闲 {1}{2}") -f $path, (Fmt $d.AvailableFreeSpace), $(if ($first) { (T '，空间最大') } else { '' })
        $item = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.ComboBoxItem
        $item.Content = $label; $item.Tag = $path
        [void]$ctl.DestPick.Items.Add($item)
        $first = $false
    }
    if ($script:customDest) {
        $free = DriveFree ($script:customDest.Substring(0, 2))
        $item = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.ComboBoxItem
        $item.Content = (T "{0}    空闲 {1}，自选") -f $script:customDest, (Fmt $free); $item.Tag = $script:customDest
        [void]$ctl.DestPick.Items.Add($item)
    }
    if ($ctl.DestPick.Items.Count -eq 0) {
        $item = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.ComboBoxItem
        $item.Content = (T '这台电脑只有 C 盘，没有可以搬去的磁盘'); $item.Tag = ''
        [void]$ctl.DestPick.Items.Add($item)
    }
    $ctl.DestPick.SelectedIndex = 0
    if ($drives.Count -gt 0) {
        $ctl.DestHint.Text = (T "已自动选了空闲最多的 {0} 盘（剩 {1}）。也可以从下拉框换一块盘，或点「选择文件夹」。只列本机硬盘：网络盘、网盘、U 盘不能做链接目标。") -f $drives[0].Name.Substring(0, 1), (Fmt $drives[0].AvailableFreeSpace)
    } else {
        $ctl.DestHint.Text = (T '这台电脑只有 C 盘，不能搬家；其他清理照常可以做。')
    }
    if ($keep) { for ($i = 0; $i -lt $ctl.DestPick.Items.Count; $i++) { if ([string]$ctl.DestPick.Items[$i].Tag -ieq $keep) { $ctl.DestPick.SelectedIndex = $i } } }
    Sync-MovesDest
}
function Get-Dest { $i = $ctl.DestPick.SelectedItem; if ($i) { [string]$i.Tag } else { '' } }
# 「搬家管理」页也有一个搬家目标下拉框，和这里的是同一个选择
$script:destSyncing = $false
function Sync-MovesDest {
    $script:destSyncing = $true
    try {
        $ctl.MovesDest.Items.Clear()
        foreach ($i in $ctl.DestPick.Items) { $n = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.ComboBoxItem; $n.Content = $i.Content; $n.Tag = $i.Tag; [void]$ctl.MovesDest.Items.Add($n) }
        $ctl.MovesDest.SelectedIndex = $ctl.DestPick.SelectedIndex
    } finally { $script:destSyncing = $false }
}
$ctl.MovesDest.Add_SelectionChanged({
    if ($script:destSyncing -or $ctl.MovesDest.SelectedIndex -lt 0) { return }
    $script:destSyncing = $true
    try { $ctl.DestPick.SelectedIndex = $ctl.MovesDest.SelectedIndex } finally { $script:destSyncing = $false }
    Update-CandSel
})
$ctl.DestPick.Add_SelectionChanged({
    if ($script:destSyncing) { return }
    $script:destSyncing = $true
    try { $ctl.MovesDest.SelectedIndex = $ctl.DestPick.SelectedIndex } finally { $script:destSyncing = $false }
})
$ctl.BtnDestBrowse.Add_Click({
    $dlg = New-Object System.Windows.Forms.FolderBrowserDialog
    $dlg.Description = (T '选择搬家目标文件夹（要在 C 盘以外的本机硬盘上）')
    if ($dlg.ShowDialog() -ne [System.Windows.Forms.DialogResult]::OK) { return }
    $path = $dlg.SelectedPath.TrimEnd('\')
    if ($path.Length -lt 2 -or $path.Substring(0, 2) -ieq $env:SystemDrive) { Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title (T '请选 C 盘以外的位置') -Text (T '搬到 C 盘自己身上腾不出空间。') | Out-Null; return }
    if ((DriveTypeOf ($path.Substring(0, 2))) -ne 'Fixed') { Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title (T '只能选本机硬盘') -Text (T '网络盘、网盘和 U 盘不能做链接目标，拔掉或断网后软件会找不到数据。') | Out-Null; return }
    if ($path.Length -le 2) { $path = $path.Substring(0, 2) + '\CDriveMoved' }   # 选了整个盘（E:\），就在盘下建 CDriveMoved
    $script:customDest = $path
    Fill-DestChoices $path
})

# 搬家前要关掉的程序：Names 交给后台（只关这些），Text 给人看（聊天软件写软件名，其余写进程名）
function Get-ClosePlan($items, [string[]]$appKeys) {
    $names = @(Get-KillPreview $items)
    $friendly = @(); $covered = @{}
    if ($appKeys) {
        $defs = Get-ChatApps
        foreach ($a in @(Get-BusyApps $appKeys)) {
            $friendly += (T $a)
            foreach ($n in $names) { foreach ($pat in (@($defs[$a].P) + @($defs[$a].K))) { if ($pat -and $n -like $pat) { $covered[$n] = $true } } }
        }
    }
    foreach ($n in $names) { if (-not $covered.ContainsKey($n)) { $friendly += $n } }
    return @{ Names = $names; Text = (@($friendly | Select-Object -Unique) -join (T '、')) }
}
# 这些聊天软件里哪些正开着：先按进程名找，对不上再看程序所在的文件夹（例如 ...\DingDing\...）
function Get-BusyApps([string[]]$apps) {
    $def = Get-ChatApps
    $procs = @(Get-Process -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.Id -ne $PID })
    $names = @()
    foreach ($a in $apps) {
        $d = $def[$a]; if (-not $d) { continue }
        $hit = $false
        foreach ($pat in $d.P) { if (@($procs | Where-Object { $_.Name -like $pat }).Count -gt 0) { $hit = $true; break } }
        if (-not $hit -and $d.Dirs) { foreach ($pp in $procs) { if (PathHasAny ([string]$pp.Path) $d.Dirs) { $hit = $true; break } } }
        if ($hit) { $names += $a }
    }
    return ,$names
}

function Invoke-RunSelected([string]$title = (T '执行所选操作')) {
    $plan = @()
    foreach ($r in $script:rows) {
        if ($r.Action -ne (T '跳过')) {
            $b = if ($sync.Sizes) { [double]$sync.Sizes[$r.Idx] } else { 0 }
            $plan += @{ Idx = $r.Idx; Action = $r.Action; Name = $r.Name; Bytes = [math]::Max([double]0, [double]$b) }
        }
    }
    if (-not $plan) { Show-Sheet -Title (T '没有选中任何操作') -Text (T '在列表里把要处理的项目选成「删除」或「搬到其他盘」，再点「执行所选操作」。') | Out-Null; return }
    $dest = Get-Dest
    $cat0 = @{}; foreach ($c in $catalog) { $cat0[$c.Idx] = $c }
    $moves = @($plan | Where-Object { $_.Action -eq (T '搬到其他盘') })
    $moveBytes = [double]0; foreach ($x in $moves) { $moveBytes += $x.Bytes }
    if ($moves) {
        if (-not $dest -or -not (Test-Path ($dest.Substring(0, 3)))) { Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title (T '没有可用的搬家目标') -Text (T '请在「搬家目标」里选一个 C 盘以外的本机硬盘。') | Out-Null; return }
        $destFree = DriveFree ($dest.Substring(0, 2))
        # 上次没搬完留下的副本会直接接着用，只补差异；这种情况下由搬家时逐个文件夹核对空间
        $reuseAny = $false
        foreach ($x in $moves) {
            foreach ($pth in @($cat0[$x.Idx].Paths)) {
                if ($reuseAny -or -not $pth -or -not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $pth) -or (IsLink $pth)) { continue }
                if ((Find-MoveDest $pth $dest).Reuse) { $reuseAny = $true }
            }
        }
        if (-not $reuseAny -and $destFree -lt $moveBytes * 1.05) {
            Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title ((T "{0} 盘放不下") -f $dest.Substring(0, 1)) -Text ((T "{0} 只剩 {1}，要搬的东西有 {2}。请换一个目标，或少选几项搬家。") -f $dest.Substring(0, 2), (GB $destFree), (GB $moveBytes)) | Out-Null; return
        }
    }
    $total = [double]0; foreach ($x in $plan) { $total += $x.Bytes }
    $items = @($plan | ForEach-Object { (T "{0}　{1}") -f $_.Action, $_.Name })
    $text = (T "涉及约 {0}。大文件夹搬家可能要几十分钟，进度会显示在窗口中间，做完会告诉你结果。") -f (GB $total)
    if ($moves) { $text += ((T "`n`n要搬的东西会放到 {0}。") -f $dest) }
    # 有删除项时，必须勾选「确认不会带来损失」才能开始
    $dels = @($plan | Where-Object { $_.Action -eq (T '删除') })
    $ack = ''
    if ($dels) {
        $text += (T "`n`n其中 {0} 项会删除文件，删除后可能无法恢复。请确认这些资料不再需要。") -f $dels.Count
        $careful = @($dels | Where-Object { $cat0[$_.Idx].Careful })
        if ($careful.Count -gt 0) { $text += (T "`n其中 {0} 项是「谨慎清理」（{1}）：删了要重新下载或重新生成，第一次打开会慢一点。不想清的，在列表里改成「跳过」。") -f $careful.Count, (@($careful | ForEach-Object { $_.Name }) -join (T '、')) }
        $conf = @($dels | Where-Object { ([string]$cat0[$_.Idx].G).StartsWith('需确认') })
        if ($conf.Count -gt 0) { $text += (T "`n其中 {0} 项是「需确认」的高风险项目（{1}），请再看一遍说明。") -f $conf.Count, (@($conf | ForEach-Object { $_.Name }) -join (T '、')) }
        if ((Get-Setting 'Recycle' '0') -eq '1') { $text += (T "`n按设置，这次删除的文件会先放进回收站，可以从回收站恢复。") }
        $ack = (T '我已确认要删除的内容不再需要，删除不会给我带来损失；因删除造成的后果由我自己承担。')
    }
    $kind = if ($dels) { 'warn' } else { 'info' }
    $btns = if ($dels) { @((T '取消'), (T '看文件清单'), (T '开始')) } else { @((T '取消'), (T '开始')) }
    while ($true) {
        $ans = Show-Sheet -Kind $kind -Title ((T "执行 {0} 项操作？") -f $plan.Count) -Text $text -Items $items -Buttons $btns -Primary (T '开始') -Cancel (T '取消') -Confirm $ack
        if ($ans -eq (T '看文件清单')) { Show-DeletePreview @($dels | ForEach-Object { $cat0[$_.Idx] }); continue }
        if ($ans -ne (T '开始')) { return }
        break
    }

    # 要搬聊天软件的数据时，先看它们是不是开着：开着的话文件被占用，搬不成功，必须先退出
    $skipped = @(); $skipWho = ''
    $chatMoves = @($moves | Where-Object { $cat0[$_.Idx].Apps })
    if ($chatMoves) {
        $need = @($chatMoves | ForEach-Object { $cat0[$_.Idx].Apps } | Select-Object -Unique)
        $busy = Get-BusyApps $need
        if ($busy.Count -gt 0) {
            $who = @($busy | ForEach-Object { T $_ }) -join (T '、')
            $affected = @($chatMoves | Where-Object { $x = $_; @($cat0[$x.Idx].Apps | Where-Object { $busy -contains $_ }).Count -gt 0 })
            $ans = Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title ((T "需要先退出{0}") -f $who) `
                -Text ((T "{0}正在使用要搬的文件夹。不退出的话里面的文件一直被占用，搬家不会成功。`n`n点「退出并继续」会替你关掉它们（包括右下角托盘里的）。退出前请确认没有正在发送或下载的文件。搬完后照常打开即可，聊天记录和文件都在。") -f $who) `
                -Items @($affected | ForEach-Object { $_.Name }) -Buttons @((T '取消'), (T '这次不搬这几项'), (T '退出并继续')) -Primary (T '退出并继续') -Cancel (T '取消')
            if ($ans -eq (T '取消')) { return }
            if ($ans -eq (T '这次不搬这几项')) {
                $skipIdx = @{}; foreach ($x in $affected) { $skipIdx[$x.Idx] = $true }
                $skipped = @($affected); $skipWho = $who
                $plan = @($plan | Where-Object { -not $skipIdx.ContainsKey($_.Idx) })
                $moves = @($moves | Where-Object { -not $skipIdx.ContainsKey($_.Idx) })
                UI-Log ((T "{0} 没有退出，这次不搬：{1}") -f $who, (($skipped | ForEach-Object { $_.Name }) -join (T '、')))
                if (-not $plan) { return }
            } else {
                UI-Log ((T "已同意退出 {0}，开始执行后会先关掉它们") -f $who)
            }
        }
    }
    # 搬家时还会关掉的其他程序（后台进程、从要搬的文件夹里运行的程序）：先说清楚，确认后后台只关这些
    $allowed = @()
    if ($moves) {
        $cp = Get-ClosePlan @($moves | ForEach-Object { $cat0[$_.Idx] }) @($moves | ForEach-Object { @($cat0[$_.Idx].Apps) } | Where-Object { $_ } | Select-Object -Unique)
        $agreed = @{}; if ($chatMoves -and $busy) { $defs = Get-ChatApps; foreach ($a in $busy) { foreach ($n in $cp.Names) { foreach ($pat in (@($defs[$a].P) + @($defs[$a].K))) { if ($pat -and $n -like $pat) { $agreed[$n] = $true } } } } }
        $extra = @($cp.Names | Where-Object { -not $agreed.ContainsKey($_) })
        $allowed = @($cp.Names)
        if ($extra.Count -gt 0) {
            $ans = Show-Sheet -Kind warn -Title (T '搬家时还要关掉这些程序') -Text ((T "这些程序正在使用要搬的文件夹：{0}。不关掉的话文件被占用，这几项搬不成。`n`n点「关掉并继续」会替你关掉它们，没保存的内容请先保存；点「不关」就先不碰它们，这几项复制好后会停在最后一步，下次再搬很快。") -f ($extra -join (T '、'))) `
                -Buttons @((T '取消'), (T '不关'), (T '关掉并继续')) -Primary (T '关掉并继续') -Cancel (T '取消')
            if ($ans -eq (T '取消')) { return }
            if ($ans -eq (T '不关')) { $allowed = @($cp.Names | Where-Object { $agreed.ContainsKey($_) }) }
        }
    }
    # 每一行先标「等待」，执行时由后台逐行改成 进行中 / 完成 / 失败
    $sync.Status = [hashtable]::Synchronized(@{}); $sync.StatusVer = 0; $script:statusSeen = -1; $sync.RunSummary = $null; $sync.WaitCount = 0
    $planned = @{}; foreach ($x in $plan) { $planned[$x.Idx] = $true }
    $skipSet = @{}; foreach ($x in $skipped) { $skipSet[$x.Idx] = $true }
    foreach ($r in $script:rows) {
        if ($planned.ContainsKey($r.Idx)) { $r.Status = (T '等待'); $r.StatusBrush = '#86868B' }
        elseif ($skipSet.ContainsKey($r.Idx)) { $r.Status = ((T "这次没搬：{0} 没有退出") -f $skipWho); $r.StatusBrush = '#B25000' }
        else { $r.Status = ''; $r.StatusBrush = '#86868B' }
    }
    $script:runFreeC0 = [double](FreeC)
    $script:runPlan = $plan
    $sync.Mode = 'run'; Start-Op $title; UI-Busy $true
    if ($moves) { UI-Log ((T "搬家目标：{0}") -f $dest) }
    UI-Log ((T "开始执行 {0} 项...") -f $plan.Count)
    Start-Worker @'
$plan = $arg.Plan; $dest = $arg.Dest
$cat = @{}; foreach ($it in (Get-Catalog)) { $cat[$it.Idx] = $it }
$ordered = @($plan | Where-Object { -not $cat[$_.Idx].Last }) + @($plan | Where-Object { $cat[$_.Idx].Last })
$si = 0
$summary = New-Object System.Collections.ArrayList
$handled = @{}
foreach ($p in $ordered) {
    if (Stopping) { break }
    $si++
    $it = $cat[$p.Idx]
    SetP @{ Steps = $ordered.Count; Step = $si; StepName = ("{0} {1}" -f $p.Action, $it.N); StepIdx = $p.Idx; StepNote = $it.Note; MoveItem = $false
            SubKind = 'none'; SubDone = [double]0; SubTotal = [double]$p.Bytes; SubStart = (Get-Date); Detail = '' }
    SetStatus $p.Idx (T '进行中…') 'run'
    Log ("[{0}] {1}" -f $p.Action, $it.N)
    $res = @{}
    try {
        if ($p.Action -eq (T '搬到其他盘')) {
            New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $dest -Force | Out-Null
            $it.Restrict = $true; $it.Allowed = @($arg.Allowed)
            Invoke-Move $it $dest $res
            if ($res.Wait -gt 0) { $sync.WaitCount = [int]$sync.WaitCount + $res.Wait }
            $rt = Move-ResultText $res; $t = $rt[0]; $k = $rt[1]
        } else {
            Invoke-Delete $it $res
            if ($res.Cancelled) { $t = (T "中途取消：清理了一部分，释放 {0}") -f (GB $res.Freed); $k = 'warn' }
            else {
                $t = if ($it.Act -and -not $it.Paths) { (T "已完成，释放 {0}") -f (GB $res.Freed) } else { (T "已清理，释放 {0}") -f (GB $res.Freed) }
                $k = 'ok'
            }
        }
    } catch { $t = (T "出错：") + $_.Exception.Message; $k = 'fail'; Log "  $t" }
    SetStatus $p.Idx $t $k
    $mark = switch ($k) { 'ok' { '✓' } 'warn' { '!' } 'fail' { '✗' } default { '·' } }
    [void]$summary.Add(((T "{0} {1}：{2}") -f $mark, $it.N, $t))
    $handled[$p.Idx] = $true
}
if ($sync.WasCancelled) {
    foreach ($p in $ordered) {
        if ($handled.ContainsKey($p.Idx)) { continue }
        SetStatus $p.Idx (T '已取消，没有处理') 'skip'
        [void]$summary.Add(((T "{0} {1}：{2}") -f '·', $cat[$p.Idx].N, (T '已取消，没有处理')))
    }
}
$sync.RunSummary = $summary
if ($sync.WasCancelled) { Log ((T "已中途取消。C 盘现在剩余 {0}") -f (GB (FreeC))) } else { Log ((T "全部完成。C 盘现在剩余 {0}") -f (GB (FreeC))) }
'@ @{ Plan = $plan; Dest = $dest; Allowed = $allowed }
}
$ctl.BtnRun.Add_Click({ Invoke-RunSelected })
# 删除前看清单：列出要删的文件和文件夹（最大的 60 个），完整清单写进一个文本文件
function Show-DeletePreview($items) {
    $list = $null
    try { $list = @(Get-DeletePreview $items 20000) } catch { $list = @() }
    $sorted = @($list | Sort-Object { $_.Bytes } -Descending)
    $tot = [double]0; foreach ($x in $sorted) { $tot += $x.Bytes }
    $lines = @($sorted | Select-Object -First 60 | ForEach-Object { "{0}  {1}{2}" -f (Fmt $_.Bytes), $_.Path, $(if ($_.IsDir) { (T '（整个文件夹）') } else { '' }) })
    $file = ''
    try {
        New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $script:opLogDir -Force | Out-Null
        $file = Join-Path $script:opLogDir ("preview-{0:yyyyMMdd-HHmmss}.txt" -f (Get-Date))
        $all = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string]
        $all.Add(((T "删除前的文件清单 {0:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm}，{1:N0} 项，共 {2}") -f (Get-Date), $sorted.Count, (Fmt $tot)))
        foreach ($x in $sorted) { $all.Add(("{0}`t{1}`t{2}`t{3}" -f [long]$x.Bytes, $(if ($x.IsDir) { 'D' } else { 'F' }), $x.Item, $x.Path)) }
        [IO.File]::WriteAllLines($file, $all.ToArray(), (New-Object Text.UTF8Encoding $true))
    } catch { $file = '' }
    $text = (T "按现在的选择会删掉 {0:N0} 项，共 {1}{2}。下面是最大的 {3} 项；整个文件夹的按文件夹算一项。") -f $sorted.Count, (Fmt $tot), $(if ($list.Count -ge 20000) { (T '（只看了前 20000 项）') } else { '' }), [math]::Min(60, $sorted.Count)
    if ($file) { $text += (T "`n完整清单已存到：{0}") -f $file }
    $b = if ($file) { @((T '打开完整清单'), (T '好')) } else { @((T '好')) }
    $ans = Show-Sheet -Title (T '删除前的文件清单') -Text $text -Items $lines -Buttons $b -Primary (T '好') -Cancel (T '好')
    if ($ans -eq (T '打开完整清单')) { try { Start-Process $file } catch {} }
}

# 一键清理：先扫描，扫完按 One 字段（没有就用默认）设好每一项，再走同一个执行流程（会弹确认框）
function Apply-OneClick {
    $cat = @{}; foreach ($it in $catalog) { $cat[$it.Idx] = $it }
    foreach ($r in $script:rows) {
        $it = $cat[$r.Idx]
        $want = if ($it.One) { $it.One } else { $it.Def }
        if ($r.Actions -contains $want) { $r.Action = $want }
    }
}
$script:oneClickPending = $false
$script:runAfterScan = $false
$ctl.BtnOneClick.Add_Click({
    Show-Page 'clean'
    $script:oneClickPending = $true
    UI-Log (T '一键清理：先扫描...')
    Do-Scan
})

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 第二页：重复文件
# ------------------------------------------------------------
$script:roots = New-Object 'System.Collections.ObjectModel.ObservableCollection[RootItem]'
$ctl.Roots.ItemsSource = $script:roots

function Add-Root($path, $label, $on, $detail, [bool]$removable = $false) {
    if (-not $path) { return }
    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $path)) { return }
    foreach ($r in $script:roots) { if ($r.Path -ieq $path) { return } }
    $ri = New-Object RootItem
    $ri.Path = $path; $ri.Label = $label; $ri.Enabled = [bool]$on
    $ri.Detail = if ($detail) { $detail } else { $path }
    $ri.Removable = $removable
    $script:roots.Add($ri)
}

$downloads = (Get-ItemProperty 'HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\User Shell Folders' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).'{374DE290-123F-4565-9164-39C4925E467B}'
if ($downloads) { $downloads = [Environment]::ExpandEnvironmentVariables($downloads) } else { $downloads = "$env:USERPROFILE\Downloads" }
foreach ($pair in @(
    @((T '桌面'), [Environment]::GetFolderPath('Desktop')),
    @((T '文档'), [Environment]::GetFolderPath('MyDocuments')),
    @((T '下载'), $downloads),
    @((T '图片'), [Environment]::GetFolderPath('MyPictures')),
    @((T '视频'), [Environment]::GetFolderPath('MyVideos')),
    @((T '音乐'), [Environment]::GetFolderPath('MyMusic')))) {
    Add-Root $pair[1] $pair[0] $true $pair[1]
}
foreach ($d in [System.IO.DriveInfo]::GetDrives()) {
    try {
        if ($d.DriveType -eq 'Fixed' -and $d.IsReady -and ($d.Name.TrimEnd('\') -ine $env:SystemDrive)) {
            Add-Root $d.RootDirectory.FullName ((T "整个 {0} 盘") -f $d.Name.Substring(0, 1)) $true ((T "{0}  已用 {1}") -f $d.Name, (Fmt ($d.TotalSize - $d.TotalFreeSpace)))
        }
    } catch {}
}

# ---------- 颜色工具 ----------
function Brush([string]$hex, [string]$role = 'f') { New-Object System.Windows.Media.SolidColorBrush ([System.Windows.Media.Color][System.Windows.Media.ColorConverter]::ConvertFromString([Theme]::Map($hex, [char]$role))) }
function Tint([string]$hex, [double]$a) {
    # 把颜色和底色按比例混合，得到选中状态用的淡底色（深色模式和深色卡片混合）
    [Theme]::Tint($hex, $a)
}

# ---------- 文件类型：每类一个颜色，结果列表里用同一个颜色标出文件类型 ----------
$script:typeDefs = @(
    @{ L = (T 'Word 文档');  C = '#2B579A'; E = '.doc .docx .docm .dot .dotx .wps .rtf .odt' }
    @{ L = (T 'Excel 表格'); C = '#217346'; E = '.xls .xlsx .xlsm .xlsb .csv .et .ods' }
    @{ L = (T 'PPT 演示');   C = '#C43E1C'; E = '.ppt .pptx .pptm .pps .ppsx .dps .odp .key' }
    @{ L = 'PDF';        C = '#B30B00'; E = '.pdf .ofd .caj .xps' }
    @{ L = (T '文本');       C = '#5B6573'; E = '.txt .md .markdown .rst' }
    @{ L = (T '电子书');     C = '#8A5A2B'; E = '.epub .mobi .azw .azw3 .djvu' }
    @{ L = (T '照片图片');   C = '#0F8A7E'; E = '.jpg .jpeg .png .gif .bmp .heic .heif .webp .tif .tiff .svg' }
    @{ L = (T 'RAW 原片');   C = '#5C7F1A'; E = '.raw .cr2 .cr3 .nef .arw .dng .orf .rw2 .raf .srw' }
    @{ L = (T '设计稿');     C = '#7A3FC2'; E = '.psd .psb .ai .sketch .fig .xd .cdr .indd' }
    @{ L = (T 'CAD 图纸');   C = '#0B6E99'; E = '.dwg .dxf .step .stp .igs .iges .sldprt .sldasm .slddrw .prt .asm .x_t .x_b .stl .3mf .ipt .iam .catpart .catproduct' }
    @{ L = (T '视频');       C = '#B4235A'; E = '.mp4 .mov .avi .mkv .wmv .flv .m4v .ts .webm .mpg .mpeg .3gp .rmvb' }
    @{ L = (T '音频');       C = '#C27C0E'; E = '.mp3 .wav .flac .m4a .aac .ogg .wma .ape .opus' }
    @{ L = (T '压缩包');     C = '#6B4F3A'; E = '.zip .rar .7z .tar .gz .tgz .bz2 .xz .zst' }
    @{ L = (T '安装包');     C = '#3B4A63'; E = '.exe .msi .msix .appx .apk .dmg .pkg' }
    @{ L = (T '磁盘镜像');   C = '#5B4B8A'; E = '.iso .img .vhd .vhdx .vmdk .wim .esd' }
)
$script:extColor = @{}
foreach ($d in $script:typeDefs) { foreach ($e in ($d.E -split '\s+')) { $script:extColor[$e] = $d.C } }

$chipStyle  = $win.FindResource('Chip')
$radioStyle = $win.FindResource('Seg')
$script:chips = New-Object System.Collections.ArrayList
$script:typeSync = $false
$script:sizeSync = $false

function New-Chip([string]$label, [string]$color, [string]$tip) {
    $b = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.Primitives.ToggleButton
    $b.Content = $label; $b.Style = $chipStyle; $b.ToolTip = $tip
    return $b
}

function Parse-ExtraExt {
    $out = New-Object System.Collections.ArrayList
    foreach ($t in ([string]$ctl.ExtraExt.Text -split '[\s,，;；、]+')) {
        $t = $t.Trim().ToLowerInvariant()
        if (-not $t) { continue }
        if ($t.StartsWith('*')) { $t = $t.Substring(1) }
        if (-not $t.StartsWith('.')) { $t = '.' + $t }
        if ($t -match '^\.[a-z0-9_\-\+]{1,12}$') { [void]$out.Add($t) }
    }
    return ,$out
}
function Any-TypeChip { foreach ($c in $script:chips) { if ($c.Btn.IsChecked) { return $true } }; return $false }

function Reset-Types {
    foreach ($c in $script:chips) { $c.Btn.IsChecked = $false }
    $script:typeSync = $true; $ctl.ExtraExt.Text = ''; $script:typeSync = $false
    $script:typeAll.IsChecked = $true
    Update-FilterSummary
}

# 「全部类型」和具体类型互斥：选了具体类型就取消「全部」，具体类型都取消了就回到「全部」
function Sync-TypeChips($src) {
    $nothing = (-not (Any-TypeChip)) -and ((Parse-ExtraExt).Count -eq 0)
    if ([object]::ReferenceEquals($src, $script:typeAll)) {
        if ($script:typeAll.IsChecked) { Reset-Types; return }
        if ($nothing) { $script:typeAll.IsChecked = $true }
    } else {
        if ($src.IsChecked) { $script:typeAll.IsChecked = $false }
        elseif ($nothing) { $script:typeAll.IsChecked = $true }
    }
    Update-FilterSummary
}

function Get-SelectedExt {
    if ($script:typeAll.IsChecked) { return $null }
    $set = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string]
    foreach ($c in $script:chips) { if ($c.Btn.IsChecked) { foreach ($e in $c.Ext) { $set.Add($e) } } }
    foreach ($e in (Parse-ExtraExt)) { $set.Add($e) }
    return ,$set.ToArray()
}

$script:typeAll = New-Chip (T '全部类型') '#1C2433' (T '不限文件类型')
$script:typeAll.IsChecked = $true
[void]$ctl.TypeChips.Children.Add($script:typeAll)
$script:typeAll.Add_Click({ Sync-TypeChips $this })
foreach ($d in $script:typeDefs) {
    $b = New-Chip $d.L $d.C ($d.E -replace ' ', '  ')
    [void]$ctl.TypeChips.Children.Add($b)
    [void]$script:chips.Add(@{ Btn = $b; Ext = [string[]]($d.E -split '\s+'); Label = $d.L })
    $b.Add_Click({ Sync-TypeChips $this })
}
$ctl.TypeReset.Add_Click({ Reset-Types })
$ctl.ExtraExt.Add_TextChanged({
    if ($script:typeSync) { return }
    if ((Parse-ExtraExt).Count -gt 0) { $script:typeAll.IsChecked = $false }
    elseif (-not (Any-TypeChip)) { $script:typeAll.IsChecked = $true }
    Update-FilterSummary
})

# ---------- 文件大小：常用区间一键选，也可以手填「从…到…」 ----------
$script:sizeDefs = @(
    @{ L = (T '不限');          Min = 0;     Max = 0 }
    @{ L = (T '1 MB 以上');     Min = 1MB;   Max = 0 }
    @{ L = '1–10 MB';       Min = 1MB;   Max = 10MB }
    @{ L = '10–100 MB';     Min = 10MB;  Max = 100MB }
    @{ L = '100 MB–1 GB';   Min = 100MB; Max = 1GB }
    @{ L = (T '1 GB 以上');     Min = 1GB;   Max = 0 }
)
$script:sizeRadios = New-Object System.Collections.ArrayList

function Set-SizeBox($box, $unit, [double]$bytes) {
    if ($bytes -le 0) { $box.Text = ''; return }
    if (($bytes % 1GB) -eq 0)     { $unit.SelectedIndex = 2; $box.Text = [string]($bytes / 1GB) }
    elseif (($bytes % 1MB) -eq 0) { $unit.SelectedIndex = 1; $box.Text = [string]($bytes / 1MB) }
    else                          { $unit.SelectedIndex = 0; $box.Text = [string][math]::Round($bytes / 1KB, 1) }
}
function Apply-SizePreset($btn) {
    foreach ($r in $script:sizeRadios) {
        if ([object]::ReferenceEquals($r.Btn, $btn)) {
            $script:sizeSync = $true
            Set-SizeBox $ctl.SizeMin $ctl.SizeMinUnit $r.Min
            Set-SizeBox $ctl.SizeMax $ctl.SizeMaxUnit $r.Max
            $script:sizeSync = $false
        }
    }
    $ctl.SizeCustomRow.Visibility = 'Collapsed'
    Update-FilterSummary
}
function Read-SizeBox($box, $unit) {
    $t = ([string]$box.Text).Trim()
    if (-not $t) { return [double]0 }
    $v = [double]0
    if (-not [double]::TryParse($t, [Globalization.NumberStyles]::Float, [Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture, [ref]$v) -or $v -lt 0) { return $null }
    return $v * @(1KB, 1MB, 1GB)[[math]::Max(0, $unit.SelectedIndex)]
}
function Get-SizeRange {
    $min = Read-SizeBox $ctl.SizeMin $ctl.SizeMinUnit
    $max = Read-SizeBox $ctl.SizeMax $ctl.SizeMaxUnit
    if ($null -eq $min -or $null -eq $max) { return @{ Ok = $false; Err = (T '大小只能填数字，比如 1.5') } }
    if ($max -gt 0 -and $max -lt $min) { return @{ Ok = $false; Err = (T '「到」要比「从」大') } }
    return @{ Ok = $true; Min = $min; Max = $max }
}
function Size-Text([double]$b) {
    $inv = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture
    if ($b -ge 1GB)     { ($b / 1GB).ToString('0.##', $inv) + ' GB' }
    elseif ($b -ge 1MB) { ($b / 1MB).ToString('0.##', $inv) + ' MB' }
    elseif ($b -ge 1KB) { ($b / 1KB).ToString('0.##', $inv) + ' KB' }
    else { "$([int]$b) B" }
}
function On-SizeEdited {
    if ($script:sizeSync) { return }
    $script:sizeCustom.IsChecked = $true
    Update-FilterSummary
}

foreach ($d in $script:sizeDefs) {
    $rb = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.RadioButton
    $rb.Content = $d.L; $rb.GroupName = 'dupsize'; $rb.Style = $radioStyle
    [void]$ctl.SizeChips.Children.Add($rb)
    [void]$script:sizeRadios.Add(@{ Btn = $rb; Min = [double]$d.Min; Max = [double]$d.Max })
    $rb.Add_Click({ Apply-SizePreset $this })
}
$script:sizeCustom = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.RadioButton
$script:sizeCustom.Content = (T '自定义'); $script:sizeCustom.GroupName = 'dupsize'; $script:sizeCustom.Style = $radioStyle
[void]$ctl.SizeChips.Children.Add($script:sizeCustom)
$script:sizeCustom.Add_Click({ $ctl.SizeCustomRow.Visibility = 'Visible'; [void]$ctl.SizeMin.Focus(); Update-FilterSummary })
foreach ($c in @($ctl.SizeMin, $ctl.SizeMax)) { $c.Add_TextChanged({ On-SizeEdited }) }
foreach ($c in @($ctl.SizeMinUnit, $ctl.SizeMaxUnit)) { $c.Add_SelectionChanged({ On-SizeEdited }) }

# ---------- 条件摘要：收起面板后也能看到当前条件 ----------
function Update-FilterSummary {
    if ($null -eq $script:typeAll -or $null -eq $script:sizeCustom) { return }
    if ($ctl.ModeSimilar.IsChecked) { $types = (T '相似照片') }
    elseif ($script:typeAll.IsChecked) { $types = (T '全部类型') }
    else {
        $names = @($script:chips | Where-Object { $_.Btn.IsChecked } | ForEach-Object { $_.Label })
        $extra = Parse-ExtraExt
        if ($extra.Count -gt 0) { $names += ($extra -join ' ') }
        $types = if ($names.Count -gt 3) { ($names[0..2] -join (T '、')) + ((T " 等 {0} 类") -f $($names.Count)) } else { $names -join (T '、') }
    }
    $r = Get-SizeRange
    if (-not $r.Ok) { $size = (T '大小填写有误') }
    elseif ($r.Min -le 1 -and $r.Max -le 0) { $size = (T '不限大小') }
    elseif ($r.Max -le 0) { $size = (Size-Text $r.Min) + (T ' 以上') }
    elseif ($r.Min -le 1) { $size = (Size-Text $r.Max) + (T ' 以下') }
    else { $size = (T "{0} 到 {1}") -f (Size-Text $r.Min), (Size-Text $r.Max) }
    $ctl.SizeHint.Text = if ($r.Ok) { (T '留空表示不限') } else { $r.Err }
    $ctl.SizeHint.Foreground = if ($r.Ok) { Brush '#86868B' } else { Brush '#D70015' }
    $mode = if ($ctl.ModeName.IsChecked) { (T '文件名和内容都相同') } else { (T '只要内容相同') }
    $mode += if ($ctl.SpeedExact.IsChecked) { (T '，完整比对') } else { (T '，快速比对') }
    $n = @($script:roots | Where-Object { $_.Enabled }).Count
    $ctl.FilterSummary.Text = (T "{0}，{1}，{2}，{3} 个位置") -f $types, $size, $mode, $n
}
foreach ($c in @($ctl.ModeName, $ctl.ModeContent, $ctl.SpeedFast, $ctl.SpeedExact)) { $c.Add_Click({ Update-FilterSummary }) }
# 点胶囊 = 勾选/取消；点自己加的文件夹上的小叉 = 移除
$ctl.Roots.AddHandler([System.Windows.Controls.Primitives.ButtonBase]::ClickEvent, [System.Windows.RoutedEventHandler]{
    param($s, $e)
    $src = $e.OriginalSource
    if ($src -is [System.Windows.Controls.Button] -and $src.Tag -is [RootItem]) { [void]$script:roots.Remove($src.Tag) }
    Update-FilterSummary
})

# 默认：全部类型，1 MB 以上
$script:sizeRadios[1].Btn.IsChecked = $true
Apply-SizePreset $script:sizeRadios[1].Btn

$ctl.BtnAddRoot.Add_Click({
    $dlg = New-Object System.Windows.Forms.FolderBrowserDialog
    $dlg.Description = (T '选择要查找重复文件的文件夹')
    if ($dlg.ShowDialog() -eq [System.Windows.Forms.DialogResult]::OK) {
        $sp = $dlg.SelectedPath; $nm = Split-Path $sp -Leaf; if (-not $nm) { $nm = $sp }
        Add-Root $sp $nm $true $sp $true; Update-FilterSummary
    }
})

function Build-DupRows($groups, [int]$totalGroups) {
    $protectOn = [bool]$ctl.DupProtect.IsChecked
    $col = New-Object 'System.Collections.ObjectModel.ObservableCollection[DupRow]'
    $byGroup = @{}
    $kept = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[DupGroup]
    $gid = 0; $waste = [double]0
    foreach ($g in $groups) {
        if ($g.Files.Count -lt 2) { continue }
        $gid++
        if ($gid -gt 3000) { break }
        $kept.Add($g)
        $meta  = (T "{0} × {1} 份，可释放 {2}") -f (Fmt $g.Size), $g.Files.Count, (Fmt $g.Waste)
        if ($g.Verified) { $badge = (T '已完整比对'); $tip = (T '每个文件都读完了全部内容，内容完全相同。'); $bbg = '#E6F4EA'; $bfg = '#1E7B34' }
        else { $badge = (T '抽样判定'); $tip = (T '文件名、大小和 16 处抽样内容都相同。删除前会逐字节完整比对，有任何不同就不删。'); $bbg = '#EFEFF4'; $bfg = '#6E6E73' }
        $list = New-Object System.Collections.ArrayList
        foreach ($f in $g.Files) {
            $r = New-Object DupRow
            $r.GroupId = $gid; $r.GroupName = $g.Name; $r.GroupMeta = $meta; $r.Verified = $g.Verified
            $r.GroupBadge = $badge; $r.GroupBadgeTip = $tip; $r.GroupBadgeBg = $bbg; $r.GroupBadgeFg = $bfg
            $r.Path = $f.Path; $r.Size = $f.Size
            $r.Dir = [IO.Path]::GetDirectoryName($f.Path).TrimEnd('\') + '\'; $r.FileName = [IO.Path]::GetFileName($f.Path)
            $r.Modified = $f.Modified.ToString('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm'); $r.ModifiedTicks = $f.Modified.Ticks
            $r.Risk = $f.Risk; $r.HasRisk = -not [string]::IsNullOrEmpty($f.Risk)
            $r.Protected = Test-Personal $f.Path
            $r.CanDelete = -not ($protectOn -and $r.Protected)
            $fx = [IO.Path]::GetExtension($f.Path).ToLowerInvariant()
            $r.TypeBrush = if ($script:extColor.ContainsKey($fx)) { $script:extColor[$fx] } else { '#C7C7CC' }
            $col.Add($r); [void]$list.Add($r)
        }
        $byGroup[$gid] = $list
        $waste += $g.Waste
    }
    $script:dupRows = $col; $script:dupByGroup = $byGroup; $script:dupGroups = $kept; $script:dupWaste = $waste
    $ctl.DupList.ItemsSource = $col
    $ctl.EmptyDup.Visibility = if ($col.Count -gt 0) { 'Collapsed' } else { 'Visible' }
    $ctl.EmptyDupText.Text = (T '没有找到重复文件')
    $view = [System.Windows.Data.CollectionViewSource]::GetDefaultView($col)
    $view.GroupDescriptions.Clear()
    $view.GroupDescriptions.Add((New-Object System.Windows.Data.PropertyGroupDescription 'GroupId'))
    if ($totalGroups -gt 3000) { UI-Log ((T "一共找到 {0} 组，只显示可释放空间最大的前 3000 组。删完这些后再查一次即可看到剩下的。") -f $totalGroups) }
    [DupRow]::Dirty = $false
    Update-DupSummary
}

function Update-DupSummary {
    if (-not $script:dupRows) { $ctl.DupSummary.Text = ''; $ctl.BtnDupDelete.IsEnabled = $false; $ctl.BtnDupMove.IsEnabled = $false; return }
    $n = 0; $b = [double]0
    foreach ($r in $script:dupRows) { if ($r.ToDelete) { $n++; $b += $r.Size } }
    $locked = 0; foreach ($r in $script:dupRows) { if (-not $r.CanDelete) { $locked++ } }
    if ($script:dupRows.Count -eq 0) { $ctl.DupSummary.Text = (T '没有找到重复文件。') }
    else {
        $ctl.DupSummary.Text = ((T "找到 {0} 组重复文件。已勾选 {1} 个，删除后释放 {2}。") -f $script:dupByGroup.Count, $n, (Fmt $b))
        if ($locked -gt 0) { $ctl.DupSummary.Text += ((T " C 盘个人文件夹里的 {0} 个副本受保护，不会删。") -f $locked) }
    }
    $ctl.BtnDupDelete.IsEnabled = ($n -gt 0) -and (-not $script:worker); $ctl.BtnDupMove.IsEnabled = $ctl.BtnDupDelete.IsEnabled
    $ctl.BtnDupMerge.IsEnabled = ($n -gt 0) -and (-not $script:worker)
}

# 每组只留一份，其余全部勾选删除
#   new：留最新的   old：留最早的   c：优先留不在 C 盘上的那份（有多份时留其中最新的）   none：全部取消
function Pick-Dup([string]$mode) {
    foreach ($gid in @($script:dupByGroup.Keys)) {
        $rows = @($script:dupByGroup[$gid])
        if ($mode -eq 'none') { foreach ($r in $rows) { $r.ToDelete = $false }; continue }
        # 受保护的副本（C 盘个人文件夹里的）一律保留；有它在，这一组就已经留了一份
        $locked = @($rows | Where-Object { -not $_.CanDelete })
        if ($locked.Count -gt 0) {
            foreach ($r in $rows) {
                if (-not $r.CanDelete) { $r.ToDelete = $false; continue }
                # 「优先留 C 盘以外的」只删 C 盘上的；其他留法删掉所有能删的
                $onC = $r.Path.StartsWith("$env:SystemDrive\", [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                $r.ToDelete = if ($mode -eq 'c') { $onC } else { $true }
            }
            continue
        }
        $pool = $rows
        if ($mode -eq 'c') {
            $notC = @($rows | Where-Object { -not $_.Path.StartsWith("$env:SystemDrive\", [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase) })
            if ($notC.Count -gt 0) { $pool = $notC }
        }
        elseif ($mode -eq 'in' -and $script:keepInDir) {
            $inside = @($rows | Where-Object { $_.Path.StartsWith($script:keepInDir, [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase) })
            if ($inside.Count -gt 0) { $pool = $inside }
        }
        $keep = if ($mode -eq 'short') { @($pool | Sort-Object { $_.Path.Length }, { $_.Path })[0] } else { @($pool | Sort-Object ModifiedTicks -Descending:($mode -ne 'old'))[0] }
        foreach ($r in $rows) { $r.ToDelete = -not [object]::ReferenceEquals($r, $keep) }
    }
    [DupRow]::Dirty = $false
    Update-DupSummary
}
# 「不删 C 盘个人文件夹里的文件」：默认打开；关掉要先确认
$script:protSync = $false
function Apply-Protect {
    $on = [bool]$ctl.DupProtect.IsChecked
    if ($script:dupRows) {
        foreach ($r in $script:dupRows) {
            $r.CanDelete = -not ($on -and $r.Protected)
            if (-not $r.CanDelete) { $r.ToDelete = $false }
        }
    }
    [DupRow]::Dirty = $false
    Update-DupSummary
}
$ctl.DupProtect.Add_Checked({ if (-not $script:protSync) { Apply-Protect; UI-Log (T '已打开保护：C 盘个人文件夹里的文件不会删除') } })
$ctl.DupProtect.Add_Unchecked({
    if ($script:protSync) { return }
    $ans = Show-Sheet -Kind danger -Title (T '允许删除 C 盘个人文件夹里的文件？') `
        -Text (T '桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频、音乐等文件夹里通常是你自己的资料。关掉保护后，这些位置的重复副本也可能被勾选删除。每组仍会至少保留一份。') `
        -Confirm (T '我已确认删除这些位置的副本不会给我带来损失；因删除造成的后果由我自己承担。') -Buttons @((T '保持保护'), (T '允许删除')) -Primary (T '允许删除') -Cancel (T '保持保护')
    if ($ans -ne (T '允许删除')) { $script:protSync = $true; $ctl.DupProtect.IsChecked = $true; $script:protSync = $false; return }
    Apply-Protect
    UI-Log (T '已关闭保护：C 盘个人文件夹里的重复副本也可以勾选删除（勾选不会自动改变，需要时点「留最新的」等重新勾选）')
})

$ctl.BtnKeepNew.Add_Click({ Pick-Dup 'new' })
$ctl.BtnKeepOld.Add_Click({ Pick-Dup 'old' })
$ctl.BtnPickC.Add_Click({ Pick-Dup 'c' })
$ctl.BtnKeepShort.Add_Click({ Pick-Dup 'short' })
$script:keepInDir = ''
$ctl.BtnKeepIn.Add_Click({
    $dlg = New-Object System.Windows.Forms.FolderBrowserDialog
    $dlg.Description = (T '每组优先保留这个文件夹（含子文件夹）里的那份')
    if ($script:keepInDir) { $dlg.SelectedPath = $script:keepInDir }
    if ($dlg.ShowDialog() -ne [System.Windows.Forms.DialogResult]::OK) { return }
    $script:keepInDir = $dlg.SelectedPath.TrimEnd('\') + '\'
    Pick-Dup 'in'
    UI-Log ((T "每组优先保留 {0} 里的那份") -f $script:keepInDir)
})
$ctl.BtnPickNone.Add_Click({ Pick-Dup 'none' })

# 「打开位置」按钮：在资源管理器里选中这个文件
$ctl.DupList.AddHandler([System.Windows.Controls.Primitives.ButtonBase]::ClickEvent, [System.Windows.RoutedEventHandler]{
